const char str_08357000[] = "Manna really knows how to \r\ntalk, doesn't she?\x05";
const char str_08357030[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08357038[] = "SCR CODEL";
const char str_08357090[] = "STR %";
const char str_083570A0[] = "Jeff is so easy to fool!...\x05";
const char str_083570C0[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083570C8[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083574BE[] = "  JUMP ";
const char str_083574E8[] = "STR ";
const char str_08357518[] = "Hmm....\x05";
const char str_08357521[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_08357529[] = "!.  \r\nI was just puzzling over \r\na problem...\x05";
const char str_08357558[] = "You see, a long time ago I \r\nwrote a book on Mushrooms. \x05";
const char str_08357592[] = "I just received a letter \r\nfrom someone who \r\nmisunderstood the book and \x05\r\naccidentally ate a poison \r\none! They lived, thank \r\ngoodness...\x05";
const char str_08357620[] = "In their letter, the person \r\nblames me for their own \r\nerror. \x05";
const char str_08357661[] = "What do you think I \r\nshould do?\x05";
const char str_08357683[] = "Explain their error.";
const char str_08357698[] = "Apologize.";
const char str_083576A3[] = "You're right. I should help \r\nthem understand better. \x05";
const char str_083576DB[] = "Thanks, ";
const char str_083576E4[] = "!. \r\nNow I feel more confident\r\nin myself. Now to that \r\nletter...\x05";
const char str_08357728[] = "You think so...?\r\nMaybe I should have written\r\nit more clearly, after \x05\r\nall...!\x05";
const char str_0835777A[] = "Now I feel horrible.\r\nWill you leave me alone\r\nnow please? \x05";
const char str_083577B8[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083577C0[] = "SCR CODE|";
const char str_08357848[] = "STR ";
const char str_0835785C[] = "Thanks for helping me be \r\nconfident in myself. Now I \r\nhave to write the letter.\x05";
const char str_083578AF[] = "I think I need to be\r\nalone now. \r\n\x05";
const char str_083578D8[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083578E0[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083578F7[] = "#D#P!";
const char str_08357987[] = "#\x07#D#d#\x01!\x02";
const char str_08357C80[] = "STR \x07\x02";
const char str_08357CBC[] = "Congratulations!\x05";
const char str_08357CCE[] = "Congratulations, Dad!\x05";
const char str_08357CE5[] = "That's really great...\x05";
const char str_08357CFD[] = "Ha ha ha...Thank you, \r\neveryone. \x05";
const char str_08357D21[] = "Hi there, ";
const char str_08357D2C[] = "!.\r\nCome on in. \x05";
const char str_08357D3E[] = "Listen to this, \r\n";
const char str_08357D51[] = "!.\r\nOne of my dad's books won\x05\r\na huge award!\x05";
const char str_08357D80[] = "Well, it's not all that \r\nprestigious...\x05";
const char str_08357DAA[] = "That's not true. \r\nIt's a big deal. We're \r\nall very proud. \x05";
const char str_08357DE8[] = "Exactly! We're all \r\nproud of you, Dad.\x05";
const char str_08357E11[] = "Thank you for saying so. \x05";
const char str_08357E2C[] = "I'm ready to fall in love\r\nwith you all over again, \r\ndear!\x05";
const char str_08357E69[] = "Now I'm getting all\r\nembarrassed...!\x05";
const char str_08357E90[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08357E98[] = "SCR CODEH";
const char str_08357EEA[] = "  STR 4";
const char str_08357EFC[] = "It's all thanks to \r\nmy family, you know. \x05";
const char str_08357F28[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08357F30[] = "SCR CODEH";
const char str_08357F94[] = "I'm so proud of you, Dad.\r\nNow I have to do even \r\nbetter on my novel!\x05";
const char str_08357FDC[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08357FE4[] = "SCR CODEH";
const char str_08358036[] = "  STR 6";
const char str_08358048[] = "I'm so proud to have \r\nsuch a smart husband!\x05";
const char str_08358078[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08358080[] = "SCR CODEX";
const char str_083580F8[] = "Basil really is such \r\na genius! \x05";
const char str_0835811B[] = "I'm glad to have someone \r\nlike that in my own family!\x05";
const char str_08358154[] = "RIFF";
const char str_0835815C[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083581D6[] = "#\t#X#x#\x03!\x02";
const char str_083581F6[] = "#x#x#\x02!";
const char str_08358658[] = "JUMP ";
const char str_08358680[] = "STR ";
const char str_083586E0[] = "...and then what do you\r\nput in? \x05";
const char str_08358703[] = "You put in...\r\n...then you use the...\x05";
const char str_0835872A[] = "I never would have\r\nthought of that!...\x05";
const char str_08358753[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_08358758[] = "!.\r\nCome on in. \x05";
const char str_0835876A[] = "Hi there, ";
const char str_0835877A[] = "What were we doing? \r\nAnna was just teaching me\r\nhow to make desserts. \x05";
const char str_083587C3[] = "She's famous for her \r\ndesserts, you know. \x05";
const char str_083587F0[] = "Oh, stop flattering me, \r\nManna!...\x05";
const char str_08358815[] = "It's true! \r\nYou cook too, don't you, \r\n";
const char str_08358842[] = "In that case, you should \r\nlearn from Anna, too!\x05";
const char str_08358874[] = "Learn.";
const char str_0835887B[] = "Sorry, I'm too busy.";
const char str_08358890[] = "Really? \r\nI'd be glad to teach you!\x05";
const char str_083588B5[] = "In that case, both of you \r\nlisten to this simple and \r\neasy Cake recipe. \x05";
const char str_08358901[] = "Ingredients are Eggs, Flour,\r\nand Butter. \x05";
const char str_0835892D[] = "Seasoning is Sugar, of \r\ncourse. \r\nFirst, mix the Egg and \x05\r\nButter with a Whisk, then\r\nadd Flour and put it all in\r\nthe Oven. \x05";
const char str_083589AE[] = "Not too hard, is it?\r\nYou can also add all kinds\r\nof fruit to make it even \x05\r\nbetter. Or, you can add \r\nChocolate to make it a \r\nChocolate Cake!\x05";
const char str_08358A40[] = "Can you teach me \r\nanything else?\x05";
const char str_08358A63[] = "How about this...\r\nCome back again at this same\r\ntime and I'll teach you a \x05\r\nnew dish. \x05";
const char str_08358ABD[] = "It'll be a miniature cooking\r\nschool!\x05";
const char str_08358AE4[] = "Really? That sounds great! \x05";
const char str_08358B01[] = "Sure! I'd love to!\x05";
const char str_08358B15[] = "You'll come too, won't \r\nyou ";
const char str_08358B37[] = "Aww...You're no fun!\r\nDon't you know that women \r\nlove a man who knows\x05\r\nhow to cook?\x05";
const char str_08358B8E[] = "I'm sure he's busy, Manna. \r\nIt's tough running a farm \r\nall by yourself, after all! \x05";
const char str_08358BE5[] = "I'll teach you, instead. \x05";
const char str_08358C00[] = "How about a recipe for a\r\nCake, then? Duke loves \r\nCake...\x05";
const char str_08358C3C[] = "OK. First you...\x05";
const char str_08358C50[] = "RIFF\x07\r";
const char str_08358C58[] = "SCR CODEp\x05";
const char str_08358CD2[] = "#\t#X#x#\x03!\x02";
const char str_08358CF2[] = "#x#x#\x02!";
const char str_083591D4[] = "JUMP8";
const char str_08359214[] = "STR ;\x07";
const char str_0835926C[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_08359271[] = "!. \r\nCome on in. \x05";
const char str_08359284[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_08359291[] = "Are we ready to \r\nbegin the class? \x05";
const char str_083592B6[] = "Yes, Teacher. \r\nPlease begin!\x05";
const char str_083592D5[] = "Listen up, now...\x05";
const char str_083592E8[] = "Today's class will be on \r\nCookies. All of you who \r\nlike sweets will love this.\x05";
const char str_0835933A[] = "The Ingredients are Egg, \r\nFlour, Butter, and Sugar.\x05";
const char str_08359370[] = "You also need a Rolling Pin\r\nand an Oven. \x05";
const char str_0835939C[] = "It will also taste better \r\nif you add Honey. \x05";
const char str_083593CC[] = "Also, if you add Chocolate,\r\nyou can make Chocolate\r\nCookies that are perfect\x05\r\nfor the Spring \r\nThanksgiving Festival. \x05";
const char str_08359446[] = "Thank you, Teacher!\x05";
const char str_0835945B[] = "Don't mention it. \r\nUntil next time. \x05";
const char str_08359482[] = "I think Pudding is a good \r\nsubject for today's class. \x05";
const char str_083594BB[] = "All you need is Egg, Milk, \r\nSugar, and an Oven to \r\ncook it all in. \x05";
const char str_08359502[] = "They taste even better with\r\nFruit or Corn Flakes. \r\nTry it out!\x05";
const char str_08359544[] = "Today's lesson will be on \r\nCheese Cake. \r\nQuite a sophisticated \x05\r\ndessert, don't you think?\x05";
const char str_083595A3[] = "It's made with Cheese, \r\nEggs, and Milk, along with \r\nSugar to sweeten it. \x05";
const char str_083595F0[] = "You'll need a Pot, a Whisk,\r\nand an Oven. \x05";
const char str_0835961C[] = "You can also add Honey \r\non special occasions. \x05";
const char str_0835964D[] = "Today's lesson will be on \r\nApple Pie. \x05";
const char str_08359676[] = "I know that Ellen likes \r\nthis recipe very well. \x05";
const char str_083596A9[] = "She'll love it if you \r\nbring her some. \x05";
const char str_083596D3[] = "Ingredients are Egg, Flour,\r\nand Butter. \r\nYou'll need a Knife, a Pot,\x05\r\na Rolling Pin, and an Oven.\x05";
const char str_08359739[] = "It's not easy, but it's \r\nvery delicious. \x05";
const char str_08359765[] = "I'm afraid next time will be\r\nour final lesson. \x05";
const char str_08359797[] = "Really? Why?\x05";
const char str_083597A5[] = "Yes, Basil is starting \r\nanother book, so I don't\r\nwant to disturb him.\x05";
const char str_083597EE[] = "That's too bad...\r\n\x05";
const char str_08359803[] = "Sorry, ";
const char str_0835980B[] = "!, \r\nbut that's all I can teach\r\nyou. \x05";
const char str_08359833[] = "Our final lesson will be on \r\nIce Cream. \r\nEverybody loves Ice Cream. \x05";
const char str_0835987B[] = "You'll need Milk, Egg, \r\nand of course Sugar. \x05";
const char str_083598AB[] = "You'll also need a Pot \r\nand a Whisk. \x05";
const char str_083598D3[] = "All children love this!\x05";
const char str_083598EC[] = "That's it for my Dessert \r\nClassroom. \x05";
const char str_08359914[] = "Don't mention it. I'm \r\nglad to be able to share\r\nthese recipes. \x05";
const char str_08359958[] = "RIFFC\x06";
const char str_08359960[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_08359C74[] = "I hear that your latest book\r\nis selling like hotcakes, \r\nMary. \x05";
const char str_08359CB6[] = "Yeah, the publisher even \r\nwants me to write a \r\nsequel!\x05";
const char str_08359CF0[] = "Hmm....\x05";
const char str_08359CF9[] = "Why don't you seem very \r\nhappy about it, Gray?\r\nAren't you glad for me? \x05";
const char str_08359D44[] = "It's not like that...\r\nIt's just that, well...\x05";
const char str_08359D74[] = "It's not like you to not\r\nsay what you think, Gray. \x05";
const char str_08359DAA[] = "OK...I'm worried about \r\nyour health!\x05";
const char str_08359DD1[] = "When you wrote the last\r\nbook, you stayed up late \r\nevery night working on it.\x05";
const char str_08359E21[] = "You were so tired all the\r\ntime I couldn't help but\r\nworry!\x05";
const char str_08359E5E[] = "I didn't want to stop you \r\nfrom doing what you \r\nwanted, though. \x05";
const char str_08359EA2[] = "Thanks for caring about me\r\nso much, Gray. \x05";
const char str_08359ECF[] = "Of course I do!\x05";
const char str_08359EE0[] = "In that case, I promise not \r\nto work so hard writing\r\nthe next one. \x05";
const char str_08359F27[] = "I'll try to do what I can \r\nto help, too. \x05";
const char str_08359F53[] = "I'm glad I married \r\nyou, Gray!\x05";
const char str_08359F74[] = "Now you're making me\r\nembarrassed...!\x05";
const char str_08359F9C[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08359FA4[] = "SCR CODEH";
const char str_08359FF6[] = "  STR ~";
const char str_0835A008[] = "I'm touched he cares about\r\nme like that. \x05";
const char str_0835A034[] = "I promise not to make \r\nhim worry any more. \x05";
const char str_0835A062[] = "I'm so glad I married him!\x05";
const char str_0835A080[] = "RIFF";
const char str_0835A088[] = "SCR CODEL";
const char str_0835A0E0[] = "STR 6";
const char str_0835A0F0[] = "My face is red...?\r\nIt's nothing, nothing...\x05";
const char str_0835A120[] = "RIFF6\x05";
const char str_0835A128[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_0835A424[] = "JUMP ";
const char str_0835A44C[] = "STR \x02\x02";
const char str_0835A47C[] = "I wonder if this is \r\nthe right grass?...\x05";
const char str_0835A4A7[] = "Oh! Hi, ";
const char str_0835A4B5[] = "How do you like your\r\nmarried life? Takes some\r\nadjusting to, I bet!\x05";
const char str_0835A4FB[] = "What was I doing? \r\nI'm looking for a grass for\r\nmy father that he needs \x05\r\nfor his research. \x05";
const char str_0835A55B[] = "That's nice of you.";
const char str_0835A56F[] = "I see.";
const char str_0835A576[] = "I try to help out my dad. \r\nBesides, I actually enjoy\r\nit!\x05";
const char str_0835A5B2[] = "Sorry for interrupting you. \r\nI have to get back now. \x05";
const char str_0835A5EA[] = "Good luck on the farm!\x05";
const char str_0835A602[] = "Well, Dad's research really\r\nis important, so I like to \r\nhelp out any way I can. \x05";
const char str_0835A658[] = "RIFF";
const char str_0835A660[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_0835AB57[] = " JUMPD";
const char str_0835ABA4[] = "STR O\x08";
const char str_0835AC08[] = "Good morning, \r\n";
const char str_0835AC1E[] = "I hear you're new to \r\nfarm life, so let me \r\nexplain some basics. \x05";
const char str_0835AC63[] = "Use the A Button to lift up \r\nItems in front of you, \r\nthrow Items, or talk to \x05\r\npeople. \x05";
const char str_0835ACBF[] = "You can buy things if you \r\ntalk to people behind a \r\ncounter in a store. \x05";
const char str_0835AD0B[] = "No one will sell you any-\r\nthing if the store isn't \r\nopen, though, so \x05\r\ndon't bother trying. \x05";
const char str_0835AD6C[] = "Use the B Button to use an \r\nItem or Tool. \x05";
const char str_0835AD99[] = "You can't use anything if\r\nyou're not holding it. \x05";
const char str_0835ADCD[] = "Do you want to here \r\neven more instruction? \x05";
const char str_0835AE03[] = "OK, here goes. \x05";
const char str_0835AE14[] = "Crops";
const char str_0835AE1A[] = "Animals";
const char str_0835AE22[] = "Useful tips";
const char str_0835AE2E[] = "Quit";
const char str_0835AE33[] = "Are you sure? You don't \r\nhave to hold back on my \r\naccount. \x05";
const char str_0835AE72[] = "Well, if want to hear more \r\nlater, you can just press \r\nSTART at any time. Got it? \x05";
const char str_0835AEC8[] = "It's your farm, and you can \r\ndo whatever you like. \x05";
const char str_0835AEFE[] = "But, your first goal should\r\nbe to make some money to\r\nlive on. \x05";
const char str_0835AF40[] = "For example, you can \r\ngather various things on \r\nthe mountain to sell. \x05";
const char str_0835AF8A[] = "After you get a hang of \r\nthe farm, try exploring \r\nthe town. \x05";
const char str_0835AFCA[] = "Just turn right on the \r\nstreet outside your farm, \r\nand you'll see Yodel Farm\x05\r\nand the Poultry Farm.\x05";
const char str_0835B032[] = "Try asking there. \x05";
const char str_0835B046[] = "Oh yes, I left you my old \r\nPedometer in the Tool Box \r\nat your farm. \x05";
const char str_0835B08E[] = "It's always useful to know\r\nhow far you've walked, \r\ndon't you think? \x05";
const char str_0835B0D6[] = "See you later!\x05";
const char str_0835B0E6[] = "The name is Zack. I'm in \r\ncharge of shipping for \r\nMineral Town. \x05";
const char str_0835B12A[] = "Let me show you how you\r\nship things to be sold.\x05";
const char str_0835B15C[] = "This is your Shipment Box. \x05\r\nPut things here you want to\r\nsell, and I'll come pick \r\nthem up by 5PM everyday. \x05";
const char str_0835B1CD[] = "I'll pay you money when \r\nI do. \x05";
const char str_0835B1EF[] = "I don't work on \r\nholidays, though! \x05";
const char str_0835B215[] = "Remember, I need a break \r\nonce in a while, too!\x05";
const char str_0835B247[] = "OK...\x05";
const char str_0835B24E[] = "You also have the Chicken\r\nCoop for your Chickens and\r\nBarn for Cows and Sheep. \x05";
const char str_0835B2A0[] = "You can ship anything you \r\ngrow or find on the\r\nmountain. \x05";
const char str_0835B2DD[] = "Or, of course, Eggs, Wool\r\nor Milk from livestock. \x05";
const char str_0835B312[] = "Work hard, but not too hard!\x05";
const char str_0835B330[] = "If your face turns blue, \r\nthat means you're about to\r\ncollapse. \x05";
const char str_0835B373[] = "If that happens, you get \r\nsent to the Clinic, and \r\nyou'll be out of commission\x05\r\nfor a while!\x05";
const char str_0835B3D4[] = "Bye now. And remember:\r\n5PM everyday!\x05";
const char str_0835B3FC[] = "RIFF";
const char str_0835B404[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_0835B708[] = "JUMP|";
const char str_0835B78C[] = "STR *\x04";
const char str_0835B7E1[] = "!, I hope \r\nyou can help me out.\x05";
const char str_0835B803[] = "You see...\r\nI got into a boasting match\r\nwith the Mayor of the next \x05\r\ntown over, and...\x05";
const char str_0835B85D[] = "I have to bring a Diamond\r\nto him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B889[] = "I have to bring a Bracelet\r\nto him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B8B6[] = "I have to bring a Green\r\nPepper to him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B8E7[] = "I have to bring a Golden\r\nEgg to him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B916[] = "I have to bring Black Grass\r\nto him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B944[] = "I have to bring White\r\nGrass to him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B972[] = "I have to bring a Truffle\r\nto him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B99E[] = "I have to bring a Moon\r\nStone to him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B9CD[] = "I have to bring an AEPFE\r\nApple to him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835B9FE[] = "I have to bring a Rice\r\nCake to him today.  \x05";
const char str_0835BA2C[] = "I'm sorry to ask this of you\r\nall the sudden, but you're\r\nthe only person I can \x05\r\nturn to!\x05";
const char str_0835BA89[] = "I'm counting on you!\r\nI don't want to lose face!\x05";
const char str_0835BABB[] = "Can I count on you\r\nfor this? \x05";
const char str_0835BADB[] = "Sure!";
const char str_0835BAE1[] = "Sorry...";
const char str_0835BAEA[] = "I knew you were the kind of \r\nman I could depend on! \x05";
const char str_0835BB21[] = "I'll come by around 7PM to \r\npick it up, OK? \r\nI'm very grateful!\x05";
const char str_0835BB64[] = "Really...? \r\nI overestimated you, it \r\nseems...\x05";
const char str_0835BB95[] = "I'll have to do it myself, \r\nI guess...\x05";
const char str_0835BBC0[] = "RIFF[";
const char str_0835BBC8[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_0835C445[] = "#Z!H";
const char str_0835C7BC[] = "JUMPL\x01";
const char str_0835C910[] = "STR \x03\x08";
const char str_0835C98C[] = "Did you bring it for me, \r\n";
const char str_0835C9AD[] = "Show me quick!\x05";
const char str_0835C9BD[] = "This isn't it. \r\n\x05";
const char str_0835C9D0[] = "I asked you for a \r\nDiamond, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CA0B[] = "I asked you for a \r\nBracelet, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CA47[] = "I asked you for a \r\nGreen Pepper, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CA87[] = "I asked you for a \r\nGolden Egg, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CAC5[] = "I asked you for \r\nBlack Grass, remember? \r\nBring some quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CB03[] = "I asked you for  \r\nWhite Grass, remember? \r\nBring some quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CB42[] = "I asked you for a \r\nTruffle, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CB7D[] = "I asked you for a \r\nMoon Stone, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CBBB[] = "I asked you for an \r\nAEPFE Apple, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CBFB[] = "I asked you for a \r\nRice Cake, remember? \r\nBring one quick!\x05";
const char str_0835CC38[] = "This is exactly what I \r\nwanted. Thank you!\x05";
const char str_0835CC65[] = "Now I have to go show it to\r\nthe Mayor from the next \r\ntown. \x05";
const char str_0835CCA4[] = "This is an expression of\r\nmy thanks. Take it. \x05";
const char str_0835CCD4[] = "This is called Golden \r\nLumber. It's very valuable. \x05";
