const char str_08398F88[] = "So you're the new guy at\r\nthe farm, eh?\x05";
const char str_08398FB2[] = "!'s not a \r\nbad name, I suppose...\x05";
const char str_08398FD6[] = "My name's Rick. I live\r\nhere with my mom and \r\nsister, Popuri.\x05";
const char str_08399016[] = "Whoopee!\r\nToday's my birthday!\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_0839903F[] = "Th-thanks a lot.\r\nYou're a really good guy.\x05";
const char str_0839906C[] = "Hey, thanks!\r\nI'll remember it.\x05";
const char str_0839908D[] = "Hey, thanks!\x05";
const char str_0839909B[] = "That's nice of you.\x05";
const char str_083990B0[] = "Hey! What are \r\nyou doing!?!\x05";
const char str_083990CE[] = "Cute! Hey there.\x05";
const char str_083990E0[] = "Animals scares the Chickens,\r\nso we try not to let \r\nthem in the chicken coop. \x05";
const char str_08399131[] = "It sure is pretty.\r\nI bet mom will like it!\x05";
const char str_0839915E[] = "I won't use it, but\r\nI bet mom will like it!\x05";
const char str_0839918C[] = "If you carry stuff like that\r\naround...you're going to \r\nlook like Kai!...\x05";
const char str_083991D8[] = "Marriage, huh?\r\nThat's great! The farm \r\nshould become even more\x05\r\nfun, then!\x05";
const char str_08399227[] = "I heard that \r\n";
const char str_08399237[] = "+ has lots \r\nof animals. Keep up\x05";
const char str_08399259[] = "the good work!\x05";
const char str_08399269[] = "Hey, how is Karen?\x05";
const char str_0839927D[] = "Can I come to your place\r\nlater on? Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083992AA[] = "Come to the Store later on.\r\nAll our Chickens lay \r\ndelicious eggs!\x05";
const char str_083992EF[] = "Do you know Karen, the girl\r\nwho works at the\r\nSupermarket?\x05";
const char str_0839932C[] = "She's very nice.\x05";
const char str_0839933E[] = "Do you have any idea how\r\nmuch work it is feeding all\r\nthese Chickens everyday?\x05";
const char str_0839938F[] = "It'll get easier once my\r\ndad gets back, though...\x05";
const char str_083993C3[] = "Karen and I are best\r\nfriends. We have been ever\r\nsince we were kids. \x05";
const char str_0839940B[] = "Things were fun back then,\r\nwhen we could play all \r\nday with no chores!\x05";
const char str_08399455[] = "Recently, I've begun to \r\nrealize how important\r\nKaren is to me...\x05";
const char str_08399499[] = "But, don't tell her I said\r\nthat! I'd be so\r\nembarrassed!\x05";
const char str_083994D4[] = "Lately, though, Karen seems\r\nawful quiet...But she \r\nwon't tell me why.\x05";
const char str_0839951D[] = "Karen's the only one who \r\nreally understands me, \x05";
const char str_08399551[] = "you know. All Popuri does\r\nis tell me to shut up!\x05";
const char str_08399584[] = "Hey, how're you doing?!\r\nWe're doing great!\x05";
const char str_083995B1[] = "My mom wanted me to marry\r\nKaren so that she";
const char str_083995DE[] = "fd\r\npart of our family.\x05";
const char str_083995F7[] = "Lately I feel lonely without\r\nKaren...\x05";
const char str_0839961F[] = "Karen is an only child,\r\nso I think Jeff is very \r\nlonely...\x05";
const char str_0839965D[] = "Sasha comes over a lot,\r\nthough.\x05";
const char str_0839967F[] = "It's getting dark,\r\nisn't it?\x05";
const char str_0839969E[] = "Hey, ";
const char str_083996A4[] = "!.\r\nMy mom asked me to do some\r\nshopping. \x05";
const char str_083996D0[] = "I need some break\r\nonce a while from work.\r\nI'm still young, you know?\x05";
const char str_08399718[] = "Is Popuri doing a good \r\njob? I bet she complains\r\neveryday!\x05";
const char str_08399756[] = "I can visit my sister any \r\ntime at your place!\x05";
const char str_08399787[] = "If she married Kai, I'd \r\nprobably never see her\r\nagain!\x05";
const char str_083997C1[] = "That guy Kai...\r\nI hate him! He always comes\r\nto bug my sis in Summer!\x05";
const char str_08399809[] = "I can't believe Popuri\r\nlikes that guy!...\x05";
const char str_08399835[] = "She doesn't know how \r\ndangerous he is!\x05";
const char str_0839985E[] = "Popuri comes back in the\r\nsummertime.\x05";
const char str_08399885[] = "That's why I always look\r\nforward to Summer!\x05";
const char str_083998B3[] = "Mom is always glad when\r\nPopuri comes back, too.\x05";
const char str_083998E5[] = "I just wish she could stay\r\nfor longer...\x05";
const char str_08399910[] = "Popuri seems so happy.\x05";
const char str_08399928[] = "She sends letters once\r\na week, and visits \r\nduring the Summer!\x05";
const char str_08399969[] = "But, she only writes about\r\nKai, and he comes with her\r\nin the summer...\x05";
const char str_083999B3[] = "She doesn't care about me\r\nany more, it seems...\x05";
const char str_083999E5[] = "I like everyone in the \r\nvillage...except Kai.\x05";
const char str_08399A15[] = "He comes to the village\r\nevery summer just to have\r\nfun, and causes lots of \x05";
const char str_08399A63[] = "trouble. Someday...\x05";
const char str_08399A78[] = "Mom and Popuri don't dislike\r\nhim the way I do.\x05";
const char str_08399AA9[] = "He has a way with \r\nwomen, I guess.\x05";
const char str_08399ACE[] = "Pretty bad weather \r\ntoday, eh?\x05";
const char str_08399AEF[] = "Some days, the Chickens\r\nseem to be so easy to care\r\nfor! I wonder what puts \r\nthem in such a good mood?\x05";
const char str_08399B59[] = "Strange seeing you \r\naround at this hour!\x05";
const char str_08399B84[] = "Shouldn't you be getting\r\nback home? \x05";
const char str_08399BAB[] = "After all, you care for \r\nthat farm all by yourself,\r\nso you need the rest!\x05";
const char str_08399BF8[] = "Good weather today, \r\nisn't it?\x05";
const char str_08399C19[] = "The Supermarket's closed on\r\nTuesdays, so I don't get\r\nto go there. \x05";
const char str_08399C5F[] = "Why are Tuesdays \r\nalways sunny?\x05";
const char str_08399C81[] = "Done with all your work?\x05";
const char str_08399C9B[] = "It's always nice to have\r\na drink after work!\x05";
const char str_08399CCA[] = "We always tell Saibara how\r\nour Tools are doing on \r\nTuesdays.\x05";
const char str_08399D0A[] = "You run a farm, too, so\r\nyou must see Saibara \r\na lot, right?\x05";
