const char str_0839F77D[] = "I don't like this!\x05";
const char str_0839F791[] = "Hmmph!\r\nHow could you be \r\nso stupid!?...\x05";
const char str_0839F7BC[] = "Throw this away yourself!\x05";
const char str_0839F7D7[] = "Who would \r\nwant this!?...\x05";
const char str_0839F7F3[] = "Cute!\x05";
const char str_0839F7FA[] = "I grew up on a farm with\r\nChickens, so I love \x05\r\nanimals...\x05";
const char str_0839F845[] = "I...I can't believe you \r\nwould try to give me this!\r\nI don't even want to \x05\r\nlook at it...!\x05";
const char str_0839F8A3[] = "No, I";
const char str_0839F8A9[] = "fm scared!\x05";
const char str_0839F8B5[] = "This is for me!?\r\nThank you so much!\r\nI love it!\x05";
const char str_0839F8E7[] = "You're the best, \r\n";
const char str_0839F8FF[] = "You're giving this to\r\nme?...How sweet!\x05";
const char str_0839F928[] = "Don't worry, Kai won't get\r\nupset about it!\x05";
const char str_0839F955[] = "This is for me?!...\r\nAwesome!...I feel so...\r\n...like a woman!\x05";
const char str_0839F995[] = "You're giving this to me?\r\nI love it! Thank you\r\nso much!\x05";
const char str_0839F9D0[] = "You're great, ";
const char str_0839F9E3[] = "This is for me?!\r\nThanks! I can't wait to \r\nshow it to Mom!\x05";
const char str_0839FA20[] = "This is for me?!\r\nThanks! It smells so good!\x05";
const char str_0839FA4E[] = "You know what?\r\nKai already gave me the\r\nsame kind of Perfume...\x05";
const char str_0839FA90[] = "Give this to someone you\r\nreally like instead.\x05";
const char str_0839FAC0[] = "You're giving this Perfume\r\nto me? Really?...\x05";
const char str_0839FAEF[] = "Thank you so much!\x05";
const char str_0839FB03[] = "Thak you!\r\nAre you giving presents to\r\neverybody, or just me?...\x05";
const char str_0839FB45[] = "Thanks!\x05";
const char str_0839FB4E[] = "I can't wait to eat them!\r\nI knew today was going\r\nto be great!\x05";
const char str_0839FB8F[] = "Wow...Thank you so much!\r\nAre you sure it's OK?\x05";
const char str_0839FBC0[] = "And I didn't even give you\r\nanything at the Winter\r\nThanksgiving Festival!\x05";
const char str_0839FC0C[] = "This is for me?\r\nThanks! But...You really\r\nshouldn't have gone to\x05\r\nthe trouble...\x05";
const char str_0839FC60[] = "Wait one second!\r\nLet's talk at your place!\x05";
const char str_0839FC8D[] = "You're sweet, but you \r\nshould really give this to\r\nsomeone you want to marry.\x05";
const char str_0839FCDD[] = "I just don't feel\r\nthat way about you. I like\r\nyou as a friend, though!\x05";
const char str_0839FD26[] = "Tomorrow is the \r\nStarry Night Festival, \r\nright? Why don't you come\x05\r\nover to my house...?\x05";
const char str_0839FD83[] = "Sounds like fun.";
const char str_0839FD94[] = "Sorry, I have other plans.";
const char str_0839FDAF[] = "Great! I'll make you the\r\nbest dinner ever!\x05";
const char str_0839FDDC[] = "I guess you're \r\ntoo busy...Oh well...\x05";
const char str_0839FE04[] = "Tomorrow is the Starry\r\nNight Festival, so let's\r\nhave a party at my house!\x05";
const char str_0839FE51[] = "I just learned a great new\r\nCake recipe from Anna!\x05";
const char str_0839FE85[] = "I thought I felt \r\nstrange...I'm just glad \r\nI'm not sick!\x05";
const char str_0839FEC1[] = "I'm just a little \r\nhungrier than usual, \r\nthat's all!\x05";
const char str_0839FEF9[] = "Good morning!\r\nI roll around a lot in my\r\nsleep, so I was so worried\x05";
const char str_0839FF3F[] = "about the baby I didn't\r\nsleep at all...!\x05";
const char str_0839FF6A[] = "Or...Is there such a thing\r\nas being too happy to \r\nsleep?  I thought so...\x05";
const char str_0839FFB7[] = "The Doctor at the Clinic\r\nsaid everything was going\r\nwell! I can't wait until\x05\r\nit's born!...\x05";
const char str_083A0016[] = "Honestly, I'm a little\r\nscared, though...\x05";
const char str_083A0041[] = "Mom told me labor was\r\nso painful!\x05";
const char str_083A00A2[] = ")!!!\r\nElli at the Clinic said\r\nthe baby would be born\x05\r\ntomorrow! I'm so excited!!\x05";
const char str_083A0110[] = "* is so \r\nadorable...\x05";
const char str_083A016A[] = "When you were a baby,\r\nI bet you looked just \r\n";
const char str_083A019A[] = "* now!\x05";
const char str_083A01A2[] = "I think he takes after you!\x05";
const char str_083A01BF[] = "Now he's making \r\nbaby noises! \r\nI love him so much...!\x05";
const char str_083A01F8[] = "I'd do anything for\r\n";
const char str_083A020E[] = "*....Don't\r\nyou agree, ";
const char str_083A022B[] = "* can already\r\nwalk! He's so advanced for\r\nhis age, don't you think?\x05";
const char str_083A0271[] = "When he gets older,\r\nhe'll take over the farm.\x05";
const char str_083A02A1[] = "Won't that be wonderful?\x05";
const char str_083A02BB[] = "He talks a little bit, now!\r\nWhom do you like more,\r\nPapa or Mama?\x05";
const char str_083A02FF[] = "Who do you like more,\r\nme or ";
const char str_083A033F[] = "I'm sick of this!\r\nI just want to go home!\x05";
const char str_083A036B[] = "Good morning,\r\n";
const char str_083A037F[] = "I get bored if you \r\ndon't talk to me, you know!\x05";
const char str_083A03B1[] = "Can I go back home...\r\nJust for a little bit?...\x05";
const char str_083A03E3[] = "You don't spend very much\r\ntime at home lately, \r\n";
const char str_083A041A[] = "Good morning!\r\nEveryone on the Poultry\r\nFarm wakes up early, so\x05\r\nI'm used to it!\x05";
const char str_083A046D[] = "Put in a good day's\r\nwork, now!\x05";
const char str_083A048E[] = "I got lots of Eggs from\r\nMom, so I hope you\r\nlike them!\x05";
const char str_083A04C7[] = "I make great \r\nfried eggs!\x05";
const char str_083A04E3[] = "Good morning, ";
const char str_083A04F6[] = "Should we walk\r\n";
const char str_083A050B[] = "Well, I guess the farm is\r\nso big we don't have to!\x05";
const char str_083A0540[] = "I like living on farms \r\nbecause the food is \r\nso fresh!\x05";
const char str_083A057A[] = "The only fresh things we\r\nhave on the Poultry Farm\r\nare Eggs and Corn!\x05";
const char str_083A05C2[] = "Good morning!\x05";
const char str_083A05D1[] = "Did you dream of me,\r\n";
const char str_083A05EC[] = "Work hard, but not\r\ntoo hard, OK!?\x05";
const char str_083A0610[] = "I love watching you \r\nenjoy the food I make you,\r\n";
const char str_083A0647[] = "You just gobble it up!\x05";
const char str_083A065F[] = "My brother is so \r\npicky about his food!\x05";
const char str_083A0689[] = "Poor Karen!\x05";
const char str_083A0696[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083A06A4[] = "My mom says my face \r\nlooks softer these days.\x05";
const char str_083A06D4[] = "I guess it's true what they\r\nsay about that happening\r\nwhen you get pregnant!\x05";
const char str_083A0723[] = "You don't have to worry\r\nabout me working too hard!\x05";
const char str_083A0758[] = "I do have some sense,\r\nyou know!\x05";
const char str_083A077A[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A077F[] = ")!\r\nHow is ";
const char str_083A078F[] = "Is he lonely without me?\x05";
const char str_083A07A9[] = "Take good care of \r\n";
const char str_083A07BE[] = "* now!\x05";
const char str_083A07E1[] = "What did you come here\r\nfor, anyway!\x05";
const char str_083A0807[] = "I'm trying to get some \r\nwork done, so quit\r\nbothering me!\x05";
const char str_083A0843[] = "I keep telling you to\r\nstop distracting me!\x05";
const char str_083A0870[] = "You're impossible \r\nsometimes, ";
const char str_083A0894[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A0899[] = ").\r\nWhat's up?\x05";
const char str_083A08A9[] = "I'm trying to get some \r\nwork done! You get to\r\nwork, too!\x05";
const char str_083A08E5[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083A08EF[] = ")!\r\nHee-hee...\x05";
const char str_083A08FF[] = "I don't know why, but I get\r\nembarrassed when you show\r\nup at the store!\x05";
const char str_083A0949[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083A0953[] = ")!\r\nSee how hard I'm \r\nworking?!...\x05";
const char str_083A097A[] = "fm working very hard\r\nfor you, ";
const char str_083A099E[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A09A3[] = "!.\r\nThe Poultry Farm is closed\r\ntoday. Sorry.\x05";
const char str_083A09D2[] = "Me? No, my mom never\r\neven lets me touch the\r\nstore money!\x05";
const char str_083A0A0E[] = "Rain...?\r\nIt doesn't rain this much\r\nwhere I live...\x05";
const char str_083A0A44[] = "Nothing to do but\r\nrelax, I suppose.\x05";
const char str_083A0A6A[] = "Kai must be off today, \r\ntoo...\x05";
const char str_083A0A8B[] = "Ah, ";
const char str_083A0A90[] = "!.\r\nHow are you today?\x05";
const char str_083A0AA8[] = "I only get to come in the\r\nSummer, so I miss the \r\npeople here!\x05";
const char str_083A0AE9[] = "You look like you're \r\nbusy as ever, ";
const char str_083A0B13[] = "It's like it's always \r\nSummer where I live with\r\nKai. Do I look tan to you?\x05";
const char str_083A0B61[] = "Howdy, ";
const char str_083A0B69[] = "!!\r\nHow are you faring?\x05";
const char str_083A0B82[] = "Sometimes I want to come\r\nback here in the Spring\r\nor the Fall...\x05\r\nEven Winter!\x05";
const char str_083A0BD4[] = "If I leave Kai alone, \r\nthough, pretty soon the \r\nother girls will be all\x05\r\nover him!\x05";
const char str_083A0C2B[] = "How is your farm,\r\n";
const char str_083A0C43[] = "I wish I were still \r\nsurrounded by animals like\r\nyou are, ";
const char str_083A0C83[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A0C88[] = "!.\r\nI hear you're doing a good\r\njob on your farm.\x05";
const char str_083A0CBB[] = "I used to always\r\nwant to leave this town...\r\nBut now I appreciate it\x05\r\nmore.\x05";
const char str_083A0D0A[] = "You seem more grown up\r\nevery year, ";
const char str_083A0D33[] = "I guess that's natural,\r\nthough...\x05";
const char str_083A0D57[] = "I try to make Kai \r\nstay with us at the house,\r\nbut he insists on staying\x05\r\nat the inn!\x05";
const char str_083A0DB0[] = "I wonder why...?\x05";
const char str_083A0DC2[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A0DC7[] = "!.\r\nI wish I could come here\r\nfor more than just \x05\r\nSummers, sometimes!\x05";
const char str_083A0E10[] = "I always hope my dad will\r\nbe back this time when I \r\ncome back, but he \x05\r\nnever is...\x05";
const char str_083A0E68[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A0E6D[] = "!.\r\nHow are you doing?\x05";
const char str_083A0E85[] = "Say hello to your wife \r\nfor me.\x05";
const char str_083A0EA7[] = "Still toiling away at \r\nthe farm, ";
const char str_083A0ECE[] = "What are you doing here?\r\nYou are married now.\x05";
const char str_083A0EFE[] = "Why don't you go back \r\nhome to your cute wife?\x05";
const char str_083A0F2F[] = "How is farm life treating\r\nyou, ";
const char str_083A0F54[] = "You treat your wife so\r\nwell! I'm jealous...\x05";
const char str_083A0F82[] = "Hee-hee...\r\nWe're getting married...!\x05";
const char str_083A0FA9[] = "I just wish Dad would\r\ncome back...\x05";
const char str_083A0FCE[] = "How can he miss his own\r\ndaughter's wedding!\x05";
const char str_083A0FFC[] = "You've never met my father,\r\nhave you, ";
const char str_083A1028[] = "I wonder what he would \r\nthink of you...?\x05";
const char str_083A1053[] = "...Hello!\x05";
const char str_083A105E[] = "Did you need something?\x05";
const char str_083A1077[] = "Are you having fun\r\non your farm?\r\nI'm so bored...\x05";
const char str_083A10AB[] = "Don't tell anyone, though!\x05";
const char str_083A10C7[] = "You're much nicer\r\nthan my brother, \r\nyou know that?\x05";
const char str_083A10FD[] = "My brother is so attached\r\nto me! \r\nCan you believe it?\x05";
const char str_083A1136[] = "What is it like where\r\nyou live, ";
const char str_083A115C[] = "I want to visit\r\nlots of different places!\x05";
const char str_083A1188[] = "I'm so impressed you're\r\nmanaging your farm \r\nall by yourself!\x05";
const char str_083A11C8[] = "My brother likes you,\r\nand so do I!\x05";
const char str_083A11ED[] = "What do you think\r\nof me...?\x05";
const char str_083A120B[] = "Everyone thinks I'm \r\nstill a kid...\x05";
const char str_083A1231[] = "Do you think so, too?\x05";
const char str_083A1248[] = "You had better treat\r\nme like an adult, \r\n";
const char str_083A1277[] = "I used to like only \r\nhandsome men, but now I \r\nthink I like quite men, \x05\r\nlike you...\x05";
const char str_083A12CF[] = "I always relax more in\r\nmy own room...\x05";
const char str_083A12F7[] = "I'm getting sleepy...\x05";
const char str_083A130E[] = "What do you think \r\nChurches are for?\x05";
const char str_083A1335[] = "Whenever I ask Carter, he\r\nwon't give me a straight \r\nanswer!\x05";
const char str_083A1374[] = "This church was built when\r\nI was just a kid.\x05";
const char str_083A13A3[] = "My brother used to take\r\nme here all the time. \x05";
const char str_083A13D4[] = "My Mom minds the store,\r\nand my brother looks after\r\nthe Chickens. \x05";
const char str_083A1419[] = "My father trusts my brother\r\nso much!\x05";
const char str_083A1440[] = "He wouldn't teach ME \r\nanything, though.\x05";
const char str_083A146A[] = "I love the ocean. \r\nMineral Beach is the best \r\nplace of all!\x05";
const char str_083A14A9[] = "Kai's father owns \r\nrestaurants in lots \r\nof towns.\x05";
const char str_083A14DE[] = "I had no idea!\x05";
const char str_083A14EE[] = "I love Summer!\r\nThe beach during Summer\r\nis my favorite!\x05";
const char str_083A1528[] = "Have you ever eaten at the \r\nBeach House?\x05";
const char str_083A1553[] = "They have things there you\r\ncan't find in town.\x05";
const char str_083A1584[] = "RIFF+";
const char str_083A158C[] = "SCR CODE,\n";
const char str_083A1FC4[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083A29B0[] = "STR ";
const char str_083A2A34[] = "Hi, I haven't seen you\r\naround here before!\x05";
const char str_083A2A61[] = "Ah...I know, you're \r\n";
const char str_083A2A78[] = "!, right? \r\nThomas mentioned you.\x05";
const char str_083A2A9B[] = "I'm Lillia. Very nice\r\nto meet you!\x05";
const char str_083A2AC0[] = "Today is my birthday, \r\nyou know. \x05";
const char str_083A2AE4[] = "Thank you so much!\x05";
const char str_083A2AF8[] = "How old do I look...?\x05";
const char str_083A2B0F[] = "Oh...Thank you so much!\r\nMy husband used to\r\nbring me this...\x05";
const char str_083A2B4E[] = "Thank you!\x05";
const char str_083A2B5A[] = "I wish Rick knew what I \r\nliked, too...\x05";
const char str_083A2B83[] = "Thank you!\x05";
const char str_083A2B8F[] = "You've got to be \r\nkidding...!\x05";
const char str_083A2BF0[] = "How cute!\r\nHi sweetie!\x05";
const char str_083A2C08[] = "Don't bring that \r\nclose to me!\x05";
const char str_083A2C29[] = "This is for me? Really?\x05";
const char str_083A2C42[] = "It's been a long time since\r\na man gave me such a nice\r\npresent! Tee-hee...\x05";
const char str_083A2C8F[] = "This is for me...?\r\nThanks...I'm flattered...\x05";
const char str_083A2CBE[] = "Once, my husband went to\r\ntown to get me some Perfume\r\nfor my birthday, but he \x05\r\ndidn't come back until the\r\nbirthday after that!\x05";
const char str_083A2D42[] = "While I'm thinking of it,\r\nlet me tell you the recipe\r\nfor Scrambled Eggs. It's\x05";
const char str_083A2D93[] = "easy. All you do is put\r\nOil in a Frying Pan, then\r\nput in the Eggs.\x05\r\nThat's it!\x05";
const char str_083A2DE6[] = "But, it won't taste very\r\ngood like that. \x05";
const char str_083A2E12[] = "Use a Whisk to fluff up \r\nthe Eggs, or add Butter\r\nand Mayonnaise. Kids love\x05\r\nit that way.\x05";
const char str_083A2E6F[] = "Some people say you \r\nshould only have one Egg\r\nper day, but I say eat \x05\r\nall you want!\x05";
const char str_083A2EC8[] = "Ah, a Blue Feather...\x05";
const char str_083A2EDF[] = "My husband went off to look\r\nfor one for me, but then \r\ndidn't come back for a \x05\r\nlong time!\x05";
const char str_083A2F3D[] = "My husband wrote me a \r\nwhile ago, saying he\r\nwould write more letters.\x05";
const char str_083A2F86[] = "I wonder where\r\nhe is now...?\x05";
const char str_083A2FA5[] = "Oh, I'm sorry.\r\nWhen I'm taking a rest,\r\nthe store has to be closed.\x05";
const char str_083A2FEB[] = "My children are not home\r\nall the time, so only I\r\ncan mind the store.\x05";
const char str_083A3033[] = "I can't take care of the\r\nChickens, so I at least\r\nhave to look after \x05\r\nthe store!\x05";
const char str_083A3088[] = "The store is closed \r\ntoday, since I have to \r\ngo to the Clinic.\x05";
const char str_083A30CA[] = "If you came to buy Chicken\r\nFeed, I suggest you make\r\nit yourself.\x05";
const char str_083A310E[] = "There's a Mill at your \r\nfarm, right? You can \r\nmake Feed in that.\x05";
const char str_083A3152[] = "How is ";
const char str_083A315A[] = "*?\r\nI bet he's grown so much\r\nby now!\x05";
const char str_083A3181[] = "Sasha says I look very\r\nyoung for my age and don";
const char str_083A31B2[] = "ft\r\nlook like a grandmother.\x05";
const char str_083A31D0[] = "I haven't been feeling very\r\nwell recently, so I haven't\r\nbeen outside. \x05";
const char str_083A321A[] = "That's why I haven't seen\r\nyou much lately.\x05";
const char str_083A3247[] = "My husband left to find\r\nherbs to heal me.\x05";
const char str_083A3273[] = "I wish he'd just stayed\r\nhome, though...\x05";
const char str_083A329D[] = "When we went on a \r\nhoneymoon, my husband \r\nbrought back two Chickens\x05\r\nas souvenirs.\x05";
const char str_083A32F4[] = "Those Chickens laid so\r\nmany eggs for us, we ended\r\nup with more Chickens than\x05\r\nwe knew what to do with!\x05";
const char str_083A335F[] = "That's why we started a\r\nPoultry Farm.\x05";
const char str_083A3387[] = "The fresh air outside\r\nfeels good, doesn't it?\x05";
const char str_083A33B7[] = "Ah, ";
const char str_083A33BC[] = "!.\r\nHow are you today?\x05";
const char str_083A33D4[] = "Medicine can be so\r\nexpensive...!\x05";
const char str_083A33F7[] = "The Doctor always tells\r\nme I can pay later, \r\nbut still...\x05";
const char str_083A3434[] = "It would be nice to\r\ndo something fun \r\nfor a change...\x05";
const char str_083A346D[] = "If I am reborn, I hope\r\nI become someone as healthy\r\nas you, ";
const char str_083A34B0[] = "RIFF'#";
const char str_083A34B8[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083A4183[] = " JUMP";
const char str_083A5530[] = "STR ";
const char str_083A55D0[] = "Goo!\x05";
const char str_083A55D6[] = "Hee hee hee!\x05";
const char str_083A55E4[] = "Gaaa...gaa....\x05";
const char str_083A55F4[] = "Ooof!\x05";
