const char str_083A5759[] = "Da?...\x05";
const char str_083A5761[] = "Da...boo...\x05";
const char str_083A576E[] = "Maa....ma....\x05";
const char str_083A577D[] = "Shaa...da...\x05";
const char str_083A578B[] = "Dada...Mooning!\x05";
const char str_083A579C[] = "Maa... Nigh-nigh.\x05";
const char str_083A57AF[] = "Dada...wooff...look!\x05";
const char str_083A57C5[] = "Dada...wooff....\x05";
const char str_083A57D8[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083A57E0[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083A66EC[] = "JUMP\x08\n";
const char str_083A71E8[] = ".........Hi....\x05";
const char str_083A71F9[] = "So you're the new guy at\r\nthat farm, huh?\x05";
const char str_083A7224[] = "My name?\r\nIt's Cliff. Nice to\r\nmeet you.\x05";
const char str_083A724E[] = "For me?!...\r\nThanks a lot!\x05";
const char str_083A726A[] = "Today's my birthday,\r\nyou know!\x05";
const char str_083A728B[] = "Thanks much!\r\nYou're a great guy!\x05";
const char str_083A72AE[] = "Really?...\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083A72C3[] = "Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083A72CC[] = "What in the world\r\nis this...?\x05";
const char str_083A72EC[] = "If you don't like me, \r\nyou can just come out and\r\nsay so, you know!\x05";
const char str_083A7332[] = "I just love animals!\r\nWhere I live, we often go \r\nup in the mountains to \x05\r\ncatch bugs or watch deer!\x05";
const char str_083A73CB[] = "!\r\nWhere did you find\r\nsomething like that!?...\x05";
const char str_083A73FC[] = "Ahh..So you told \r\nAnn and the others for me.\x05";
const char str_083A742B[] = "This photo shows me with\r\nmy mother and sister.\x05";
const char str_083A745D[] = "I didn't like the town\r\nwe lived in, so I left my\r\nmother and my sister to\x05\r\nstrike off on my own. \x05";
const char str_083A74C2[] = "When I went back, my \r\nmother had died and my\r\nsister was gone...\x05\r\nThis town reminds me of\r\nthat one very much...\x05";
const char str_083A7536[] = "Sorry! I'm sure you don't\r\ncare about my story...\r\nThanks for the photo!\x05";
const char str_083A7580[] = "What a pretty \r\nbauble! Can I have it?\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083A75B1[] = "Thanks!...I never thought\r\nyou'd give me something\r\nso nice!\x05";
const char str_083A75EF[] = "That's very interesting\r\nwhat you have there...\r\nCan I have it?...Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083A763A[] = "Ah, a Blue Feather!\r\nIn the town where I grew\r\nup, we used a Blue Feather\x05\r\nto propose as well!\x05";
const char str_083A769B[] = "What's up?\x05";
const char str_083A76A7[] = "Tell about part-time job.";
const char str_083A76C1[] = "Don't tell.";
const char str_083A76CD[] = "Hmmm...A part time job at \r\nthe Winery?...You know, my\r\nmoney IS running out...\x05";
const char str_083A771E[] = "I'll go ask\r\nabout it tomorrow!\x05";
const char str_083A773F[] = "Duke and Manna treat me\r\npractically like their\r\nown child!\x05";
const char str_083A777C[] = "But...Manna always asks\r\nme to meet their daughter.\r\nI wonder why...\x05";
const char str_083A77C2[] = "Ann always makes \r\ndeliveries. She's fun to \r\ntalk to!\x05";
const char str_083A77FA[] = "I'm a great worker, \r\nyou know! I got great \r\nplans, too!\x05";
const char str_083A7835[] = "I'm really pleased with\r\nthe job at Aja Winery!\x05";
const char str_083A7866[] = "Everyone keeps asking if\r\nI'll be there \r\npermanently...\x05";
const char str_083A78A0[] = "Hey, ";
const char str_083A78A6[] = "!!\r\nHow are you doing?\x05";
const char str_083A78BE[] = "How is married life?\r\nI'm sure things come up,\r\nbut you two are great.\x05";
const char str_083A7906[] = "I've been thinking about\r\nmy future goals in \r\nthis town...\x05";
const char str_083A7943[] = "As long as I have \r\nenough money, I'll keep\r\nstaying at the Inn.\x05";
const char str_083A7985[] = "Ann is a good girl,\r\nand she's very nice \r\nto me...\x05";
const char str_083A79BA[] = "Her smile reminds me\r\nof something...\x05";
const char str_083A79E1[] = "I have no idea why \r\nAnn is so nice to a \r\nguy like me...\x05";
const char str_083A7A1C[] = "Ann looks a lot like\r\nmy sister...Especially \r\nher smile. \x05";
const char str_083A7A58[] = "What would you think if\r\nI told you I was going to\r\nstay here forever...\x05\r\n...at the Inn!\x05";
const char str_083A7AB3[] = "I just like this \r\ntown, that's all...\x05";
const char str_083A7ADB[] = "I'm so grateful to Ann...\x05";
const char str_083A7AF6[] = "She has always been so \r\nnice to me compared to \r\nthe others!\x05";
const char str_083A7B35[] = "I used to think Ann looked\r\nlike my sister, but not \r\nanymore...\x05";
const char str_083A7B77[] = "Am I going to stay at\r\nthis Inn forever?\x05";
const char str_083A7BA1[] = "Ha ha! Good question.\x05";
const char str_083A7BB8[] = "Ann and I are getting\r\nalong very well. Still...\r\nI think she pays me too\x05\r\nmuch attention...\x05";
const char str_083A7C17[] = "I used to go to Church to \r\nblame myself...But now I \r\ngo to give thanks.\x05";
const char str_083A7C62[] = "I have much to be \r\ngrateful for...coming to\r\nthis town, meeting Ann...\x05\r\n...Even meeting you!\x05";
const char str_083A7CDB[] = "Hey, ";
const char str_083A7CE5[] = "I'm almost out of the money\r\nI brought with me, so I \r\nmight have to leave town!\x05";
const char str_083A7D37[] = "My job at the Winery is\r\ngoing great! \r\nThanks, ";
const char str_083A7D6C[] = "Carter said my new job\r\nwas a sign I belonged \r\nin this town!\x05";
const char str_083A7DC6[] = "I haven't found a job,\r\nso I've decided to leave.\x05";
const char str_083A7DF9[] = "Thanks for everything. \x05";
const char str_083A7E12[] = "Is this really what \r\nI want...?\x05";
const char str_083A7E34[] = "Hey! Isn't the cellar\r\nnice and cool?\x05";
const char str_083A7E5B[] = "No wonder the wine ends up\r\ntasting so good!\x05";
const char str_083A7E89[] = "This is a good town\r\nbecause the people who\r\nlive in it are good, too.\x05";
const char str_083A7ED1[] = "Hey, how are things\r\nat the farm? Never give\r\nup is your policy, right?\x05";
const char str_083A7F1A[] = "Lately, I've been eating\r\nall my meals at the Inn.\x05";
const char str_083A7F4E[] = "It's just like what my mom\r\nused to make me!\x05";
const char str_083A7F7C[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083A7F84[] = "SCR CODEH";
const char str_083A8AD8[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083A956C[] = "Hey, how are you!\r\nMy name is Zack, and I'm\r\nin charge of shipping \x05\r\naround here.\x05";
const char str_083A95C0[] = "I'll come to pick up \r\nwhatever you have to ship\r\neveryday except holidays.\x05";
const char str_083A9655[] = "Thanks a lot!\r\nThis is really excellent!\x05";
const char str_083A967F[] = "Thanks. You really \r\nshouldn't have...\x05";
const char str_083A96A7[] = "Thanks a bunch.\x05";
const char str_083A96B8[] = "The thought is appreciated,\r\nbut I don't really need \r\nit...\x05";
const char str_083A96F6[] = "I can't believe you would\r\ntry to give this away!\x05";
const char str_083A9729[] = "Cute! I love animals, \r\nyou know.\x05";
const char str_083A974C[] = "Eww....Did you know I\r\nhate bugs?\x05";
const char str_083A976F[] = "You're really giving this\r\nto me....? I've always \r\nwanted one, too!\x05";
const char str_083A97B5[] = "Was it hard to find?\x05";
const char str_083A97CB[] = "You're really giving this\r\nto me? I think I'll\r\ngive it to...\x05";
const char str_083A980A[] = "Perfume, huh?\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083A9822[] = "Oh, that's right!\r\nI was going to tell you \r\nhow to make some \x05\r\ndelicious Fried Noodles!\x05";
const char str_083A987D[] = "All you do is put Oil in \r\na Frying Pan, then fry\r\nthe noodles! That's it!\x05";
const char str_083A98C9[] = "You can even add Eggs or\r\nVegetables to make it\r\ntaste even better.\x05";
const char str_083A990E[] = "Hmmph! You have it \r\nlucky, you know that!?...\x05";
const char str_083A993E[] = "The girl I wanted to marry\r\nup and married someone \r\nelse! And I thought she \x05";
const char str_083A998D[] = "would wait until I was \r\nolder...\x05";
const char str_083A99B0[] = "You know the Fishing Rod\r\nI gave you?\x05";
const char str_083A99D7[] = "That belongs to Greg, who \r\nused to live in my house.\r\nHe loves fishing.\x05";
const char str_083A9A21[] = "He said he was going to \r\ncatch every kind of fish\r\nthere was, and he up and\x05";
const char str_083A9A6F[] = "left! I wonder how he's \r\ndoing on his quest...?\x05";
const char str_083A9AA1[] = "Hey, what's up?\r\nBusy, lately?\x05";
const char str_083A9AC1[] = "Just keep those \r\nshipments coming!\x05";
const char str_083A9AE6[] = "It's fun shipping things,\r\nyou know.\x05";
const char str_083A9B0C[] = "One perk is that you end\r\nup knowing everybody!\x05";
const char str_083A9B3D[] = "I like talking to folks.\x05";
const char str_083A9B57[] = "How's the work coming?\r\nKeep at it now!\x05";
const char str_083A9B80[] = "I'll come again around 5\r\nto pick stuff up. \r\nShip all you can!\x05";
const char str_083A9BC1[] = "Just between you and me...\r\nThere's a lady I have my\r\nheart set on.\x05";
const char str_083A9C06[] = "She's already married,\r\nthough...\r\nI'm not telling who!\x05";
const char str_083A9C3F[] = "I wonder when Rod's \r\ncoming back...\r\nIt worries me!\x05";
const char str_083A9C75[] = "Hey, ";
const char str_083A9C7B[] = "!!\r\nDon't work too hard, now!\x05";
const char str_083A9C9A[] = "How are your\r\nshipments coming?\r\nI'm counting on you, now!\x05";
const char str_083A9CD6[] = "Good work today.\r\nSee you tomorrow!\x05";
const char str_083A9CFB[] = "Done for today, \r\n";
const char str_083A9D13[] = "You seem to be a \r\nhard worker. Keep at it!\x05";
const char str_083A9D40[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083A9D45[] = "!.\r\nI shipped that Ore\r\noff to Saibara for you!\x05";
const char str_083A9D76[] = "It sells better if \r\nSaibara makes it into \r\nsomething first, see.\x05";
const char str_083A9DBA[] = "Hey, ";
const char str_083A9DC0[] = "!,\r\nDo you think girls like\r\ngetting surprise gifts...?\x05";
const char str_083A9DF9[] = "Oh, never mind...\r\nForget I mentioned it!\x05";
const char str_083A9E24[] = "Should I go there and pick\r\nthat up, or to that other\r\nplace and pick up the \x05\r\nother thing first...?\x05";
const char str_083A9E8C[] = "!,\r\nI'm working now!\x05";
const char str_083A9EEC[] = "The farming life seems\r\nto suit you pretty well,\r\n";
const char str_083A9F24[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083A9F2C[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083AAB04[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083AB500[] = "STR ";
const char str_083AB5B0[] = "Hello, there. Who are you?\x05";
const char str_083AB5CC[] = "...Oh, you're the new \r\nperson at the farm that\r\nthe Mayor was mentioning.\x05";
const char str_083AB618[] = "I'm the Doctor of this \r\nvillage. Nice to meet you.\x05";
const char str_083AB64D[] = "Well, this is a nice \r\nsurprise! \x05";
const char str_083AB670[] = "It is my birthday, \r\nyou know. Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083AB698[] = "Thanks so much!\r\nWhat a pleasant treat!\x05";
const char str_083AB6C1[] = "How thoughtful of you!\x05";
const char str_083AB6D9[] = "Thank you!\x05";
const char str_083AB6E5[] = "Thanks so much!\r\nYou really don't need to\r\ntake the trouble, though.\x05";
const char str_083AB72B[] = "Be sure to wash your hands\r\nafter touching these \r\nthings!\x05";
const char str_083AB767[] = "Oh...you mean...it's\r\n...for me...?\x05";
const char str_083AB78C[] = "Is something the matter\r\nwith it? No...?\r\nThat's a relief...\x05";
const char str_083AB7CA[] = "...!\r\nWh-what is this?!\r\nIf it's all the same\x05";
const char str_083AB7F9[] = "to you...please take it\r\nhome with you...\x05";
const char str_083AB824[] = "This is really for me?\r\nYou are so kind!\x05";
const char str_083AB84E[] = "This is for me?\r\nI really shouldn't accept\r\nsuch a nice gift...\x05";
const char str_083AB88F[] = "Oh...thanks!\x05";
const char str_083AB89D[] = "My mother always used to\r\nwear this Perfume...\x05";
const char str_083AB8CD[] = "My father would bring it \r\nback from town...\x05";
const char str_083AB8FB[] = "Thanks so much!\x05";
const char str_083AB90C[] = "As thanks, I'll teach you a\r\ngreat recipe for mixed \r\nfruit and vegetable juice.\x05";
const char str_083AB95E[] = "I don't have anything to \r\nwrite it down on, but \r\njust remember it, OK?\x05";
const char str_083AB9A8[] = "The ingredients you need\r\nare Strawberry, Pineapple,\r\nGrape, Carrot, Cucumber,\x05";
const char str_083AB9F8[] = "Cabbage, and Apple. If you\r\nforget any of these, the \r\nrecipe won't work.\x05";
const char str_083ABA43[] = "You need a Mixer, and a \r\nKnife if you have one.\x05";
const char str_083ABA75[] = "If you add Sugar and Salt,\r\nit'll taste better, too. \x05";
const char str_083ABAAC[] = "You can add any other \r\nfruit or vegetable you\r\nwish.\x05";
const char str_083ABAE3[] = "I hope you like it!\x05";
const char str_083ABAF8[] = "A Blue Feather...\r\nAnyone I know...?\x05";
const char str_083ABB1E[] = "Have you heard of \r\nForget-me-not Valley?\x05";
const char str_083ABB49[] = "Rumors are that another \r\ndoctor I know lives there.\x05";
const char str_083ABB7F[] = "He might look a little \r\nstrange, but his skills\r\nare first rate. \x05";
const char str_083ABBC3[] = "So, ";
const char str_083ABBC8[] = "!, \r\nhow is married life?\x05";
const char str_083ABBE3[] = "Health really is the most\r\nimportant thing, you know.\r\nCome around any time if you\x05\r\nfeel under the weather.\x05";
const char str_083ABC51[] = "How are you feeling lately?\x05";
const char str_083ABC6E[] = "Come around any time you\r\ndon't feel well. \x05";
const char str_083ABC9B[] = "Of course, it will cost \r\na little bit, but it's \r\nworth it!\x05";
const char str_083ABCD9[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083ABCDE[] = "!.\r\nI hope you're well?\x05";
const char str_083ABCF7[] = "I couldn't do anything\r\naround here without \r\nElli, you know.\x05";
const char str_083ABD36[] = "If only I could do\r\nmore to cure people...\x05";
const char str_083ABD62[] = "Lately I've been feeling\r\nmy powers as a doctor \r\naren't sufficient...\x05";
const char str_083ABDAA[] = "Elli worries too much\r\nabout me...\x05";
const char str_083ABDCE[] = "I'm just not a good\r\nenough doctor...\x05";
const char str_083ABDF5[] = "I think I could do \r\nanything if Elli were by my\r\nside...\x05";
const char str_083ABE30[] = "If Elli were with me,\r\nwe could support each\r\nother very well.\x05";
const char str_083ABE70[] = "Being a doctor is so\r\ndemanding! \x05";
const char str_083ABE93[] = "If I have a child, I hope\r\nthey don't go into \r\nmedicine...\x05";
const char str_083ABED0[] = "Stu is a good kid,\r\nbut he gets into so much\r\ntrouble!\x05";
const char str_083ABF08[] = "Nothing's happened\r\nto Elli, has it?!\x05";
const char str_083ABF2F[] = "You're just here for a \r\nsocial visit? You really\r\nshould get back home!\x05";
const char str_083ABF79[] = "What's wrong...?\x05";
const char str_083ABF8B[] = "Sorry, but we're \r\ngoing to bed soon.\r\nSee you tomorrow!\x05";
const char str_083ABFC5[] = "Is something the matter?\r\nAre you sick?\x05";
const char str_083ABFEE[] = "If nothing's the matter,\r\nI'd prefer to rest...\x05";
const char str_083AC01F[] = "Sometimes I see Basil near\r\nMother's Hill. He teaches\r\nme about herbs.\x05";
const char str_083AC067[] = "He's a very kind man.\x05";
const char str_083AC07E[] = "Basil's book is very \r\nuseful to a doctor!\x05";
const char str_083AC0AA[] = "Whenever the Clinic is\r\nclosed, I go to Mother's \r\nHill to search for herbs.\x05";
const char str_083AC0F8[] = "Zack picks some for me, \r\nbut I need more than that.\x05";
const char str_083AC12E[] = "Let me know if you find\r\na good spot for herbs, OK?\x05";
const char str_083AC163[] = "That Carter is a little\r\nstrange, but I trust him.\x05";
const char str_083AC197[] = "Once I talked to Manna\r\nabout something, and the \r\nnext day everyone knew \x05\r\nabout it!\x05";
