const char str_083C253C[] = "Wow, you sure are \r\nsweaty! It's cool indoors,\r\nbecause the sun doesn't \x05\r\nhit the house.\x05";
const char str_083C2597[] = "When you get sweaty,\r\nyou should always wash off\r\nin a bath.\x05";
const char str_083C25D5[] = "If you don't, you're \r\nliable to catch cold!\x05";
const char str_083C2603[] = "I love Fall, because \r\nthere's always so much \r\ngood to eat!\x05";
const char str_083C2641[] = "I eat a lot too, you know!\x05";
const char str_083C265D[] = "Sometimes, the Doctor\r\nbrings me mushrooms he \r\ngathers when he goes to\x05\r\npick medicinal herbs. \x05";
const char str_083C26BF[] = "He's so sweet!\x05";
const char str_083C26CF[] = "Notice how the snow is\r\nbuilt up outside? \r\nThat happens every year.\x05";
const char str_083C2715[] = "It gets so cold Mr. Sun\r\ncan't melt the snow.\x05";
const char str_083C2744[] = "Farms are lonely places\r\nin the winter time...\x05";
const char str_083C2774[] = "I've never been to yours, \r\nbut I bet the Chickens and\r\nCows can't wait \x05\r\nfor Spring \x05";
const char str_083C27CC[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083C27D4[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083C34D4[] = "JUMP\x08\n";
const char str_083C3EE4[] = "STR ";
const char str_083C3F9C[] = "H-Hi...\r\nUmm...Can I be of service?\x05";
const char str_083C3FC1[] = "Oh, so you've come to say\r\nyou've just moved in?\x05";
const char str_083C3FF3[] = "My name is Jeff.\r\nPleasure to meet you!\x05";
const char str_083C401C[] = "This is a present?\r\nFor me...?\x05";
const char str_083C403C[] = "How did you even know\r\nit was my birthday?!\x05";
const char str_083C4069[] = "Thanks a lot!\r\nYou're a swell guy!\x05";
const char str_083C408D[] = "Gee, thanks. This is great.\x05";
const char str_083C40AA[] = "Thanks. You're \r\nvery friendly!\x05";
const char str_083C40CB[] = "Sorry, but I can't\r\nsay I really like things\r\nlike this...\x05";
const char str_083C4107[] = "Umm...Are you \r\ntrying to make me an \r\nenemy...?\x05";
const char str_083C4139[] = "How incredibly cute!\x05";
const char str_083C414F[] = "Just don't bring that\r\nnear me, OK...?\r\nI don't know how you can \x05\r\nstand it...\x05";
const char str_083C41A0[] = "You mean this is for me?\r\nThanks, what a \r\nswell present!\x05";
const char str_083C41DB[] = "You mean this is for me?\r\nThanks! I'm sure Sasha \r\nwill love it!\x05";
const char str_083C421D[] = "Perfume, huh?\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083C4235[] = "So you've reached that\r\nage already, have you?\x05";
const char str_083C4265[] = "Good luck! I'll be \r\nrooting for you!\x05";
const char str_083C428C[] = "Do you need anything?\x05";
const char str_083C42A3[] = "Tell about part-time job.";
const char str_083C42BD[] = "Don't say anything.";
const char str_083C42D1[] = "Work at Duke's \r\nWinery...? \x05";
const char str_083C42EF[] = "Actually, he was kind of a\r\nbully when we were kids,\r\nso I don't like him too \x05\r\nmuch...\x05";
const char str_083C4349[] = "Just our secret, OK?\x05";
const char str_083C435F[] = "I hear that at the \r\n";
const char str_083C4375[] = "+ farm \r\nthey have a flower that \x05";
const char str_083C4398[] = "can talk, and other rare\r\ncrops. \x05";
const char str_083C43BB[] = "Gosh, I'd like a flower \r\nlike that at the store...\x05";
const char str_083C43F0[] = "Welcome to the store,\r\n";
const char str_083C440C[] = "How goes life on the farm?\x05";
const char str_083C4428[] = "Ahh...I'd love to meet\r\n";
const char str_083C4445[] = "Maybe I'll skip work one \r\nday to go down and see him!\x05";
const char str_083C447D[] = "Ughh...The day is finally\r\nover! But, tomorrow is \r\ngoing to be tough, too!\x05";
const char str_083C44CA[] = "I'm in a fix, here.\r\nToo many people owe\r\nme money for their tabs!\x05";
const char str_083C450E[] = "It's really not fair to\r\nSasha, I know...We both \r\nsaved up money to open\r\nthe store together...\x05";
const char str_083C4570[] = "Ah, sorry, didn't mean to \r\nunload my problems on you!\r\nDid you need something?\x05\r\nI'm on a break now!\x05";
const char str_083C45D7[] = "A man can really \r\nrelax at home...\x05";
const char str_083C45FC[] = "Well, if it isn't\r\n";
const char str_083C4610[] = "!!\r\nTake your time, now.\x05";
const char str_083C462A[] = "I like you because\r\nyou always pay cash,\r\n";
const char str_083C465A[] = "Welcome!\x05";
const char str_083C4664[] = "At first you should really\r\nbuy seeds, you know. \x05";
const char str_083C4697[] = "Don't worry about spending\r\nall your money, it'll \r\ncome back!\x05";
const char str_083C46D7[] = "It's true!\r\nYou just have to choose\r\nvery carefully!\x05";
const char str_083C470D[] = "You look like you're\r\nworking too hard, just\r\nlike me!\x05";
const char str_083C4745[] = "It's a small town, so we\r\nshould all try to get\r\nalong. Even if there are \x05\r\npeople we really don't...\x05";
const char str_083C47AD[] = "Ah, ";
const char str_083C47B2[] = "!.\r\nHow is the farm coming?\x05";
const char str_083C47CF[] = "You look more and more \r\nlike a farmer everyday!\x05";
const char str_083C4801[] = "It inspires me to see you\r\nwork so hard and do such\r\na good job!\x05";
const char str_083C4843[] = "After all, running a farm\r\nby yourself can't be easy!\x05";
const char str_083C487A[] = "I'm going to Church now.\r\nIt's my favorite place in \r\nthis whole town!\x05";
const char str_083C48C2[] = "I'm going to the \r\nClinic now.  I've got \r\na belly ache...\x05";
const char str_083C48FE[] = "Right now I'm going to\r\nvisit Doug. He gives great\r\nadvice, you know.\x05";
const char str_083C4945[] = "I like how quiet\r\nit can be, here.\x05";
const char str_083C4969[] = "It calms the heart.\x05";
const char str_083C497E[] = "I haven't been feeling\r\nvery good, lately.\x05";
const char str_083C49AA[] = "For some reason, I \r\nfeel better when I come\r\nto the Clinic.\x05";
const char str_083C49E8[] = "I don't like Wine...\r\nThe taste is OK, but \r\nI can't stand the smell!\x05";
const char str_083C4A2F[] = "I don't get it. \r\nDuke makes Wine himself,\x05";
const char str_083C4A5B[] = "but then he pays money to\r\nDoug to drink it at \r\nthe Inn! Strange...\x05";
const char str_083C4AA4[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083C4AAC[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083CA0A0[] = "JUMP|\n";
const char str_083CAB24[] = "STR \n ";
const char str_083CAD70[] = "I heard that someone new \r\nhad taken over the farm.\x05";
const char str_083CADA5[] = "You name is \r\n";
const char str_083CADB4[] = "!, huh?\x05";
const char str_083CADBD[] = "Mine's Karen. \x05";
const char str_083CADCD[] = "A birthday present?\r\nFor me? I love presents!\x05";
const char str_083CADFC[] = "Today's my birthday,\r\ntoo.  Did you know?\x05";
const char str_083CAE27[] = "A birthday present \r\nfor me? Gee, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083CAE52[] = "Are you sure?\x05";
const char str_083CAE61[] = "I never thought I'd get\r\na present from you,\r\n";
const char str_083CAE94[] = "Are you sure you want\r\nto give me something\r\nso nice? I'm touched...\x05";
const char str_083CAEDA[] = "Really? For me?\r\nI'm glad I married \r\nyou, ";
const char str_083CAF0A[] = "Tee-hee...\x05";
const char str_083CAF16[] = "I can't believe you\r\nknew how much \r\nI love things like this!\x05";
const char str_083CAF55[] = "Gee, thanks!\r\nYou're a sweet guy,\r\n";
const char str_083CAF7D[] = "I can really keep this?!\r\nI love things like \r\nthis, you know!...\x05";
const char str_083CAFC0[] = "Thanks, ";
const char str_083CAFC9[] = ").\r\nWhat a pleasant\r\nsurprise!\x05";
const char str_083CAFE9[] = "Aww, thanks!\r\nWhat a great gift!\x05";
const char str_083CB00B[] = "Thanks a lot.\x05";
const char str_083CB01A[] = "Thanks.\x05";
const char str_083CB023[] = "Haven't I told you I\r\nhate things like this...?\x05";
const char str_083CB054[] = "Sorry, but I really\r\ndon't like these...\x05";
const char str_083CB07E[] = "No thanks!...\x05";
const char str_083CB08D[] = "Why don't you give that\r\nto someone who might\r\nactually like it?...\x05";
const char str_083CB0D2[] = "That's very cute!\r\nThanks for showing it\r\nto me.\x05";
const char str_083CB117[] = "Get it away from \r\nme...quick!\x05";
const char str_083CB137[] = "What are you \r\nthinking!?....\x05";
const char str_083CB156[] = "For me?...\r\nWhat a surprise!\r\nThanks...!\x05";
const char str_083CB180[] = "Are you sure \r\nyou're willing to give\r\nthis to me...?\x05";
const char str_083CB1B7[] = "This is for me...?\r\nWhat a surprise gift...\r\nThanks!...\x05";
const char str_083CB1F0[] = "For me? Seriously?\r\nThanks, ";
const char str_083CB213[] = "Thanks so much, \r\n";
const char str_083CB22C[] = "Really? For me?\r\nYou're swell, ";
const char str_083CB250[] = "Gee, thanks!\r\nCan I wear it at the\r\nFestival coming up?\x05";
const char str_083CB289[] = "It smells lovely!\x05";
const char str_083CB29C[] = "How wonderful!\r\nI hope Rick won't get mad\r\nwhen I tell him I got this!\x05";
const char str_083CB2E4[] = "It looks so expensive!\r\nCan I really accept this?\x05";
const char str_083CB317[] = "Yay! I can't wait to\r\nshow it off!\x05";
const char str_083CB33B[] = "Mmm...This Cake looks \r\ndelicious...\x05";
const char str_083CB361[] = "Oh yeah...Today's the \r\nSpring Festival. I should \r\ngo get one from Rick, too.\x05";
const char str_083CB3B1[] = "I can't believe you made\r\none for me! Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083CB3E0[] = "Is this really for me?\r\nAnd I didn't make anything \r\nfor you at the Winter \r\nThanksgiving Festival!\x05";
const char str_083CB445[] = "Thanks, I really \r\nappreciate it!...\x05";
const char str_083CB46B[] = "Wow, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083CB479[] = "You remembered what I gave\r\nyou at the Winter \r\nThanksgiving Festival,\r\ndidn't you? This looks \r\ndelicious!\x05";
const char str_083CB4E6[] = "Maybe we should go to\r\nyour house for this \r\nconversation...?\x05";
const char str_083CB525[] = "So you've finally decided\r\nto get married, huh?\r\nGood for you!\x05";
const char str_083CB565[] = "I hope I haven't \r\nmisled you, but I only\r\nlike you as a friend...\x05";
const char str_083CB5AA[] = "!!\r\nDid you know that tomorrow\r\nis the Starry Night \x05\r\nFestival?\x05";
const char str_083CB5EC[] = "A party at our house \r\nstarts at 6PM. Do you\r\nwant to come?\x05";
const char str_083CB629[] = "I'd love to!";
const char str_083CB636[] = "No, thanks.";
const char str_083CB642[] = "Great!\r\nWe'll be waiting.\x05";
const char str_083CB65D[] = "Really? That's too bad...\x05";
const char str_083CB678[] = "Tomorrow is the Starry \r\nNight Festival, so go back\r\nhome by 12, OK?\x05";
const char str_083CB6BE[] = "It had totally slipped\r\nmy mind that I might\r\nbe pregnant!\x05";
const char str_083CB6FA[] = "It sure does explain \r\nthe morning sickness...\x05";
const char str_083CB72A[] = "It sure doesn't feel like\r\nthere's a baby in here!\x05";
const char str_083CB75E[] = "I still do feel nauseous, \r\nthough...\x05";
const char str_083CB785[] = "A few days ago, mom told\r\nme my face had changed.\x05";
const char str_083CB7B8[] = "She told me I looked \r\nmore like a mother. \x05";
const char str_083CB7E5[] = "Huff...puff...\r\nJust walking tires me out,\r\nlately.\x05";
const char str_083CB81A[] = "I hope the baby \r\ncomes out soon, and \r\nthat it doesn't hurt \r\ntoo much!\x05";
const char str_083CB864[] = "The big day is supposed\r\nto be tomorrow. So, Elli\r\nand the Doctor are \r\ncoming over. \x05";
const char str_083CB8BC[] = "), don't\r\nforget to stay home\r\ntomorrow. And, come back\r\nearly tonight!\x05";
const char str_083CB905[] = "Whaaa!!!....\x05";
const char str_083CB913[] = "The baby always keeps\r\nme up at night crying,\r\nso I don't get enought\x05\r\nsleep!\x05";
const char str_083CB963[] = "I see you don't have the\r\nsame problem, though!\x05";
const char str_083CB994[] = "Do you think he \r\ngets this naughtiness from\r\nyour side of the family\x05\r\nor mine?\x05";
const char str_083CB9E6[] = "It warms my heart\r\nto see the baby healthy!\x05";
const char str_083CBA13[] = "Children seem to \r\ngrow up so quickly!\x05";
const char str_083CBA3C[] = "* is \r\njust now learning how to\r\nwalk.\x05";
const char str_083CBA64[] = "Yawwn...\r\nGood morning...\r\nRaising kids sure takes\x05\r\na lot out of you!\x05";
const char str_083CBAAC[] = "I can't take my \r\neyes off the baby for a \r\nsecond! \x05";
const char str_083CBAE3[] = "* just \r\nloves getting into trouble!\x05";
const char str_083CBB09[] = "I can't believe how fast\r\n";
const char str_083CBB24[] = "* is growing up!\x05";
const char str_083CBB36[] = "It seems like just\r\nyesterday he was an infant!\x05";
const char str_083CBB67[] = "I think I'm finally getting\r\nthe hang of being a mom...\x05";
const char str_083CBBA0[] = "I'm love ";
const char str_083CBBAA[] = "* \r\nso much!...\x05";
const char str_083CBBBB[] = "Sorry, but I'm not\r\nin the mood for talking\r\nright now...\x05";
const char str_083CBBF6[] = "Can't you just \r\nleave me alone for now?...\x05";
const char str_083CBC23[] = "Good morning!\r\nNow what should I \r\ndo first today...\x05";
const char str_083CBC59[] = "I'm just not a \r\nmorning person...\x05";
const char str_083CBC7D[] = "I get so tired \r\nof having to plan \r\nmeals everyday...\x05";
const char str_083CBCB5[] = "Don't get so worried!\r\nI'll make something.\x05";
const char str_083CBCE2[] = "Good morning!\r\nLooks like a good day \r\nfor working!\x05";
const char str_083CBD17[] = "Yawn...\r\nI'm still tired...\x05";
const char str_083CBD34[] = "I'm trying to figure out \r\nwhat to make...\x05";
const char str_083CBD60[] = "But, you might be\r\na better cook than I am!\x05";
const char str_083CBD8D[] = "Good morning!\r\nBoy did I sleep soundly!\x05";
const char str_083CBDB6[] = "It's fun looking after\r\nanimals!\x05";
const char str_083CBDD8[] = "Lately I even enjoy\r\nplanning our meals!\x05";
const char str_083CBE02[] = "And, of course I \r\nenjoy making meals!\x05";
const char str_083CBE2A[] = "Morning, ";
const char str_083CBE34[] = ").\r\nLooks like another \r\nsunny day!\x05";
const char str_083CBE59[] = "There's so much I \r\nwant to do...I hardly know\r\nwhere to start!\x05";
const char str_083CBE9A[] = "I'm thinking about \r\nwhat kind of food\r\nto make you today!\x05";
const char str_083CBED6[] = "There are so many \r\nchoices to choose from...\x05";
const char str_083CBF05[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083CBF13[] = "I know, I know! \r\nI promise not to work\r\ntoo hard!\x05";
const char str_083CBF47[] = "Thanks for worrying about\r\nme, but you really don't\r\nhave to!\x05";
const char str_083CBF86[] = "Ah, welcome, ";
const char str_083CBF98[] = "How is ";
const char str_083CBFA0[] = "*?\r\nWhen you get home, tell\r\nhim that I'll be home soon.\x05";
const char str_083CBFDA[] = "I just don't want to \r\ntalk right now.\x05";
const char str_083CC00E[] = "Welcome!\r\nOh, it's you,\r\n";
const char str_083CC02C[] = "I'm busy right now,\r\nslo leave me alone.\x05";
const char str_083CC056[] = "Welcome!\r\nOh, it's you,\r\n";
const char str_083CC070[] = "). What's up?\x05";
const char str_083CC07F[] = "Will you do some \r\nshopping for me?\x05";
const char str_083CC0A4[] = "I just need....everything!\r\nHee-hee, just kidding!\x05";
const char str_083CC0D8[] = "Welcome!\r\nWhat's up, ";
const char str_083CC0F2[] = "Did you come to\r\ncheck on me?\r\nThat's sweet of you.\x05";
const char str_083CC127[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083CC12C[] = ").\r\nFeel free to hang out\r\nall you want.\x05";
const char str_083CC156[] = "I gotta get working!\r\nI'll be back in the \r\nevening, OK?\x05";
const char str_083CC190[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083CC195[] = "!.\r\nI like to help out at my \r\nparents' house on Sundays.\x05";
const char str_083CC1D0[] = "How are you liking\r\nmarried life...?\x05";
const char str_083CC1F6[] = "Why don't you get \r\nmarried, ";
const char str_083CC218[] = "A wife would bring some\r\njoy to your life, and make\r\nthings on the farm easier!\x05";
const char str_083CC269[] = "But, I get worried about the\r\nChickens when it rains...\x05";
const char str_083CC2A2[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083CC2AB[] = "Do you need something?\x05";
const char str_083CC2C3[] = "Keeping yourself busy, \r\nI see. Everything\r\ngoing well?\x05";
const char str_083CC2FC[] = "How are you doing these\r\ndays, ";
const char str_083CC320[] = "Your success at running\r\nthe farm is impressive,\r\n";
const char str_083CC357[] = "Ah, ";
const char str_083CC35C[] = "!.\r\nWhat do you need?\x05";
const char str_083CC373[] = "I can't wait for the\r\nwedding! I wonder how I'll\r\nlook in my dress...?\x05";
const char str_083CC3BB[] = "Hey.\x05";
const char str_083CC3C1[] = "What can I do for you?\x05";
const char str_083CC3D9[] = "Hello.\x05";
const char str_083CC3E1[] = "Just let me know \r\nif you need anything, OK?\x05";
const char str_083CC40F[] = "Sorry we don't have\r\neverything you might want.\x05";
const char str_083CC440[] = "But, we do have everything\r\nyou might need on a farm!\x05";
const char str_083CC477[] = "My mom and dad get \r\ninto fights too often...\x05";
const char str_083CC4A6[] = "I wonder why my dad \r\nalways loses...\x05";
const char str_083CC4CD[] = "Of course, they always make\r\nup afterwards...\r\nI just don't \x05\r\nunderstand it...\x05";
const char str_083CC51E[] = "Ah, ";
const char str_083CC523[] = "!. \r\nHow are you doing?\x05";
const char str_083CC53C[] = "I'm impressed that someone\r\nthe same age as I am is \r\nrunning a farm all \x05\r\nby himself!\x05";
const char str_083CC595[] = "Oh...Hello...!\x05";
const char str_083CC5A5[] = "You surprised me!\r\nTry not to sneak up on me\r\nlike that!\x05";
const char str_083CC5DF[] = "I don't know why, \r\nbut I find myself thinking \r\na lot about you lately...\x05";
const char str_083CC62B[] = "Ha ha! Just kidding!\r\nBet I had you fooled, huh?\x05";
const char str_083CC65D[] = "I was afraid it might\r\nrain today...\x05";
const char str_083CC683[] = "The spring sure is pretty\r\nin this kind of weather...\x05";
const char str_083CC6BA[] = "Hi. Good work today.\x05";
const char str_083CC6D0[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083CC6D5[] = "!. \r\nDo you like the ocean?\x05";
const char str_083CC6F2[] = "I love the ocean at night...\r\nThe sound of the waves \r\nalways calms me...\x05";
const char str_083CC73D[] = "I love it here.\x05";
const char str_083CC74E[] = "When I was a kid, I used to\r\nthink I could meet the \r\nHarvest Goddess here.\x05";
const char str_083CC79B[] = "Are you drinking that?\x05";
const char str_083CC7B3[] = "Wouldn't it be great if we\r\ncould dissolve our troubles\r\nand just drink them away?\x05";
const char str_083CC807[] = "Looks like it's started\r\nraining.\x05";
const char str_083CC82A[] = "Oh, what a coincidence.\x05";
const char str_083CC843[] = "I like to rest here when it\r\nrains or snows. I get along\r\nwell with the woodcutter.\x05";
const char str_083CC898[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083CC8A4[] = "The Poultry Farm never \r\nfails to tire me out. \x05";
const char str_083CC8D5[] = "I like things the way they\r\nare now, learning things\r\nfrom Lillia and Rick, and\r\nmaking up for Popuri, too.\x05";
const char str_083CC942[] = "Oh, hello,\r\n";
const char str_083CC953[] = "Can you believe it?\x05";
const char str_083CC968[] = "Rick just seems to ignore\r\nme when Popuri's around!\x05";
const char str_083CC99D[] = "How are you doing,\r\n";
const char str_083CC9B6[] = "I wish I had someone\r\nas dependable as you for a\r\nhusband, ";
const char str_083CC9F6[] = "Top of the morning\r\nto you, ";
const char str_083CCA18[] = "Helping out at the Poultry\r\nFarm has given me an idea \r\nhow tough things must be \r\nfor you all alone on \r\nthat farm!\x05";
const char str_083CCA8E[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083CCA9A[] = "We eat eggs everyday!\r\nThat's OK, though...\r\nI like eggs!\x05";
const char str_083CCAD5[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083CCAE2[] = "If you don't get home\r\nnow, you'll regret it \r\ntomorrow, ";
const char str_083CCB20[] = "Take care now, \r\n";
const char str_083CCB38[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083CCB40[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083CD7E8[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083CE1EC[] = "STR ";
const char str_083CE2A4[] = "Who are you?\r\nOh, I know, the new lad at \r\nthe farm Thomas was \x05\r\nmentioning...\x05";
const char str_083CE2F5[] = "My name is Sasha, and I \r\nrun the Supermarket.\x05";
const char str_083CE325[] = "Well, what a considerate\r\ngentleman you are!\x05";
const char str_083CE353[] = "How did you learn my\r\nbirthday...?\x05";
const char str_083CE377[] = "Thanks so much!\r\nHow did you guess my taste?\x05";
const char str_083CE3A5[] = "Thanks so much!\r\nWhat a great surprise!\x05";
const char str_083CE3CE[] = "Thanks much.\x05";
const char str_083CE3DC[] = "Ohh....I really don't \r\nlike these at all...\x05";
const char str_083CE40A[] = "Sorry, but I get ill \r\njust looking at things\r\nlike that...\x05";
const char str_083CE454[] = "How dare you try to \r\nscare me like that!\x05";
const char str_083CE47F[] = "How wonderful!\r\nThis is really for me?!...\x05";
const char str_083CE4AB[] = "How wonderful!\x05";
const char str_083CE4BB[] = "You really know how to win\r\na girl's heart, \r\n";
const char str_083CE4EE[] = "I bet all the girls are \r\nchasing you, aren't they?\x05";
const char str_083CE523[] = "How beautiful!\r\nI can't believe this is \r\nreally for me.\x05";
const char str_083CE55D[] = "You want to learn how to\r\nmake some fabulous \r\nChocolate Cookies? Jeff\x05\r\njust loves this recipe.\x05";
const char str_083CE5BF[] = "The ingredients are Flour,\r\nButter, Eggs, and Chocolate.\x05";
const char str_083CE5F9[] = "You also need Sugar of \r\ncourse and Honey is optional\x05";
const char str_083CE630[] = "The only implements you \r\nneed are a Rolling Pin and\r\nOven. \x05";
const char str_083CE66E[] = "You can also get by with\r\njust Chocolate and Cookies,\r\ntoo.Karen likes liquor, but\x05\r\nnot sweets, you know.\x05";
const char str_083CE6DA[] = "This really brings back\r\nmemories...Jeff gave me \r\nthe same thing, once. \x05";
const char str_083CE725[] = "I still have it, you know.\x05";
const char str_083CE741[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083CE74F[] = "How is life with Karen?\x05";
const char str_083CE768[] = "How is ";
const char str_083CE770[] = "*?\r\nHe looks so much like\r\nhis mother...\x05";
const char str_083CE79A[] = "I can't wait to see \r\nhim again!\x05";
const char str_083CE7BC[] = "How are you?\x05";
const char str_083CE7CA[] = "If you need my help about\r\nanything, don't be\r\nafraid to ask.\x05";
const char str_083CE809[] = "Jeff says his stomach hurts\r\nwhen it rains or snows.\r\nCan you believe that?\x05";
const char str_083CE856[] = "My stomach has never\r\nhurt, so I just don't \r\nunderstand it!\x05";
const char str_083CE894[] = "Welcome!\r\nEnjoying farm life?\x05";
const char str_083CE8B3[] = "Everyday is fun for me!\r\nThere's nothing better \r\nthan enjoying your work!\x05";
const char str_083CE8FF[] = "Jeff let someone run\r\nup a tab again today!\x05";
const char str_083CE92C[] = "That's OK, though.\r\nLately I even enjoy \r\ncollecting money people \x05\r\nowe us!\x05";
const char str_083CE97A[] = "Welcome! \r\nIf you need anything, \r\njust ask!\x05";
const char str_083CE9A8[] = "Come again any time!\x05";
const char str_083CE9BE[] = "I always enjoy your visits!\x05";
const char str_083CE9DB[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083CE9E3[] = "!.\r\nFine weather, isn't it?\x05";
const char str_083CEA00[] = "I've got to get back\r\nhome to make dinner!\r\nMy how the day flies!\x05";
const char str_083CEA43[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083CEA48[] = "!. \r\nImagine meeting you here!\x05";
const char str_083CEA68[] = "I hear things are tough for \r\nBarley and May over at \r\nYodel Farm. It's just \r\nthe two of them. \x05";
const char str_083CEACA[] = "Go over for a visit\r\nif you have the time. \x05";
const char str_083CEAF7[] = "Well, hello there!\r\nI feel so much better\r\nwhen it's sunny like this!\x05";
const char str_083CEB3E[] = "Have you gotten Barley\r\nto teach you things yet?\x05";
const char str_083CEB70[] = "He's very kind, you know.\r\nHe taught me a lot.\x05";
const char str_083CEBA0[] = "Lillia's health has \r\nalways been fragile.\x05";
const char str_083CEBCC[] = "When the Doctor's father\r\ncame to town, he told her\r\nshe couldn't walk for\x05\r\nmuch longer.\x05";
const char str_083CEC27[] = "I was her best friend then.\r\nIt made me want to cry, \r\nbut she kept her \r\nspirits up somehow...\x05";
const char str_083CEC88[] = "When she lost the ability to\r\nwalk, I was determined \r\nto help out as much \x05\r\nas I could.\x05";
const char str_083CECE3[] = "Lillia's husband is a good\r\nman, but he can become\r\nobsessed. \x05";
const char str_083CED23[] = "I wonder where he is now...\x05";
const char str_083CED40[] = "Lillia's so lonely \r\nwith him gone...\x05";
const char str_083CED67[] = "I like to go to \r\nEllen's house around noon.\x05";
const char str_083CED95[] = "Karen likes to look after\r\nothers, but not herself!\x05";
const char str_083CEDCA[] = "Stu is a good kid, but\r\nhe sure keeps Ellen's \r\nhands full!\x05";
const char str_083CEE07[] = "Still, it's better to have \r\nan active and curious child\r\nthan a passive one.\x05";
const char str_083CEE56[] = "Kids should be inquisitive!\x05";
const char str_083CEE73[] = "Noo...You don't say....?\x05";
const char str_083CEE8D[] = "...did he really....?\r\n...then she said what?...\r\n...I can't believe it!...\x05";
const char str_083CEEDC[] = "RIFFg";
const char str_083CEEE4[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083CF9DB[] = " JUMP";
const char str_083D03B8[] = "STR ";
const char str_083D0458[] = "Well I haven't seen you \r\naround these parts before!\x05";
const char str_083D048E[] = "Oh, you're the new lad up\r\nat the farm, eh? \r\nMy name's Doug, and I\x05\r\nrun this here Inn.\x05";
const char str_083D04E8[] = "Wow, it's been years since \r\nanybody but Ann gave me\r\na birthday present!\x05";
const char str_083D0533[] = "Thanks a lot.\r\nI mean it!\x05";
const char str_083D054E[] = "You're a good, guy, \r\nyou know that?\x05";
const char str_083D0574[] = "Thanks.\x05";
const char str_083D057D[] = "What a surprise!...\r\nThanks, now.\x05";
const char str_083D05A0[] = "Just what do you expect me\r\nto do with this!?...\x05";
const char str_083D05D2[] = "Ha ha ha...It's so cute!\x05";
const char str_083D05EC[] = "There are some animals\r\nI just can't stand..\r\nThis is one of them!\x05";
