const char str_083D7F8E[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083D7F96[] = "!.\r\nYou look like you're doing\r\na good job on the farm.\x05";
const char str_083D7FCF[] = "Having a wife makes working\r\nhard worth it, doesn't it?\x05";
const char str_083D8008[] = "Just the idea of marriage\r\nmakes me blush!...\x05";
const char str_083D8037[] = "My father told me not to\r\nget embarrassed on the job!\r\nHe's so strict with me!\x05";
const char str_083D8087[] = "Welcome!\x05";
const char str_083D8091[] = "If you want to order \r\nsomething, talk to my dad.\x05";
const char str_083D80C4[] = "Take your time.\x05";
const char str_083D80D5[] = "My dad is always complaining\r\nthat I'm not \"feminine\"\r\nenough!\x05";
const char str_083D8115[] = "I like myself just how I am!\r\nBesides, I don't need a \r\nboyfriend, anyway...\x05";
const char str_083D8163[] = "Welcome!\r\nHow goes things on the\r\nfarm?\x05";
const char str_083D818C[] = "I like eating food from\r\nfarms. It tastes so good\r\nand fresh!\x05";
const char str_083D81CB[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083D81D5[] = "!!\r\nTake your time, now.\x05";
const char str_083D81EF[] = "Can I ask you a question?\r\nDo you think girls should\r\ndress \"cute\"?\x05";
const char str_083D8234[] = "Welcome.\x05";
const char str_083D823E[] = "These days, I think a lot.\r\nThat's good...but I end up\r\nbreaking lots of dishes!\x05";
const char str_083D8290[] = "...Oh, sorry!\r\nWhat was it you wanted?\x05";
const char str_083D82B8[] = "Sometimes we don't have any\r\nguests staying here at all!\r\nBusiness can get real slow.\x05";
const char str_083D830F[] = "When I was a kid, I used to \r\nlike sleeping in empty \r\nguest rooms. \x05";
const char str_083D8355[] = "Things were more fun, \r\nback then...\x05";
const char str_083D837B[] = "Good morning! \r\nOff to work so early?\x05";
const char str_083D83A2[] = "I should take a lesson \r\nfrom you and get up \r\nearlier myself!...\x05";
const char str_083D83E5[] = "Welcome.\r\nWe close at 5, remember.\x05";
const char str_083D8409[] = "Today is my mom's...\r\nAnyway, my dad is taking \r\nthe day off, today.\x05";
const char str_083D844F[] = "I've got to clean Cliff's \r\nroom before he gets back!\x05";
const char str_083D8486[] = "Yes, Cliff is still\r\nstaying here at the Inn.\x05";
const char str_083D84B5[] = "I can barely cope without\r\nmy dad here!\r\nWe close at 5 sharp!\x05";
const char str_083D84F4[] = "Today is the anniversary\r\nof my mother's death. \x05";
const char str_083D8526[] = "I don't remember her at all\r\nbut my dad gets so sad.\x05";
const char str_083D855C[] = "I really don't mind \r\ncleaning, you know. I love\r\ngetting dirty and then\x05\r\ntaking a long, hot bath!\x05";
const char str_083D85C1[] = "We have more guests these\r\ndays. That makes it much \r\nmore fun around here!\x05";
const char str_083D860E[] = "What's up?\r\nThis is an unusual time to\r\ncome around here!\x05";
const char str_083D8649[] = "We've got a room...\r\nBut you don't want to \r\nstay, do you?\x05";
const char str_083D8685[] = "The Harvest Goddess Spring\r\nis really good for your\r\nhealth, you know. \x05";
const char str_083D86CE[] = "And the waterfall is \r\na blast!\x05";
const char str_083D86EF[] = "Another day, another \r\ncustomer to take care of!\r\nI hope we get busy...\x05";
const char str_083D8738[] = "Ahh...I sure like it around\r\nhere!...\x05";
const char str_083D875F[] = "I think Cliff's still \r\nin his room.\x05";
const char str_083D8785[] = "So you're here too, \r\n";
const char str_083D87A0[] = "The air feels so good here\r\nin the morning!\x05";
const char str_083D87D0[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083D87D8[] = "SCR CODE,\t";
const char str_083D9110[] = "JUMPD\n";
const char str_083D9B5C[] = "STR ]\r";
const char str_083D9BE8[] = "It's my birthday.\x05";
const char str_083D9BFB[] = "Wow, this looks delicious!\x05";
const char str_083D9C17[] = "You mean it's for me?\r\nI can't wait to dig in!\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083D9C50[] = "You mean this is for me?\r\nWhat a gentleman! \r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083D9C87[] = "Thanks.\x05";
const char str_083D9C90[] = "Sorry, I don't like\r\nthings like this at all!...\x05";
const char str_083D9CC2[] = "Maybe I can give it\r\nto somebody else...\x05";
const char str_083D9CEC[] = "What did I do to\r\nmake you hate me...?\x05";
const char str_083D9D14[] = "Don't ever even show me\r\nsomething like this again!\x05";
const char str_083D9D71[] = "What do you think you're \r\ndoing!? Didn't your mother\r\nteach you manners!?\x05";
const char str_083D9DBD[] = "You mean this is for me?\r\nBut it looks so expensive!\x05";
const char str_083D9DF3[] = "I think I'll keep it a\r\nsecret from my husband!\x05";
const char str_083D9E24[] = "You mean this is for me?\x05";
const char str_083D9E3E[] = "I think beautiful things \r\nlike this look good on me,\r\ndon't you?\x05";
const char str_083D9E81[] = "It smells wonderful!\x05";
const char str_083D9E97[] = "Thanks, I'll remember this!\x05";
const char str_083D9EB4[] = "What a beautiful feather\r\nthis is! You mean it's for \r\nproposing to somebody?\x05";
const char str_083D9F03[] = "How romantic! I bet it's \r\nvery effective!\x05";
const char str_083D9F2F[] = "In Forget-me-not Valley, \r\nwhere I live, there is\r\nsomeone named \x05\r\n";
const char str_083D9F74[] = ",. He's truly a\r\nmaster fisherman.\x05";
const char str_083D9F99[] = "!, do you\r\nlike to cook?\x05";
const char str_083D9FB3[] = "Here's a handy recipe\r\nfor ya.\x05";
const char str_083D9FD4[] = "!, do you\r\nlike to cook?\x05";
const char str_083D9FEE[] = "I think you'll like this \r\nrecipe.\x05";
const char str_083DA013[] = "!, do you\r\nlike to cook?\x05";
const char str_083DA02D[] = "Try out this recipe.\x05";
const char str_083DA043[] = "Have you ever heard of \r\nWild Grape Juice?\x05";
const char str_083DA06F[] = "All you need is Wild\r\nGrapes, Wine, and Purple\r\nGrass. \x05";
const char str_083DA0A8[] = "Just put all of that in a\r\nPot, and you're all set!\x05";
const char str_083DA0DD[] = "Easy, huh?\x05";
const char str_083DA0E9[] = "Do you know how to make \r\nCorn Flakes?\x05";
const char str_083DA111[] = "All you need to do is put \r\nCorn in an Oven or a Fry\r\nPan, then use a\x05\r\nRolling Pin. \x05";
const char str_083DA168[] = "If you add Milk or other \r\nfruit, it'll taste even\r\nbetter!\x05";
const char str_083DA1A5[] = "Do you know how to make\r\nBuckwheat Chips?\x05";
const char str_083DA1D0[] = "All you need is Buckwheat \r\nFlour and a Pot. \x05";
const char str_083DA1FF[] = "What, you say it doesn't \r\nsound very good?\x05";
const char str_083DA22C[] = "Well, I guess you could \r\nadd some Soy Sauce...\x05";
const char str_083DA25D[] = "Do you know how to make\r\nMountain Stew?\x05";
const char str_083DA286[] = "The ingredients are Carrot,\r\nBamboo Shoot, and Mushroom.\x05";
const char str_083DA2C0[] = "You'll need a Knife and \r\nSugar and Salt as well.\x05";
const char str_083DA2F3[] = "It'll tase just like your \r\nmom made! If you want to \r\nimprove on it, add Fish.\x05";
const char str_083DA344[] = "Do you know about \r\nToasted Rice Cakes?\x05";
const char str_083DA36D[] = "All you need is Rice Cake\r\nand a Frying Pan or Oven.\x05";
const char str_083DA3A3[] = "It's as easy as that?\r\nYou can also add other \r\nseasonings.\x05";
const char str_083DA3E0[] = "Have you heard of \r\nBaked Corn? \x05";
const char str_083DA402[] = "Sounds good, doesn't i?\r\nAll you need is Corn and an\r\nOven. Soy Sauce makes it\x05\r\neven better!\x05";
const char str_083DA461[] = "You look pretty tired. You \r\nknow what the best antidote\r\nto Fatigue is? Mix some \x05\r\nTurbojolt from the Clinic\r\nwith some Green Grass in a \r\nMixer! That should make you\x05\r\nfeel better in a jiffy!\x05";
const char str_083DA525[] = "Do you know how to make\r\nVegetable Juice?\x05";
const char str_083DA550[] = "It's the only way to get \r\nyoung people these days to\r\neat their vegetables!\x05";
const char str_083DA59E[] = "Just put Cucumber, Carrots,\r\nand Cabbage in a Mixer.\x05";
const char str_083DA5D4[] = "Of course, you can use \r\nother vegetables, too.\x05";
const char str_083DA606[] = "Have you learned how to make\r\nCurried Bread yet?\x05";
const char str_083DA638[] = "You'll need Bread, Curry\r\nPowder, and Oil. \x05";
const char str_083DA665[] = "The only other thing is a \r\nFry Pan. \x05";
const char str_083DA68C[] = "You can do lots of \r\nvariations with this one.\x05";
const char str_083DA6BC[] = "Have you heard of \r\nApple Soufle?\x05";
const char str_083DA6DF[] = "All you need are Apples\r\nand a Frying Pan.\x05";
const char str_083DA70B[] = "It's great as a desert. \r\nAdd sugar if you want.\x05";
const char str_083DA73D[] = "Did you need me?\x05";
const char str_083DA74F[] = "There's lots of good food\r\nin Mineral Town.\r\nI love to eat!...\x05";
const char str_083DA78F[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083DA794[] = "!.\r\nHow you doing?\x05";
const char str_083DA7A8[] = "Everyone in Mineral \r\nTown is really first rate.\r\nThey're all so kind to me!\x05";
const char str_083DA7F7[] = "!,\r\nhave you ever heard\r\nof Forget-me-not Valley?\x05";
const char str_083DA82A[] = "Long ago, I used to travel\r\nall over the world with my\r\nhusband.\x05";
const char str_083DA86C[] = "We even settled for a time\r\nin Forget-me-not Valley. \r\nIt's such a beautiful place!\x05";
const char str_083DA8C4[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083DA8CC[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083DB3F0[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083DBDF0[] = "STR ";
const char str_083DBE98[] = "Hey there? Are you a \r\ntourist? No, you're new in\r\ntown?\x05";
const char str_083DBED2[] = "This town is beautiful, and\r\nthe people are nice, so \r\nI bet you'll like it here. \x05";
const char str_083DBF26[] = "Me? Oh, sorry, the name's\r\nBasil. I'm studying the \r\nflora of this area. \x05";
const char str_083DBF72[] = "This is a fabulous gift.\r\nWho told you my birthday?\x05";
const char str_083DBFA7[] = "Thanks a lot!\r\nWere my tastes that \r\nobvious?\x05";
const char str_083DBFD6[] = "Thanks! \r\nThe people of this town \r\nreally are so kind...\x05";
const char str_083DC011[] = "Thanks! \x05";
const char str_083DC01B[] = "Ahh-chew!\r\nThis just triggered\r\nmy allergies!\x05";
const char str_083DC04A[] = "...?\r\nIs this to throw away?\x05";
const char str_083DC068[] = "I like animals and insects\r\njust as much as \r\nI like plants!\x05";
const char str_083DC0A6[] = "Sorry, but this kind of\r\ngives me the creeps...!\r\nWhy not set it free?\x05";
const char str_083DC0EE[] = "Gee, thanks for the thought!\x05";
const char str_083DC10C[] = "I usually don't do much for\r\nAnna, so I'll give this\r\nto her. She'll love it.\x05";
const char str_083DC15B[] = "Thanks.\r\nI'll try giving this to\r\nAnna!...\x05";
const char str_083DC187[] = "This smells nice...\r\nAlmost like a plant!\x05";
const char str_083DC1B2[] = "I've been meaning to tell\r\nyou this recipe...It's for \r\na delicious Fruit Latte.\x05";
const char str_083DC204[] = "Take fruit like Pineapple, \r\nApple, Wild Grape, or other\r\nfruit and put it in a \x05\r\nMixer with Milk.\x05";
const char str_083DC269[] = "It also tastes excellent \r\nwith Strawberry, Grape \r\nJuice, or Honey. \x05";
const char str_083DC2B0[] = "Hmm....\r\nWhat an interesting custom \r\nthis is!...\x05";
const char str_083DC2E3[] = "You look like there's \r\nsomething you wan to\r\ntalk about. Is there?\x05";
const char str_083DC328[] = "Tell about job.";
const char str_083DC338[] = "Don't tell about job.";
const char str_083DC34E[] = "Thanks for telling me, but I\r\ncan't. I may look like\r\nI have a lot of free time, \x05";
const char str_083DC3A1[] = "but I'm very busy studying\r\nplants!\x05";
const char str_083DC3C6[] = "Great weather we're \r\nhaving today!\x05";
const char str_083DC3EB[] = "Humans are just like\r\nplants. They need sunshine\r\nor they wither away...\x05";
const char str_083DC435[] = "Plants can feel what we're\r\nthinking you know.  \r\nThat's what I explain in\x05\r\nmy new book.\x05";
const char str_083DC490[] = "It's been raining all day!\x05";
const char str_083DC4AC[] = "Plants have the most amazing\r\nlife force! If you find a \r\nseed from 100 years ago, \x05";
const char str_083DC501[] = "then give it water and sun,\r\nit'll bloom!\x05";
const char str_083DC52C[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083DC531[] = "!. \r\nHow is ";
const char str_083DC542[] = "I can't wait to bring\r\n";
const char str_083DC55A[] = "* hiking!\r\nDo you think he'll like it?\x05";
const char str_083DC582[] = "Mothers Hill is home to many\r\ndifferent species of flora.\x05";
const char str_083DC5BD[] = "That's why we came to this\r\ntown in the first place!\x05";
const char str_083DC5F3[] = "There are plants around\r\nhere which don't grow \r\nanywhere else!\x05";
const char str_083DC634[] = "You grow crops, don't you?\x05";
const char str_083DC650[] = "What a great endeavor \r\nthat must be!\x05";
const char str_083DC677[] = "I'm so busy writing my \r\nbooks I barely have time \r\nfor field work!\x05";
const char str_083DC6BC[] = "What great weather we\r\nhave today!\x05";
const char str_083DC6E0[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083DC6E5[] = "!. \r\nAre you done for the day?\x05";
const char str_083DC705[] = "Don't try to do everything\r\ntoo perfectly, or you\r\nwon't hold up!\x05";
const char str_083DC748[] = "I just love\r\noutdoor air!!\x05";
const char str_083DC764[] = "Plants change a lot in just\r\none week, you know. \r\nEspecially if it rains or \x05\r\nsnows!\x05";
const char str_083DC7BC[] = "I just love my work!\x05";
const char str_083DC7D2[] = "I thought I would be able\r\nto spend all my time with \r\nplants, but I only get to \x05\r\nabout once a week. \x05";
const char str_083DC83B[] = "This town has great\r\nwine. I shouldn't partake\r\nas often as I do...\x05";
const char str_083DC880[] = "This town has great air\r\nand great water, which\r\nmeans the plants are happy.\x05";
const char str_083DC8CE[] = "It also makes for\r\ngreat wine!\x05";
const char str_083DC8EE[] = "Do you drink wine?\r\nMary doesn't drink much, \x05";
const char str_083DC91D[] = "but she can put a lot away \r\nwhen she does!\x05";
const char str_083DC94A[] = "Mary likes plants, too, but\r\nI think she wants something\x05";
const char str_083DC984[] = "passionate, like what you \r\nhave for your farm.\x05";
const char str_083DC9B8[] = "RIFF7";
const char str_083DC9C0[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083E1C8C[] = "JUMPl\n";
const char str_083E2700[] = "STR ";
const char str_083E2978[] = "Ah, are you the new\r\nguy at that farm Thomas \r\ntold me about?\x05";
const char str_083E29B7[] = "My name's Mary.\r\nNice to meet you.\x05";
const char str_083E29DB[] = "Gee, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E29E9[] = "A birthday present, for me?\r\nYou're a really sweet guy,\r\n";
const char str_083E2A27[] = "A birthday present?\r\nWhat a surprise!\x05";
const char str_083E2A4E[] = "Gee, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E2A5C[] = "What a great present!\r\nYou're a really sweet guy,\r\n";
const char str_083E2A94[] = "A birthday gift?\r\nGosh, thanks.\x05";
const char str_083E2AB5[] = "What a great present!\r\nThanks so much!\x05";
const char str_083E2ADD[] = "All my father ever gives\r\nme is books...!\x05";
const char str_083E2B08[] = "Thanks! \r\nI'm so grateful!\x05";
const char str_083E2B24[] = "You mean something\r\nso nice is really for me?\x05";
const char str_083E2B53[] = "Thanks, ";
const char str_083E2B5C[] = ")!\r\nThis will come in very\r\nuseful!\x05";
const char str_083E2B81[] = "Gee, thanks  a lot!\r\nWhat a great gift!\x05";
const char str_083E2BAA[] = "Thanks a lot.\x05";
const char str_083E2BB9[] = "Thanks! I love these!\x05";
const char str_083E2BD0[] = "Thank you.\x05";
const char str_083E2BDC[] = "Th-thanks...\x05";
const char str_083E2BEA[] = "I'm allergic to these, but\r\nbut I'll give them to \r\nsomeone else, OK?\x05";
const char str_083E2C31[] = "I wish I could say\r\nthat I liked these...\x05";
const char str_083E2C5C[] = "...I don't think I could\r\nbring that home!...\x05";
const char str_083E2C8B[] = "Umm...What exactly is this?\x05";
const char str_083E2CA8[] = "Oh, so cuute!\r\n...Not you,\r\n";
const char str_083E2CCC[] = "It's so cute!\r\nI love all the animals in \r\nthis village, don't you?\x05";
const char str_083E2D11[] = "Wh-what is it...?\x05";
const char str_083E2D64[] = "Gee, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E2D72[] = "You found this stone\r\nyourself, didn't you? That \r\nmakes it even more special!\x05";
const char str_083E2DC2[] = "This is really for me?\r\nSeriously?\x05";
const char str_083E2DE6[] = "Gray's grandfather made \r\nthis, didn't he? \x05";
const char str_083E2E13[] = "I wonder if Gray ever will?\x05";
const char str_083E2E30[] = "Thanks so much!...\x05";
const char str_083E2E44[] = "Where did you get this \r\nstone? I've never seen one\r\nlike it!\x05";
const char str_083E2E83[] = "Thanks! But...\r\nWasn't it expensive...?\x05";
const char str_083E2EAC[] = "I'm glad I married you, \r\n";
const char str_083E2ECB[] = "You're a sweety!\x05";
const char str_083E2EDD[] = "This is really for me?\r\nYou mean it?\r\nWow, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E2F11[] = "This is for me?\r\nI've always wanted one \r\nlike this...Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E2F50[] = "It's every girl's dream to\r\ngrow up, get married, and\r\nreceive Perfume as a gift!\x05";
const char str_083E2FA3[] = "This is so romantic!\r\nMaybe I'll try writing a \r\nromance novel tonight...\x05";
const char str_083E2FEE[] = "Yippee!\r\nI've never had such nice\r\nPerfume before!\x05";
const char str_083E3022[] = "Why...?\r\nOh, never mind...\r\nThanks, I guess...\x05";
const char str_083E3052[] = "Thanks. You made these for\r\nthe Spring Thanksgiving\r\nFestival, right?\x05";
const char str_083E3099[] = "Thanks! \x05";
const char str_083E30A3[] = "But I can't believe I \r\ndidn't give you anything\r\nfor the Winter Thanksgiving\x05\r\nFestival...I'm sorry!\x05";
const char str_083E310A[] = "Thanks!\r\nGiving and receiving gifts \r\nare my favorite part of\x05\r\nthe Festivals!\x05";
const char str_083E315A[] = "Huh? I can't believe...\r\nWhy don't we talk at\r\nyour house...?\x05";
const char str_083E3199[] = "Congratulations!\r\nYou should really keep that\r\nfresh for the important\x05\r\ngirl, though!\x05";
const char str_083E31F1[] = "So this is a \r\nBlue Feather, huh?\x05";
const char str_083E3214[] = "Aren't they used for \r\nproposing?\x05";
const char str_083E3237[] = "If you don't already have\r\nother plans...How about\r\ncoming over to my house\x05";
const char str_083E3284[] = "tomorrow for the\r\nStarry Night Festival...?\x05";
const char str_083E32B1[] = "Sounds like fun!";
const char str_083E32C2[] = "Sorry, I've got plans.";
const char str_083E32D9[] = "Great! We'll be waiting\r\nfor you!\x05";
const char str_083E32FC[] = "Really...?\r\nWell...Never mind...\x05";
const char str_083E331E[] = "Let's spend tomorrow's \r\nStarry Night Festival \r\ntogether, OK?\x05";
const char str_083E335E[] = "I think you'll make \r\nfather, ";
const char str_083E3381[] = "You look cute with\r\nyour jaw open, you know!\x05";
const char str_083E33AF[] = "I have another life \r\ngrowing inside me...\r\nIsn't that miraculous?\x05";
const char str_083E33F3[] = "Now I have two hearts\r\nbeating inside me, \r\nnot just one!\x05";
const char str_083E342E[] = "I wish I could hear \r\nthem both...\x05";
const char str_083E3452[] = "My tummy is getting\r\nbigger all the time, \r\nisn't it?\x05";
const char str_083E3489[] = "For some reason it \r\nfeels like a boy...\x05";
const char str_083E34B3[] = "Mother told me she was\r\nthis big when she had me!\x05";
const char str_083E34E6[] = "I think the big day\r\nmight be tomorrow!\x05";
const char str_083E350F[] = "I think he just wants to \r\nmeet his dad as fast as\r\nhe can! \x05";
const char str_083E354D[] = "So, you be there during \r\nthe birth, OK?\x05";
const char str_083E3577[] = "I have an intuition it's \r\ngoing to be a boy.\x05";
const char str_083E35A6[] = "Good boy, ";
const char str_083E35B5[] = "I think the name fits him\r\nperfectly, don't you?\x05";
const char str_083E35E7[] = "He seems like he's \r\ngetting big so fast!\x05";
const char str_083E3612[] = "I just love \r\nhim so much...\x05";
const char str_083E3630[] = "He's so adorable!...\x05";
const char str_083E3646[] = "Raising a child is \r\nharder than I thought!\x05";
const char str_083E3673[] = "It's true what they say,\r\nthat children look like \r\nangels when they're asleep.\x05";
const char str_083E36C4[] = "Can you believe he's \r\nalready walking?\x05";
const char str_083E36ED[] = "He's cute even when\r\nhe stumbles!\x05";
const char str_083E3710[] = "You can tell he's trying \r\nto talk! I can't understand\r\nwhat he's saying, though...\x05";
const char str_083E3765[] = "I just know that he's \r\ngoing to love playing \r\noutside with you! He looks\x05\r\nlike a born farmer!\x05";
const char str_083E37C7[] = "...Aren't you a little \r\ncold to me, lately?\x05";
const char str_083E37F5[] = "I know you have to work,\r\nbut it would be nice if \r\nyou spent a little more\x05\r\ntime with me, too...\x05";
const char str_083E3859[] = "Mornin'!\x05";
const char str_083E3863[] = "I'm not mad at you.\r\nReally, I'm not!\x05";
const char str_083E388A[] = "I've got to fix a \r\nmeal, so I'll talk to you\r\nlater, ";
const char str_083E38C5[] = "Don't bother me when\r\nI'm trying to do something\r\nfor you, ";
const char str_083E3905[] = "Work hard, now!\x05";
const char str_083E3916[] = "I think I was better at\r\nworking at the Library...\x05";
const char str_083E394A[] = "I don't know what you\r\nthink about it, but I \r\nreally value my job...\x05";
const char str_083E3991[] = "Good morning.\r\nDid you sleep well?\x05";
const char str_083E39B5[] = "Keep up the \r\nhard work!\x05";
const char str_083E39CF[] = "Ever since marrying you,\r\nI've thought of completely\r\ndifferent ideas for novels!\x05";
const char str_083E3A22[] = "I won't tell you right now,\r\nbut maybe I'll show you\r\nwhen it's done!\x05";
const char str_083E3A69[] = "Good morning, ";
const char str_083E3A78[] = ")!\r\nSometimes I'm just so glad \r\nI married you!\x05";
const char str_083E3AA9[] = "No one understands me\r\nlike you do, ";
const char str_083E3AD2[] = "What?!\r\nYou're already hungry?\x05";
const char str_083E3AF2[] = "You sure do \r\nwork up an appetite!\x05";
const char str_083E3B16[] = "Oh, ";
const char str_083E3B1B[] = ").\r\nNice to see you here. \x05";
const char str_083E3B37[] = "Don't worry. I'm not\r\nlifting anything heavy.\x05";
const char str_083E3B66[] = "Oh, ";
const char str_083E3B6B[] = ").\r\nNice to see you. \x05";
const char str_083E3B82[] = "I'm glad I'll be able to\r\nwork even with a baby...\x05";
const char str_083E3BB6[] = "What?\x05";
const char str_083E3BBD[] = "I'm a little busy \r\nright now...\x05";
const char str_083E3BDF[] = "What?\r\nQuiet in the Library!\x05";
const char str_083E3BFD[] = "Don't you have any work \r\nto do? If you're so bored,\r\ngo read a book.\x05";
const char str_083E3C44[] = "Thanks for coming.\r\nWork is fun, you know, when\r\nyou like what you do!\x05";
const char str_083E3C8C[] = "Thanks for not minding\r\nme working...\x05";
const char str_083E3CB3[] = "Oh, ";
const char str_083E3CB8[] = ").\r\nDid you come to check\r\nout a book?\x05";
const char str_083E3CE0[] = "Did you come to \r\ncheck on me?\x05";
const char str_083E3D00[] = "I'm not a child, you know!\r\n...Thanks, though.\x05";
const char str_083E3D30[] = "Welcome, ";
const char str_083E3D3E[] = "Not many people love books\r\nas much as you, you know.\x05";
const char str_083E3D75[] = "But then again, \r\nyour MY hubby!\x05";
const char str_083E3D97[] = "Oh, hello.\x05";
const char str_083E3DA3[] = "Gray and I agree on most\r\neverything. Maybe he reads \r\nthe same books I do...\x05";
const char str_083E3DF2[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083E3DFE[] = "Gray and I have hardly\r\nchanged since our marriage.\x05";
const char str_083E3E33[] = "He works under Saibara and\r\nI at the Library.\x05";
const char str_083E3E62[] = "Oh, hello, ";
const char str_083E3E72[] = "I'm so glad Gray and my dad\r\nare getting along!\x05";
const char str_083E3EA3[] = "Gray's grandfather is \r\nvery nice, too.\x05";
const char str_083E3ECC[] = "Oh, hello, ";
const char str_083E3ED8[] = "!.\r\nCome to read a book?\x05";
const char str_083E3EF2[] = "Gray always vows to quit \r\nhis apprenticeship whenever he \r\ncomes home. \x05";
const char str_083E3F3C[] = "The next day, he always \r\ngoes back, though. \x05";
const char str_083E3F6B[] = "Oh, hello, ";
const char str_083E3F77[] = "!.\r\nHow is farm\r\nlife going?\x05";
const char str_083E3F95[] = "The other day I went to\r\nmeet Gray's parents.\x05";
const char str_083E3FC4[] = "I was surprised at how close\r\nthey lived to my old house.\x05";
const char str_083E3FFF[] = "I'm glad Gray decided he \r\nlikes books, but I also\r\nwish he'd pick up other\x05\r\ninterests as well!\x05";
const char str_083E4065[] = "!!\r\nBet you came to \r\nread a book, huh?\x05";
const char str_083E408E[] = "I like you because you \r\nlike to read, ";
const char str_083E40BB[] = "I like it when more people\r\nread my books!\x05";
const char str_083E40E7[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E40EC[] = "!. \r\nHow are you today?\x05";
const char str_083E4105[] = "You look well.\x05";
const char str_083E4115[] = "Is life on the farm\r\nbusy these days, \r\n";
const char str_083E4142[] = "Is married life easier than\r\nlife as a bachelor?\x05";
const char str_083E4174[] = "Now you can concentrate on\r\nfarm work, right?\x05";
const char str_083E41A3[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E41A8[] = "!. \r\nHow's your wife?\x05";
const char str_083E41BF[] = "Tell your wife I want to\r\ncome over to chat!\x05";
const char str_083E41ED[] = "Hee hee hee...\x05";
const char str_083E41FD[] = "I can't wait to be \r\nmarried! Ever since I was a\r\nlittle girl, I dreamed of \x05\r\nmyself in a wedding dress...\x05";
const char str_083E426A[] = "Hi. \x05";
const char str_083E4270[] = "We built this Library so \r\nthe townspeople could have\r\naccess to my dad's books.\x05";
const char str_083E42C2[] = "We get new books in \r\nall the time, so you should\r\ncome back often!\x05";
const char str_083E4307[] = "Hello!\x05";
const char str_083E430F[] = "Doesn't this town remind\r\nyou of a village in a \r\nfairy tale...?\x05";
const char str_083E4351[] = "Hi.  \r\nHow is life on the farm?\x05";
const char str_083E4372[] = "Will you teach me about \r\nfarm stuff?\x05";
const char str_083E4399[] = "I love to learn new things,\r\nyou know!\x05";
const char str_083E43C1[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E43C6[] = "!!\r\nI love it when people \r\ncome to read our books!\x05";
const char str_083E43FB[] = "I love the smell of books.\r\nI think they smell like\r\nthe inside of a forest...\x05\r\nor a fairy tale!\x05";
const char str_083E445E[] = "Oh...Hello.\x05";
const char str_083E446B[] = "It's too bad that not\r\neverybody visits \r\nour Library so often.\x05";
const char str_083E44AC[] = "So you came!\r\nThank you!\x05";
const char str_083E44C6[] = "I can't imagine quitting \r\nmy job here just because\r\nI get married. \x05";
const char str_083E450C[] = "I want more people to \r\ncome here and read books!\x05";
const char str_083E453F[] = "Hell-ooh....\x05";
const char str_083E454D[] = "For some reason I just\r\ngot queasy all of \r\na sudden!\x05";
const char str_083E4584[] = "The Library is closed on\r\nThursdays now. \r\nDon't forget!\x05";
const char str_083E45BE[] = "I like to go to the peak of\r\nMother's Hill on sunny \r\ndays around noon.\x05";
const char str_083E4607[] = "Saibara is there sometimes,\r\ntoo, but for some reason\r\nGray never comes!\x05";
const char str_083E4651[] = "On Thursdays when the \r\nweather isn't nice, Gray\r\nand I usually visit his\x05\r\ngrandfather. \x05";
const char str_083E46AC[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E46B1[] = "!. \r\nDid you come to see Gray?\x05";
const char str_083E46D1[] = "You're always so\r\ngood to Gray!\x05";
const char str_083E46F2[] = "Sorry, ";
const char str_083E46FA[] = "!, \r\nbut the Library is\r\nclosed today.\x05";
const char str_083E4722[] = "On Mondays the whole \r\nfamily helps out dad \r\non Mother's Hill.\x05";
const char str_083E4763[] = "Today it's raining, so we\r\ncan't go hiking. But, the\r\nLibrary is still closed. \x05";
const char str_083E47B4[] = "After all, nobody would\r\ncome today anyway!\x05";
const char str_083E47E1[] = "Was there a specific \r\nbook you wanted to \r\nread, ";
const char str_083E4818[] = "The library is usually open\r\nfrom 10 AM to 4 PM.\x05";
const char str_083E484A[] = "Why don't you come then?\x05";
const char str_083E4864[] = "Good morning!\r\nWhat a beautiful day!\x05";
const char str_083E488A[] = "Is the farm fun for you?\x05";
const char str_083E48A4[] = "Hi there.\x05";
const char str_083E48AF[] = "Be careful not to catch\r\ncold now, ";
const char str_083E48D7[] = "Sorry, but the Library is\r\nclosed today. \x05";
const char str_083E4902[] = "Our day off changed\r\nto Thursday.\x05";
const char str_083E4925[] = "Sorry, but the Library is\r\nclosed today. \x05";
const char str_083E4950[] = "We all go to help Dad on\r\nMother's Hill once a week.\x05";
const char str_083E4986[] = "Hi. Today is our day\r\noff here at the Library.\x05";
const char str_083E49B6[] = "What a coincidence!\r\nToday I'm helping Mom. \x05";
const char str_083E49E4[] = "Mom always buys \r\nway too much at the\r\nSupermarket!\x05";
const char str_083E4A19[] = "I didn't expect to find \r\nyou here, ";
const char str_083E4A42[] = "Are you looking for \r\nplants, too?\x05";
const char str_083E4A66[] = "Papa drags us to the \r\nmountain even in Winter!\x05";
const char str_083E4A97[] = "He does let us stay home\r\nif it's snowing, though.\x05";
const char str_083E4ACB[] = "Hi there.\r\nGoing to the mountain is\r\nmore fun with Gray than\x05\r\nwith Dad. \x05";
const char str_083E4B16[] = "Of course, Dad never\r\nlooks up from the ground\r\non Mother's Hill.\x05";
const char str_083E4B59[] = "Working as a Blacksmith\r\nis really dangerous, \r\nyou know. \x05";
const char str_083E4B95[] = "I like Gray's grandfather.\x05";
const char str_083E4BB1[] = "He's so hard and \r\ndisciplined compared with\r\nmy own family!\x05";
const char str_083E4BF0[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083E4BF8[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083E55F3[] = " JUMP";
const char str_083E5FE8[] = "STR ";
const char str_083E6088[] = "Now, you're a new face\r\naround here...Oh, I know.\r\nyou're that new boy at \x05\r\nthe farm!\x05";
const char str_083E60E0[] = "My name is Anna, and it's\r\na pleasure to meet you!\x05";
const char str_083E6114[] = "Really? This is for me?\x05";
const char str_083E612D[] = "Usually only my family \r\ngives me gifts...Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E6160[] = "Thank you so much!\r\nThis is a wonderful \r\nsurprise birthday present!\x05";
const char str_083E61A6[] = "Thanks for such a \r\nnice gift!\x05";
const char str_083E61C6[] = "Thanks! I love these!\x05";
const char str_083E61DD[] = "I hate to tell you, but...\r\nI really hate these!\x05";
const char str_083E620F[] = "Still, it is a present, so\r\nI'll take it...\x05";
const char str_083E623C[] = "Gross! What is it...?\x05";
const char str_083E6253[] = "It's so cute!\x05";
const char str_083E6262[] = "My dad says plants are\r\ncute... I don";
const char str_083E6288[] = "ft know why.\x05";
const char str_083E6296[] = "Why would you show \r\nsomething so nasty\r\nto me...?!\x05";
const char str_083E62CB[] = "How lovely! Is it\r\na designer brand...?\x05";
const char str_083E62F4[] = "Just kidding, I bet Saibara \r\nmade it, right?\x05";
const char str_083E6324[] = "Thanks! I was just thinking\r\nI wanted one of these...\x05";
const char str_083E635B[] = "Unlike my husband, you \r\nknow what women want!\x05";
const char str_083E638B[] = "What a nice fragrance!\r\nWomen just love to receive\r\nPerfume, you know. \x05";
const char str_083E63D4[] = "Ah...a Blue Feather...\r\nI wish Basil had used one\r\nto propose to me...\x05";
const char str_083E641C[] = "Oh, ";
const char str_083E6421[] = "!. \r\nHow is ";
const char str_083E642E[] = "*? \r\nI can't wait to meet him!\x05";
const char str_083E644E[] = "Can you believe it?\x05";
const char str_083E6463[] = "Basil wants to take \r\n";
const char str_083E647A[] = "* to the \r\nmountains to make a \x05\r\nbotanist out of him!\x05";
const char str_083E64B2[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083E64BF[] = "Have you ready Basil \r\nbooks? He has lots \r\nin the Library.\x05";
const char str_083E64FC[] = "He says that the books \r\nabout this town are more \r\npopular than the ones about\x05\r\nplants...\x05";
const char str_083E6559[] = "I think he wishes it were\r\nthe other way around!\x05";
const char str_083E658B[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083E6593[] = "!. \r\nI was just remembering the \r\ntime when Basil chased a \x05\r\nbutterfly off a cliff!\x05";
const char str_083E65E9[] = "Basil likes to go \r\ndrinking at night...\x05";
const char str_083E6613[] = "Men!\x05";
const char str_083E6619[] = "Good morning, ";
const char str_083E6628[] = "!. \r\nAnother tough day, huh?\x05";
const char str_083E6646[] = "I kind of envy you,\r\n";
const char str_083E6661[] = "You see...I get bored with \r\nnothing to do!\x05";
const char str_083E668E[] = "I see it's raining today.\r\nI hope Basil doesn't \r\ncatch cold!\x05";
const char str_083E66CD[] = "I was praying for \r\ngood weather last night, \r\nbut look at this!\x05";
const char str_083E670F[] = "That Basil doesn't care\r\nif it rains or pours.  \r\nHe loves looking at plants!\x05";
const char str_083E675E[] = "I wonder what I should do \r\nwhen I get home...\x05";
const char str_083E678E[] = "Basil won't play with me\r\nanyway...Hmmph!\x05";
const char str_083E67B9[] = "Most of the wives in town\r\ngather at Rose Square \r\naround noon.\x05";
const char str_083E67FA[] = "I don't bring Basil, though.\r\nHe only talks about plants!\x05";
const char str_083E6835[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083E683D[] = "!. \r\nI'm happy to see you \r\nlooking happy and healthy!\x05";
const char str_083E6875[] = "Today is my shopping day. \x05";
const char str_083E6891[] = "I like going to the \r\nSupermarket to buy things.\x05";
const char str_083E68C3[] = "Have you been watching the\r\nTV Shopping Network?\x05";
const char str_083E68F5[] = "I suggest a Pot. You can't\r\ncook anything without it!\x05";
const char str_083E692C[] = "Jeff works so hard, too.\x05";
const char str_083E6946[] = "It must be hard, \r\nrunning a store!\x05";
const char str_083E696B[] = "I don't run up a tab!\r\nBut...Sometimes I do \r\nforget my wallet...\x05";
const char str_083E69AE[] = "Mister......did....\r\n...Can you believe....\r\nthen...his wife...\x05";
const char str_083E69EF[] = "In order to heal her, \r\nLillia's husband went off\r\nto find a flower that only\x05\r\nblooms in the desert once\r\nevery ten years.\x05";
const char str_083E6A6C[] = "I think she's lonely \r\nhim...\x05";
const char str_083E6A8B[] = "Maybe I shouldn't have told\r\nhim about that flower!...\x05";
const char str_083E6AC3[] = "Our Monday hiking days\r\nare prime family time. \x05";
const char str_083E6AF4[] = "But, all we do is talk\r\nabout plants! I'm worried \r\nMary won't know about\x05\r\nnormal things!\x05";
const char str_083E6B50[] = "Still, Mother's Hill is fun\r\nbecause so many things \r\ngrow there. \x05";
const char str_083E6B94[] = "Maybe I'll make \r\nsome more jam...\x05";
const char str_083E6BB8[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083E6BC0[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083E726C[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083E7C38[] = "STR ";
const char str_083E7C90[] = "I've set up shop here, \r\nand I've got great stuff!\x05";
const char str_083E7CC4[] = "My name is Won.\x05";
const char str_083E7CD5[] = "Today is my birthday!\r\nThis is so unbelievable!\x05";
const char str_083E7D06[] = "This is the best present \r\nsince I left China!\x05";
const char str_083E7D36[] = "You are a very good\r\nperson, giving so nice a\r\ngift to someone like me.\x05";
const char str_083E7D7F[] = "Thank you.\r\nI like these.\r\nWant to buy something?\x05";
const char str_083E7DB2[] = "Thanks.\r\nWant to buy something?\x05";
const char str_083E7DD3[] = "Sorry, but I'm not\r\nso sure about this!\r\nWhat's it for...?\x05";
const char str_083E7E0F[] = "Are you trying to make\r\nme mad at you?\r\nThat's not very nice!\x05";
const char str_083E7E4E[] = "Do you like animals?\r\nI have some great ones to\r\nsell! Secret price only for\x05\r\nyou. Rare bugs, too!\x05";
const char str_083E7EB3[] = "Sorry, but I couldn't\r\nsell this to anyone! \r\nTry giving it to someone \r\nelse, OK?\x05";
const char str_083E7F07[] = "You mean you're giving\r\nthis to me for FREE?\x05";
const char str_083E7F35[] = "I can sell this for lots...\x05";
const char str_083E7F52[] = "I mean, er...I'll treasure \r\nit forever. Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E7F84[] = "You mean you're giving\r\nthis to me for FREE?\x05";
const char str_083E7FB2[] = "I can sell this for lots to\r\nthe right woman...\x05";
const char str_083E7FE3[] = "I mean, er...I'll treasure \r\nit forever. Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E8015[] = "I'll buy that off you for\r\na great price!\x05";
const char str_083E8040[] = "You mean it's a gift?\r\nYou are truly a saint!\x05";
const char str_083E806F[] = "Good luck! If it\r\ndoesn't work out, I \r\npromise to buy it back.\x05";
const char str_083E80B0[] = "What's wrong?\x05";
const char str_083E80BF[] = "I've got one of everything!\x05";
const char str_083E80DC[] = "Well, are you going to \r\nbuy something, or no?\x05";
const char str_083E810C[] = "I hate cheap people.\r\nPeople with expensive \r\ntastes...those are my kind\x05\r\nof people!\x05";
const char str_083E8163[] = "Thanks for coming,\r\n";
const char str_083E8178[] = "!! \r\nTake your time!\x05";
const char str_083E818E[] = "Where are all the \r\ncustomers? Everyone ignores\r\nme but you, ";
const char str_083E81D0[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083E81D8[] = "SCR CODEL";
const char str_083E8D30[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083E97CC[] = "Oh, I'd forgotten!\r\nThanks for the great \r\nbirthday present!\x05";
const char str_083E980A[] = "What a fantastic gift!\r\nHow did you know I love\r\nthese so much? Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E9853[] = "This is for me? \r\nGee, thanks...I love these!\x05";
const char str_083E9882[] = "Wow, thanks...\r\nI'll remember this!\x05";
const char str_083E98A7[] = "Err...Thanks...\x05";
const char str_083E98B8[] = "Are you trying to goad\r\nme into losing my temper, \r\n";
const char str_083E98F1[] = "I guess you're used to \r\nbugs, if you work on \r\na farm!\x05";
const char str_083E992A[] = "Yikes!\r\nGet it away from me!\x05";
const char str_083E9948[] = "Now this is a great one...!\r\nThanks! I think I'll give \r\nit to Harris' wife when\x05\r\nhe gets married!\x05";
const char str_083E99AD[] = "Well this is very fancy!\x05";
const char str_083E99C7[] = "Oh...You mean it's for me?\r\nI can't exactly use it,\r\nbut I'll give it to \x05\r\nHarris' wife when he gets\x05\r\nmarried.\x05";
const char str_083E9A39[] = "I bet the animals get\r\nscared when you put this on!\x05";
const char str_083E9A6E[] = "Oh, it's for me? Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083E9A88[] = "Congratulations!\r\nWho's the lucky girl, \r\nif I may ask?\x05";
const char str_083E9AC1[] = "Have you heard of the\r\nForget-me-not Valley?\x05";
const char str_083E9AEF[] = "I hear there's someone \r\nthere named ";
const char str_083E9B15[] = ",\r\nwho is very popular. \x05";
const char str_083E9B2F[] = "I'd like to meet him...\x05";
const char str_083E9B48[] = "A long time ago, someone\r\nnamed Kano used to stay at\r\nmy house. \x05";
const char str_083E9B8A[] = "He used to love taking \r\npictures of Mineral Town.\x05";
const char str_083E9BBE[] = "One day, though, he just \r\nleft a letter and vanished.\x05";
const char str_083E9BF6[] = "I wonder where he is now?\x05";
const char str_083E9C11[] = "There's nothing more \r\npleasing to a mayor than \r\na peaceful village!\x05";
const char str_083E9C58[] = "You should at least \r\nrest on the weekends, \r\n";
const char str_083E9C8B[] = "I bet that's not going\r\nto happen though, is it?\x05";
const char str_083E9CBD[] = "Hmmm...Looks like it's not\r\ngoing to stop. \x05";
const char str_083E9CEA[] = "And I was going to go to \r\nthe Square, too!\x05";
const char str_083E9D17[] = "Ellen and I always eat \r\nApple Pie together on the\r\nweekends. \x05";
const char str_083E9D57[] = "The Apple Pie at the \r\nInn is the best!\x05";
const char str_083E9D80[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E9D85[] = "!. \r\nI'm off to go shopping!\x05";
const char str_083E9DA3[] = "Well, if it isn't \r\n";
const char str_083E9DBD[] = "How are you enjoying \r\nlife on the farm?\x05";
const char str_083E9DE7[] = "I'm sure it will take some\r\ngetting used to.\x05";
const char str_083E9E15[] = "A farm is a complicated \r\nplace, after all!\x05";
const char str_083E9E42[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E9E47[] = "!!\r\nHave you gotten the hang\r\nof farming, yet?\x05";
const char str_083E9E77[] = "Myself...I know more about\r\nrunning towns than farms!\x05";
const char str_083E9EAE[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083E9EB3[] = "!!\r\nI hear you've been doing\r\nmighty well at the farm!\x05";
const char str_083E9EEB[] = "People like me depend on\r\npeople like you to grow our\r\nfood, \x05\r\nso you have my gratitude!\x05";
const char str_083E9F46[] = "Hey there, ";
const char str_083E9F52[] = "!. \r\nDid you come here for a \r\nrest, too?\x05";
const char str_083E9F7D[] = "I bet the animals are happy\r\non days like today, eh?\x05";
const char str_083E9FB3[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083E9FBB[] = "!. \r\nHave you come to like \r\nour town yet?\x05";
const char str_083E9FE7[] = "Just come to me if you\r\never get into any trouble.\r\nI give great advice.\x05";
const char str_083EA031[] = "Do you think this \r\nrain will continue...?\x05";
const char str_083EA05D[] = "I was going to the Square, \r\nso I wish it were sunny...\x05";
const char str_083EA096[] = "Is there something new up \r\non the bulletin board?\r\nI forget.\x05";
const char str_083EA0D5[] = "Too bad about this rain...\x05";
const char str_083EA0F1[] = "And it's my day off, too!\x05";
const char str_083EA10C[] = "Harris always comes by the \r\nInn at this hour, so I like\r\nto wait for him here on \x05\r\nrainy days.\x05";
const char str_083EA16E[] = "Just to make sure everything\r\nis OK, you understand.\x05";
const char str_083EA1A4[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083EA1AC[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083EF2AF[] = " JUMPL\n";
const char str_083EFD04[] = "STR ";
const char str_083EFF64[] = "Now, I haven't seen \r\nyour face around here... \x05";
const char str_083EFF95[] = "Are you the new owner \r\nof that farm? \x05";
const char str_083EFFBD[] = "I guess I should introduce \r\nmyself. My name is \r\nElli. Nice to meet you! \x05";
const char str_083F0009[] = "A birthday present? \r\nFor me?! How great! \x05";
const char str_083F0035[] = "Thanks! I'm happy to \r\nget birthday presents no\r\nmatter how old I get! \x05";
const char str_083F007E[] = "You mean this is a \r\nbirthday present...for me? \x05";
const char str_083F00B0[] = "Can I really accept \r\nsomething so valuable...? \x05";
const char str_083F00E2[] = "A birthday present? \r\nFor me? What a nice \r\nsurprise! \x05";
const char str_083F011A[] = "This is for me? \r\nWhat a nice gift. Thanks.\x05";
const char str_083F0147[] = "Thanks, ";
const char str_083F0150[] = "). \r\nI'm so glad I \r\nmarried you! \x05";
const char str_083F0174[] = "This is for me? \r\nThanks! You're sweet! \x05";
const char str_083F019E[] = "Thanks, ";
const char str_083F01A7[] = "). \r\nI love these, you know. \x05";
const char str_083F01C6[] = "Thanks! What a great \r\ngift? Is it really for me? \x05";
const char str_083F01FA[] = "You're a always so nice\r\nto me! Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083F0223[] = "Thanks! This is great!\x05";
const char str_083F023B[] = "Thanks.\x05";
const char str_083F0244[] = "What's this?\r\nWill you get mad if \r\nI don't accept it?\x05";
const char str_083F027C[] = "I really should try to like\r\nthis, I know...I always \r\ntell Stu to accept gifts...\x05";
const char str_083F02D0[] = "I think you need a change\r\nin attitude, if you're \r\ngoing around giving things\x05\r\nlike this to people!\x05";
const char str_083F0337[] = "Why would you give this\r\nto me? Do you hate me?\x05";
const char str_083F038A[] = "It's so cute!\r\nDo you like him too?\x05";
const char str_083F0439[] = "Thanks! You are\r\nso kind!\x05";
const char str_083F0454[] = "Can I really accept it?\r\nIt looks so valuable!\x05";
const char str_083F0484[] = "Yeah! Is this really\r\nfor me? I'll treasure it \r\nalways!\x05";
const char str_083F04BE[] = "Thanks...!\r\nI had no idea I'd get such\r\na wonderful present!\x05";
const char str_083F04FC[] = "Thanks! It must have\r\nbeen very expensive!\x05";
const char str_083F0528[] = "Wow, this is great!\r\nYou're really giving me\r\nsuch a nice present?\x05";
const char str_083F056C[] = "Perfume! What a nice gift.\r\nI can't wait to put \r\nit on...!\x05";
const char str_083F05A9[] = "Thanks. I can't\r\nwait to use it.\x05";
const char str_083F05CB[] = "I've never ever gotten\r\nanything so nice! \r\nThank you so much!\x05";
const char str_083F060B[] = "What...?\r\nI don't want...\r\nWait, it looks pretty good!\x05";
const char str_083F0643[] = "You don't mean anything\r\nby this, do you...?\x05";
const char str_083F0671[] = "Cookies for the \r\nThanksgiving Festival?\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083F06A4[] = "Now I'm embarrassed \r\nI didn't give anything to\r\nyou last year!\x05";
const char str_083F06E5[] = "...Thanks! \r\nYou really are a \r\ngentleman, you know that?\x05";
const char str_083F0720[] = "I'm so nervous all the\r\nsudden...Let's just go to\r\nyour house, OK?\x05";
const char str_083F0764[] = "You look nervous.\r\nRelax!\x05";
const char str_083F077F[] = "Sorry, but I can't leave\r\nthe Doctor's side.\x05";
const char str_083F07AD[] = "Do you want to come to my \r\nhouse tomorrow for the \r\nStarry Night Festival?\x05";
const char str_083F07FA[] = "Grandma and Stu will be \r\nso pleased!\x05";
const char str_083F0821[] = "Sounds like fun.";
const char str_083F0832[] = "Sorry, I have other plans.";
const char str_083F084D[] = "We'll make lots of \r\ngreat food!\x05";
const char str_083F086F[] = "I guess I should have \r\nknown you'd already\r\nhave plans...\x05";
const char str_083F08AB[] = "We'll make lots of \r\ndelicious food, so just\r\nyou wait!\x05";
const char str_083F08E4[] = "I'm so glad! I've wanted\r\na baby for so long!\x05";
const char str_083F0913[] = "Why don't you name him,\r\n";
const char str_083F092D[] = ")? Or am I \r\ntaking things too fast?\x05";
const char str_083F0953[] = "Good morning. The baby is\r\nfine.\x05";
const char str_083F0975[] = "I'm so glad I was born a \r\nwoman! What a miraculous \r\nexperience this is!\x05";
const char str_083F09C0[] = "Good morning. \r\nI could feel the baby \r\nmoving last night!\x05";
const char str_083F09FC[] = "It's so active...\r\nI bet it's a boy!\x05";
const char str_083F0A22[] = "The Doctor said the baby is\r\ndue tomorrow, so \r\nstick around, OK?\x05";
const char str_083F0A65[] = "Don't worry, you can leave\r\nthe hard part \r\nto the Doctor!\x05";
const char str_083F0AA1[] = "Stu is telling everybody\r\nthat he's going to have a\r\nyounger brother!\x05";
const char str_083F0AE8[] = "Grandma is also so \r\nhappy about ";
const char str_083F0B0E[] = "I know everybody thinks\r\ntheir own baby is the \r\ncutest, but...!\x05";
const char str_083F0B50[] = "Stu comes often to look\r\nat the baby.\x05";
const char str_083F0B77[] = "He's so curious about it!\x05";
const char str_083F0B92[] = "He can already stand up, \r\nsee! Pretty soon he'll\r\nbe walking!\x05";
const char str_083F0BD2[] = "Now he's so big I get\r\ntired holding him!\x05";
const char str_083F0BFD[] = "This makes me remember when\r\nStu was small...\x05";
const char str_083F0C2C[] = "Now that I think about it,\r\nI was a little too \r\nstrict with him!\x05";
const char str_083F0C6F[] = "When he gets older \r\nhe'll start making friends!\x05";
const char str_083F0CA1[] = "Good morning!\x05";
const char str_083F0CB1[] = "* wants to\r\ntalk to you, see!\x05";
const char str_083F0CD0[] = "What if he becomes sassy\r\nlike Stu always was...?\x05";
const char str_083F0D03[] = "I hope I raise him right...\x05";
const char str_083F0D20[] = "Sorry, but I'm too tired\r\nto talk right now...\x05";
const char str_083F0D5C[] = "Mornin'!\x05";
const char str_083F0D66[] = "How about going to work?\x05";
const char str_083F0D89[] = "How about going to eat at\r\nthe Inn tonight?\x05";
const char str_083F0DB6[] = "Work hard today, dear.\x05";
const char str_083F0DCE[] = "Another day, another \r\nset of meals to make...\x05";
const char str_083F0DFE[] = "Why don't you go work\r\nnow and leave me alone?\x05";
const char str_083F0E2E[] = "Good morning!\r\nHow are you feeling?\x05";
const char str_083F0E53[] = "Don't overdo it, now!\x05";
const char str_083F0E6A[] = "After all, think of all\r\nthe time you'll waste if \r\nyou have to check into\x05\r\nthe Clinic?\x05";
const char str_083F0EC4[] = "Did you wash your hands yet?\x05";
const char str_083F0EE2[] = "I'm sorry! I haven't quite\r\ngotten the hang of cooking\r\nyet! Don't get sick...\x05";
const char str_083F0F32[] = "Good morning, ";
const char str_083F0F45[] = "Another day, 100 more \r\njobs to do!\x05";
const char str_083F0F6A[] = "Resting? \r\nIt is a good idea not to\r\nwork too hard...\x05";
const char str_083F0FA1[] = "What do you think\r\nyou're doing, \r\n";
const char str_083F0FCD[] = "Don't worry, the baby will\r\nbe fine! We can count \r\non the Doctor, after all.\x05";
const char str_083F101C[] = "Instead of worrying, \r\nwhy don't you go work?\x05";
const char str_083F104B[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F1050[] = ").\r\nIs ";
const char str_083F1058[] = "* \r\nbehaving without me?\x05";
const char str_083F1072[] = "After all, we have to\r\nwork for ";
const char str_083F1093[] = "*, \r\ntoo!\x05";
const char str_083F109E[] = "You're getting in my way!\r\nIf you aren't sick, \r\ngo home and work!\x05";
const char str_083F1102[] = "What's wrong?\x05";
const char str_083F1111[] = "I'll be home at the\r\nusual time, so you go home\r\nnow, OK?\x05";
const char str_083F114C[] = "Shouldn't you be working?\x05";
const char str_083F1167[] = "Have the Doctor look at \r\nyou right away if you don't\r\nfeel well!\x05";
const char str_083F11AA[] = "What's wrong?\r\nMy cooking didn't give you\r\nindigestion, did it?\x05";
const char str_083F11EB[] = "For people who say things\r\nlike that...we use the \r\nextra big needles!\x05";
const char str_083F1233[] = "Are you feeling bad, \r\n";
const char str_083F124F[] = "You're OK?\x05";
const char str_083F125B[] = "Thank goodness! Sometimes\r\nI get so worried about you!\x05";
const char str_083F1293[] = "Are you feeling bad, \r\n";
const char str_083F12AF[] = "If you think you're sick, \r\ngo see the Doctor\r\nimmediately!\x05";
const char str_083F12EC[] = "Did you come to buy\r\nsome medicine?\x05";
const char str_083F1311[] = "I think it takes real \r\ncourage to get married.\x05";
const char str_083F1342[] = "Everyone says I blush like a\r\nlittle girl in front of the \r\nDoctor.\x05";
const char str_083F1387[] = "Almost like we aren't\r\nmarried at all. \x05";
const char str_083F13B0[] = "I want a baby as soon\r\nas possible. I took care of\r\nStu, so I think I know how\x05\r\nto take care of babies!\x05";
const char str_083F141A[] = "The Doctor asks if I'll \r\nstay with him at the Clinic\r\nfor good. \x05";
const char str_083F145D[] = "I told him I would for as\r\nlong as I could...\x05";
const char str_083F148C[] = "Hi there. Do you need\r\nto se the Doctor? \r\nDoes it hurt somewhere?\x05";
const char str_083F14D0[] = "I just realized recently\r\nthat the Doctor looks\r\na lot like my dad...\x05";
const char str_083F1517[] = "Are you OK?\r\nHave you caught a cold?\x05";
const char str_083F153D[] = "Working with a doctor\r\nis really interesting,\r\nyou know.\x05";
const char str_083F1577[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083F1583[] = "How are you feeling?\r\nIf you feel bad, don't \r\nhesitate to tell the Doc!\x05";
const char str_083F15CD[] = "You seem so happy, \r\n";
const char str_083F15E7[] = "I smile just looking\r\nat you!\x05";
const char str_083F1606[] = "Say 'hi' to your wife\r\nfor me, ";
const char str_083F162A[] = "Are things going smoothly\r\nbetween you and your wife?\x05";
const char str_083F1661[] = "Don't fight with your\r\nwife, now! Just do what\r\nshe says, ha ha..\x05";
const char str_083F16A4[] = "My grandmother is so\r\nhappy about our marriage!\x05";
const char str_083F16D5[] = "Stu is happy, too.\r\nHe thinks he'll get to\r\nplay with you more!\x05";
const char str_083F1716[] = "Is there anything wrong?\x05";
const char str_083F1730[] = "If you need to buy medicine,\r\ntalk to me. If you need to\r\nbe examined, ask\x05\r\nthe Doctor.\x05";
const char str_083F178A[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F178F[] = "!.\r\nIs something the matter?\x05";
const char str_083F17AD[] = "Work on the farm must be so\r\nexhausting! I can't believe\r\nyou do it.\x05";
const char str_083F17F4[] = "We've always been midwives \r\nin our family, all the way \r\nup to my great-grandmother!\x05";
const char str_083F184B[] = "The flu seems to be going\r\naround, so wash your hands\r\n5 times a day.\x05";
const char str_083F1892[] = "You know my grandmother, \r\ndon't you?\x05";
const char str_083F18B9[] = "I'm hoping I'll learn \r\nenough to help her here. \x05";
const char str_083F18EC[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F18F1[] = "!.\r\nHave you gotten used to\r\nfarm life, yet?\x05";
const char str_083F191F[] = "Why did you come to\r\nthis town, ";
const char str_083F1944[] = "I'm curious. \x05";
const char str_083F1953[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083F195B[] = "!!\r\nAre you feeling ill?\x05";
const char str_083F1975[] = "I'm glad to see you, \r\n";
const char str_083F198D[] = "!, but I worry\r\nwhen you show up here!\x05";
const char str_083F19B5[] = "Maybe I'll quit the Clinic\r\nwhen I get married...\x05";
const char str_083F19E8[] = "I'm not sure I have enough\r\nstrength to be both a wife \r\nand a nurse!\x05";
const char str_083F1A2F[] = "Good morning, ";
const char str_083F1A3E[] = "!.\r\nToday the Clinic is closed,\r\nso I'm stay home to\x05\r\ntake care of Grandma.\x05";
const char str_083F1A8C[] = "The Doctor likes to search \r\nfor wild herbs on the \r\nmountain, you know.\x05";
const char str_083F1AD6[] = "When it's rainy, though, he\r\ntalks to Carter. I wonder \r\nwhat they talk about?...\x05";
const char str_083F1B29[] = "Good morning, ";
const char str_083F1B38[] = "!.\r\nI think the Doctor\r\ncan see you now.\x05";
const char str_083F1B62[] = "But...wait!\x05";
const char str_083F1B6F[] = "Unless you're in a hurry, \r\nwould you mind waiting\r\nuntil opening time?\x05";
const char str_083F1BB8[] = "I like to let him rest \r\nin the mornings...\x05";
const char str_083F1BE5[] = "Today I'm going shopping.\r\nBoth for me and the Doctor.\x05";
const char str_083F1C1D[] = "Days off sure are \r\nrelaxing!\x05";
const char str_083F1C3C[] = "But...I do find myself\r\nmissing the Doctor...\x05";
const char str_083F1C6B[] = "There's more work tomorrow.\r\nTake care!\x05";
const char str_083F1C94[] = "This room has lots of the \r\nDoctor's books.\x05";
const char str_083F1CC1[] = "I like to come here after \r\nwork to study.\x05";
const char str_083F1CED[] = "I don't understand the books\r\nin that other room.\r\nThey just make me tired!\x05";
const char str_083F1D3A[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083F1D42[] = "!!\r\nThe Clinic is closed today!\x05";
const char str_083F1D63[] = "I usually go visit my \r\ngrandmother on my days off.\r\nIf you want, come visit us.\x05";
const char str_083F1DB5[] = "Good morning,\r\n";
const char str_083F1DC9[] = "You're up and about \r\nquite early! I'm always so \r\nsleepy in the mornings...\x05";
const char str_083F1E17[] = "Good evening, ";
const char str_083F1E26[] = "!.\r\nI was so glad to see my \r\ngrandmother and Stu today!\x05";
const char str_083F1E60[] = "Tomorrow's another\r\nbusy day at the Clinic!\x05";
const char str_083F1E8D[] = "Good evening, ";
const char str_083F1E9C[] = "!.\r\nWork hard today?\x05";
const char str_083F1EB2[] = "Isn't this a strange hour\r\nto be about?\x05";
const char str_083F1EDB[] = "The Doctor insists I relax\r\nat home on my days off.\x05";
const char str_083F1F10[] = "The Doctor is probably \r\nat the Library or Church.\r\nHe likes quiet places.\x05";
const char str_083F1F5C[] = "Hello. We're closed on \r\nWednesdays.\x05";
const char str_083F1F82[] = "You know, we rarely meet\r\noutside the Clinic...\x05";
const char str_083F1FB3[] = "Do me a favor and talk to my\r\ngrandmother, OK? She gets \r\nso lonely by herself.\x05";
const char str_083F2004[] = "Today I'm shopping.\r\nI'm also here to pay the \r\nDoctor's bill. \x05";
const char str_083F2045[] = "Sasha is so kind.\r\nShe always visits my \r\ngrandmother on her \x05\r\ndays off.\x05";
const char str_083F2090[] = "RIFFN";
const char str_083F2098[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083F2A33[] = " JUMP";
const char str_083F341C[] = "STR ";
const char str_083F349C[] = "You're not from around\r\nhere, are you? \x05";
const char str_083F34C5[] = "My name? It's Stu.\r\nHey, you have cows on\r\nyour farm, right? \x05";
const char str_083F3504[] = "Can I come pet one?\x05";
const char str_083F3519[] = "Well, I really wanted \r\nMechabot Ultror, but \r\nthanks anyway!\x05";
const char str_083F3558[] = "Just remember next\r\nyear, OK?\x05";
const char str_083F3577[] = "Wow!\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_083F3586[] = "Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083F358F[] = "I think maybe I'll\r\ngive this to Grandma...!\x05";
const char str_083F35BD[] = "Can't you give this\r\nto somebody else?\x05";
const char str_083F35E5[] = "Gee, thanks!\x05";
const char str_083F35F3[] = "Gosh! You mean this\r\nis really for me?\x05";
const char str_083F361B[] = "Thanks! When I get older,\r\nI'll give it to a girl \r\nI like. \x05";
const char str_083F3659[] = "Thanks, but I won't\r\nuse it, so I'll give it\r\nto my sister Elli.\x05";
const char str_083F36B6[] = "Wow...It's pretty!\r\nWe had something like it\r\nin our house...\x05";
const char str_083F36F5[] = "Elli said it was mom's.\x05";
const char str_083F370E[] = "Hi there!\x05";
const char str_083F3719[] = "You look like you're \r\nas bored as me!\x05";
const char str_083F3741[] = "Hey...\x05";
const char str_083F3749[] = "Have you ever ridden a cow?\r\nI want to do Rodeo. \x05";
const char str_083F377C[] = "...You don";
const char str_083F3787[] = "ft know Rodeo? \r\nMilk Cows are different from\r\nRodeo Cows, I heard...\x05";
const char str_083F37CE[] = "Won't you play with me?\x05";
const char str_083F37E7[] = "Elli's always at work, \r\nand Grandma can't walk \r\ngood, so I don't have \x05\r\nanyone to play with!\x05";
const char str_083F3848[] = "Tomorrow is Church day!\x05";
const char str_083F3861[] = "Do you go, too? Ever \r\nbeen to confessional?\x05";
const char str_083F388F[] = "Carter says that we can be\r\nforgiven for everything if\r\nwe truly feel sorry.\x05";
const char str_083F38DD[] = "I do sorta feel bad about \r\nputting bugs in Elli's bed.\x05";
const char str_083F3916[] = "I'm so bored...!\r\nI wonder if May's at home?\x05";
const char str_083F3944[] = "I wish there was someone who\r\nwould take me to the Church\r\nwhen it was raining...\x05";
const char str_083F3997[] = "Maybe Carter would come...\x05";
const char str_083F39B3[] = "Today isn't a Church day.\x05";
const char str_083F39CE[] = "My sis Elli is free on \r\nWednesdays, and on Mondays\r\nMay goes out with her\x05\r\ngrandfather.\x05";
const char str_083F3A29[] = "I don't like playing mommy\r\nall day, you know!\x05";
const char str_083F3A59[] = "Hi!\x05";
const char str_083F3A5E[] = "It's my bed time...\x05";
const char str_083F3A73[] = "If I stay up longer, the \r\nmonsters will come get me!\x05";
const char str_083F3AAA[] = "Hello!\x05";
const char str_083F3AB2[] = "Carter makes really good \r\nfood, you know.\x05";
const char str_083F3AE0[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083F3AE8[] = "SCR CODEl";
const char str_083F4B60[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083F5554[] = "STR \x04\r";
const char str_083F5608[] = "Hmm? Who are you?\r\nOh, you're the new lad at\r\nthe farm, are you?\x05";
const char str_083F564A[] = "My name's Duke. Pleased to\r\nmake your acquaintance.\x05";
const char str_083F567F[] = "A birthday present?\r\nFor me?\x05";
const char str_083F569D[] = "Are you aiming to be \r\npopular around here?\x05";
const char str_083F56CA[] = "Thanks! I love being able \r\nto eat good food \r\non the job!\x05";
const char str_083F5706[] = "Thanks a lot! \r\nI think I'll hide this from\r\nManna and eat it myself!\x05";
const char str_083F574D[] = "Thanks a lot!\r\nI'll remember this.\x05";
const char str_083F5771[] = "Hmm? What's this?\r\nIs it good?\x05";
const char str_083F5791[] = "What's this?!\r\nAre you trying to \r\npick a fight with me?\x05";
const char str_083F57CB[] = "Now this is cute!\x05";
const char str_083F57DE[] = "These guys make life\r\ndifficult for me \r\nall the time!\x05";
const char str_083F5816[] = "Are you really giving \r\nthis to me? But it's \r\nso nice!...\x05";
const char str_083F5852[] = "Maybe I'll send it to Aja?\r\nOr should I give it to \r\nManna?\x05";
const char str_083F588F[] = "Are you really giving\r\nthis to me? \r\nIt's kind of strange...\x05";
const char str_083F58CD[] = "Maybe I'll send it to\r\nAja. I doubt Manna would\r\nlike it!\x05";
const char str_083F5908[] = "Perfume?! What would \r\na man need with Perfume?\x05";
const char str_083F5939[] = "What?! You say you're \r\ngiving it to me?!...\x05";
const char str_083F5967[] = "Heh heh...Good luck!\x05";
const char str_083F597D[] = "Howdy, ";
const char str_083F5985[] = "!. \r\nIf you want to buy wine,\r\ngo to the house.\x05";
const char str_083F59B6[] = "Want to do me a favor and\r\ngo talk to Manna? I'd sure\r\nappreciate it!\x05";
const char str_083F59FD[] = "I don't go to the Bar to\r\ndrink my wine, you see, \r\nbut to talk to the guys.\x05";
const char str_083F5A4B[] = "That Cliff at the Inn...\r\nHe doesn't drink much, but\r\nhe sure does know a lot\x05\r\nabout wine!\x05";
const char str_083F5AA8[] = "It's always nice for the\r\nwhole family to go out \r\ntogether on our day off!\x05";
const char str_083F5AF5[] = "How are you doing\r\nat the farm, ";
const char str_083F5B1A[] = "On days like this I want to\r\nhave a glass of wine \r\nin the afternoon.\x05";
const char str_083F5B61[] = "Too bad the bar only \r\nserves at night!\x05";
const char str_083F5B8A[] = "How's it going, \r\n";
const char str_083F5B9D[] = "!? I haven't \r\nhad any drinks today!\x05";
const char str_083F5BC3[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F5BCD[] = "What are you doing here \r\nat this hour? I only sell\r\nwine during the day.\x05";
const char str_083F5C18[] = "Only Manna and I live\r\nhere alone, so we love\r\nit when guests come!\x05";
const char str_083F5C5D[] = "If you want to buy some \r\nwine, talk to Manna. \r\nShe's in charge. \x05";
const char str_083F5CA1[] = "Manna likes to talk, so\r\nbuying wine from her can \r\ntake a long time. \x05";
const char str_083F5CE9[] = "She's lonely, though, so\r\nforgive her. \x05";
const char str_083F5D12[] = "Are you enjoying your\r\nwork? Have a glass of wine\r\nand enjoy yourself!\x05";
const char str_083F5D5A[] = "You know what they say:\r\nA glass of wine a day \r\nkeeps the doctor away!\x05";
const char str_083F5DA3[] = "Today we're all going\r\nto eat out! We used to eat \r\nout all the time before\x05\r\nAja left...\x05";
const char str_083F5DFE[] = "Today I'm going to Church \r\nwith Cliff.  \x05";
const char str_083F5E29[] = "I've never been before, but\r\nsometimes it's nice to sit\r\nin a quiet place, ya know?\x05";
const char str_083F5E7E[] = "Did you come to eat, too,\r\n";
const char str_083F5E9E[] = "Sometimes I just don't\r\nunderstand Manna!\x05";
const char str_083F5EC9[] = "She'd rather gossip with \r\nthe neighbors than make\r\nus supper!\x05";
const char str_083F5F09[] = "You look like you're \r\nworking pretty hard.\r\nCliff puts in a lot of\x05\r\nhours, too.\x05";
const char str_083F5F5C[] = "Doug always says that \r\nCliff is a real good guy.\x05";
const char str_083F5F8F[] = "He doesn't look like it, \r\nbut he's one cool customer!\x05";
const char str_083F5FC7[] = "Hey there, ";
const char str_083F5FD3[] = "!!\r\nDone with work?\x05";
const char str_083F5FE8[] = "I work hard each and every \r\nday, you know! \x05";
const char str_083F6016[] = "A man can't be blamed for \r\ndrinking a little bit...!\x05";
const char str_083F604D[] = "My job is a lot easier, \r\nnow that Cliff is helping.\x05";
const char str_083F6083[] = "Thanks a lot, ";
const char str_083F6096[] = "Cliff is grateful to you, \r\ntoo. If he didn't have this\r\njob, he'd have to \x05\r\nleave town!\x05";
const char str_083F60F1[] = "What are you doing here\r\nin the cellar?\x05";
const char str_083F611A[] = "If you want to buy wine, \r\nbuy it at the house. \x05";
const char str_083F614C[] = "The cellar is pleasant, \r\nisn't it? Do you hear that?\r\nThe sound of wine aging?\x05";
const char str_083F619D[] = "Wine is alive too, you see.\x05";
const char str_083F61BA[] = "You know, ";
const char str_083F61C5[] = "!,\r\nI think both you and Carter\r\nare real good guys!\x05";
const char str_083F61FB[] = "Cliff has changed a lot\r\naround here, including me.\x05";
const char str_083F6230[] = "I used to just sit around\r\nbored on Saturdays!\x05";
const char str_083F6260[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083F6268[] = "SCR CODE`";
const char str_083F73D4[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083F7DD8[] = "STR -#";
const char str_083F7EC8[] = "Oh, you're a new face around\r\nhere, aren't you? Oh, are you\r\n";
const char str_083F7F06[] = "!? Thomas mentioned\r\nyou, come to think of it.\r\nOh, sorry! My name is Manna.\r\nMy husband Duke and I run\r\nthe Aja Winery. Nice to\r\nmeet you. There's not much\r\naround here, but at least\r\nthe people are nice! Just\r\nlet me know if you need \r\nanything, OK? I hope I \r\nhaven't talked your ear off!\x05";
const char str_083F802B[] = "This is for me?\r\nThank you so much!\r\nYou really are a great\r\nguy, you know that? \r\nMy husband could take \r\na lesson or two... \r\n";
const char str_083F80AC[] = "That Duke! He's totally \r\nforgotten it's my birthday,\r\nso he's off drinking with \r\nhis buddies again! \x05";
const char str_083F8115[] = "He won't remember \r\nuntil tomorrow! \r\n";
const char str_083F813C[] = "Then he'll run to the \r\nSupermarket, and, \r\neven if it's Tuesday\r\nand they're closed \x05";
const char str_083F8194[] = "...he'll yell at Jeff to \r\nsell him a present! \x05";
const char str_083F81D1[] = "Then he'll give it to \r\nme as though nothing at \r\nall had happened! \x05";
const char str_083F8217[] = "Know what I'll do then? \r\nI'll go exchange it for \r\nsomething I really want. \x05";
const char str_083F8266[] = "Duke won't notice because \r\nhe won't know what's \r\ninside it anyway!... \x05";
const char str_083F82B0[] = "Anyway, thanks very much! \r\ndo you always give presents\r\nto the townspeople like\r\nif you're going to give them\r\nto some, you have to give \r\nto everybody, now! \r\nNot just the pretty girls,\r\nyou hear?! Ha ha... \r\nAnyway, thanks again! \x05";
const char str_083F839B[] = "Thanks! You're an \r\nuncommonly nice boy! \r\nWhat a refreshing thing \r\nafter putting up with \r\nsomeone like Duke \r\nfor so long...! \x05";
const char str_083F841E[] = "Thanks. \r\nOh yes, are you giving \r\npeople what they like? \r\nDifferent people like \r\ndifferent things,\r\nso be sure to watch \r\ntheir reactions. \r\nThey won't necessarily tell \r\nyou right off the bat, but \r\nif you observe them \r\ncarefully, you'll be able to\r\ntell if they're happy or \r\nnot. \x05";
const char str_083F853F[] = "Sorry, but I really \r\ndon't like these! \r\nI'll take it, of course,\r\nsince I know you meant well.\r\nStill, I'd much prefer \r\nsomething I actually \r\nliked...\x05";
const char str_083F85DB[] = "Now what is this!? \r\nI like you, so I'll accept\r\nit, but others might get \r\nmad, you know! \r\nMost of the people in \r\nthis town don't have very\r\ngood senses of humor, \r\nso be more careful! \r\n";
const char str_083F869A[] = "You're not only nice, \r\nbut pure as well. \r\nStu is the same way. \r\nSometimes he shows me \r\nicky things on purpose, \r\nthough. He's still young, \r\nthough, so I let him \r\nget away with it! \x05";
const char str_083F8756[] = "Achh! \r\nDid you know I can't \r\nstand these!? \r\nI'll forgive you if \r\nyou didn't know. \x05";
const char str_083F87AE[] = "Really? This is for me?\r\nI can really take it?!\r\nHow much did you have to\r\npay Saibara to make this?\r\n";
const char str_083F8815[] = "I didn't know Saibara also\r\nmade things like this!\x05";
const char str_083F8849[] = "Did you have to bring him\r\nthe stone yourself?\r\n";
const char str_083F887A[] = "He demands lots of money \r\nfor his work doesn't he?\r\nIt's because he's such a \r\nproud man! Gray keeps \r\nrebelling against him, but\r\nfor some reason he never\r\nleaves...\x05";
const char str_083F8923[] = "It doesn't matter now,\r\nthough, because he has a \r\ngrandson!\x05";
const char str_083F8962[] = "Now isn't that nice!\r\nWhat? You mean it's for me?\r\nI'm so glad! Thank you \r\nvery much!\x05";
const char str_083F89BA[] = "Now isn't that nice!\r\nIt smells lovely. I bet \r\nyou're popular with \r\nthe girls!\x05";
const char str_083F8A0C[] = "Do you cook? \r\nI'll tell you a great \r\nrecipe for Boiled Spinach?\r\nDon't forget, now.\r\nAll you have to do is boil\r\nSpinach in a Pot and then\r\nput some Soy sauce on top.\r\nIt's that simple!\r\nAre you sure you don't need\r\nto write it down? Well, \r\nif you say so!\x05";
const char str_083F8B10[] = "That's not for me, is it?\r\nWell, that's a relief!\r\nWell, will you tell me who\r\nthe lucky girl is?\r\nOr, are you too nervous to\r\nlet me know? Hee-hee...\x05";
const char str_083F8BA8[] = "Listen to this, ";
const char str_083F8BB9[] = "!.\r\nThese days my daughter\r\nwrites letters to me on her\r\nown once a week! \x05";
const char str_083F8C05[] = "She never used to write at\r\nall, but Sasha convinced \r\nher. Thank goodness for \r\nfriends, is what I say!\x05";
const char str_083F8C6F[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F8C74[] = "!,\r\nhow are you dong?\r\nHow are you enjoying the\r\nfarming life?\r\nSorry, I can't talk right\r\nnow. I'm on my way to \r\nRose Square!\x05";
const char str_083F8CF5[] = "Recently I've stopped \r\nchatting with the other\r\nwomen at Rose Square. \r\nIt's so much more fun \r\ntalking with Duke and \r\nCliff at the Bar!\x05";
const char str_083F8D81[] = "Ahh...I hope it clears up\r\nlater on! Whenever I want \r\nto go somewhere it rains!\r\nI get so tired of talking \r\nonly to my family...\r\nThey never listen to me \r\nanyway!\x05";
const char str_083F8E28[] = "Cliff likes hearing Carter\r\nspeak over at the Church.\r\nWhat he says never makes \r\nmuch sense to me, though!.\x05";
const char str_083F8E96[] = "Right now I'm going \r\nover to Anna's. Sasha is \r\nsick of me, and Lillia is \r\nin a permanent bad mood.\r\nAnna really is a saint!\x05";
const char str_083F8F16[] = "Can you believe the time?!\r\nThe day seems to go \r\nso fast! I can't waste any\r\nmore time talking to Duke!\x05";
const char str_083F8F80[] = "You're up early,\r\n";
const char str_083F8F93[] = "!. I guess you\r\ncan't sleep in if you run\r\na farm by yourself!\r\nWhat? You say you sometimes\r\ndo?! Well, I say once in a \r\nwhile you deserve a break!\r\nDon't be too hard on\r\nyourself - that's what \r\nI always say!\x05";
const char str_083F9067[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F906C[] = "!.\r\nAre you still here?\r\nYou work too hard, just \r\nlike Elli, Ellen's \r\ngranddaughter. \r\nShe not only works for the\r\nDoctor, but she also tries\r\nto help raise Stu! What a \r\npoor girl!...\r\nStu is lonely a lot, too.\r\nPoor kid!...Don't you\r\nthink so, ";
const char str_083F9169[] = "I know I haven't talked to \r\nyou very much, but my \r\ndaughter went to live in\r\nanother town.\r\nAnd...my husband Duke \r\nspends every night drinking\r\nat the Bar! How did things\r\nget this way...?\x05";
const char str_083F922A[] = "I get so lonely, I end up\r\ntalking to lots of people,\r\nbut in the end it just \r\nmakes me miss my daughter\r\neven more!...\r\nYou came to this town by\r\nyourself, didn't you? \r\nHow brave!\x05";
const char str_083F92E2[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F92E7[] = "!!\r\nHave you talked to Kai\r\nmuch? He first came to town\r\nwhen he was a teenager.\r\nHe asked Gotz - he's the \r\nwoodcutter who lives in the\r\nmountains - to build him a \r\ncottage on Mineral Beach.\x05";
const char str_083F93A9[] = "Then, Kai painted his \r\nnew house all white! What a\r\nstrange thing to do!\r\nCarter was a big topic of \r\nconversation when he first \r\ncame to town, too, but \r\nKai seems to annoy all the \r\nother men.\r\nIf I said I liked Kai, my \r\nDuke would blow his top!\r\nMen are so silly when they\r\nget too prideful!\x05";
const char str_083F94D4[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_083F94D9[] = "!.\r\nHow is life on the farm?\r\nSpeaking of farms, the\r\ngirl of Yodel Farm left \r\nthis town at the same time\r\nas my own daughter. \r\nBarley is already so old, \r\nand he";
const char str_083F957E[] = "fs all alone!\r\nI feel so bad for him";
const char str_083F95A3[] = "c\r\nAnd, when she finally did \r\ncome back, after 10 years, \r\nJoanna brought back a \r\nlittle girl with her!\r\nBarley must";
const char str_083F961A[] = "fve been so\r\nshocked! Then, to top it \r\noff, Joanna left her little\r\ngirl, May, and took off \r\nagain! I feel so sorry for\r\nthe poor little girl";
const char str_083F96AE[] = "Barley";
const char str_083F96B5[] = "fs daughter Joanna\r\nwon";
const char str_083F96CD[] = "ft return even now.\r\nBarley says that he \r\nwouldn";
const char str_083F96FF[] = "ft give May up to\r\nJoanna even if she cam back\r\nand tried to take her away.\r\nIt";
const char str_083F974F[] = "fs none of my business, \r\nof course, but can you \r\nimagine what that would do\r\nto poor May!?";
const char str_083F97AF[] = "Hi there, ";
const char str_083F97BA[] = "!.\r\nHow is the farm going?\r\n";
const char str_083F97DB[] = "fve never heard of \r\nRod, have you? \r\nHe";
const char str_083F9804[] = "fs Lillian";
const char str_083F980F[] = "fs husband, \r\nand the one who brought the\r\nshipper Zack to this town.\r\nWhen Rod met Zack on his \r\ntravels, and heard that he\r\nhad no family or job, he\r\nimmediately brought him\r\nback to his own house. \r\nThings sure move a lot\r\nmore smoothly around here\r\nwith Zack on the job,\r\nthat";
const char str_083F9928[] = "fs for sure!\x05";
const char str_083F9936[] = "Know what, though?\r\nZack fell in love with \r\nLillia! She";
const char str_083F996F[] = "fs the wife of \r\nsomeone who saved him, so\r\nhe can";
const char str_083F99A2[] = "ft act on it, but he\r\ncan";
const char str_083F99BC[] = "ft forget his love,\r\neither! Oh, the humanity!\r\nLillian isn";
const char str_083F99F8[] = "ft the kind of \r\nperson who would ever \r\nnotice it, and of course I\r\nwould never tell her.\r\n\"Don";
const char str_083F9A59[] = "ft trouble trouble\",\r\nis what I always say!\x05";
const char str_083F9A86[] = "And how are you doing\r\ntoday, ";
const char str_083F9AA5[] = "!?\r\nI just got done talking \r\nwith Anna. She used to live\r\nnear where my daughter\r\nlives now. I wonder what\r\nkind of life she lives";
const char str_083F9B2C[] = "Anna is great at making\r\ntreats, so I always enjoy \r\nher visits on Saturdays.\x05";
const char str_083F9B7B[] = "Listen to this!\r\nIt";
const char str_083F9B8F[] = "fs something I just \r\noverheard!";
const char str_083F9BB4[] = "cthen she";
const char str_083F9BC2[] = "cthen he";
const char str_083F9BCB[] = "c\r\nCan you believe he \r\nsaid that!?\x05";
const char str_083F9C00[] = "I completely agree!";
const char str_083F9C17[] = "No, no";
const char str_083F9C1E[] = "cI think you \r\ngot the story wrong!\r\nI heard";
const char str_083F9C4E[] = "Why do you think she";
const char str_083F9C66[] = "Yes! That fits in \r\nwith what I heard from";
const char str_083F9C94[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083F9C9C[] = "!.\r\nHeard any juicy gossip \r\nlately?\x05";
const char str_083F9CC2[] = "Can you believe it!\r\nDuke ran up another tab at\r\nthe Supermarket!\r\n5000G! I";
const char str_083F9D0E[] = "fm so embarrassed!\r\nHe didn";
const char str_083F9D2A[] = "ft even tell me!\x05";
const char str_083F9D3C[] = "Jeff shouldn";
const char str_083F9D49[] = "ft even let\r\nDuke buy things on credit\r\nany more! After all, it";
const char str_083F9D89[] = "fs\r\nme who has to pay for it \r\nall! Doug also tells me \r\nthat Duke calls Aja from\r\nthe Inn nearly everyday!\r\nJust imagine the phone\r\nbill! What";
const char str_083F9E19[] = "fs a wife to do?!\x05";
const char str_083F9E2C[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083F9E34[] = "!.\r\nEver since Cliff started \r\ncoming, we all eat \r\nat the Inn on Saturdays\r\nbefore going to Church.\r\nIt";
const char str_083F9E9D[] = "fs almost like a real\r\nfamily!\x05";
const char str_083F9EBD[] = "Cliff is a good influence\r\non Duke, too. \r\nToday he was almost as \r\nhappy as when Aja was with\r\nus! Cliff is such a nice\r\nboy, and he and Duke get\r\nalong so well!\x05";
const char str_083F9F61[] = "Cliff is such a good boy,\r\ntoo. He";
const char str_083F9F84[] = "fs so quiet and \r\nrespectful. \r\nHe";
const char str_083F9FA7[] = "fs been going to Church\r\na lot, and Carter tells us \r\nwhat a tough life he";
const char str_083F9FF2[] = "fs had.\r\nI like being almost like a \r\nmother to the boy";
const char str_083FA02A[] = "c\r\nIf he wants to, he can even\r\ntake over the winery from\r\nus when we retire";
const char str_083FA077[] = "c\r\nDuke doesn";
const char str_083FA085[] = "ft want to feel\r\nlike he";
const char str_083FA09E[] = "fs giving up on Aja,\r\nbut he has to look to the\r\nfuture too, you know?\x05";
const char str_083FA0E6[] = "You have to be \r\nquiet at the Church!\x05";
const char str_083FA110[] = "RIFF";
const char str_083FA118[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083FA8C0[] = "JUMP";
const char str_083FB2B0[] = "STR ";
const char str_083FB314[] = "It's my birthday. \x05";
const char str_083FB328[] = "This is very valuable!\r\nI will treasure it always. \x05";
const char str_083FB35D[] = "This is for me?\r\nThis is very valuable?\r\nI will treasure it always.\x05";
const char str_083FB3A2[] = "Thank you very much. \x05";
const char str_083FB3B9[] = "I've never really liked \r\nthese...But I guess I'll\r\ndo something with it...\x05";
const char str_083FB406[] = "What is this!?\r\nIt has no value whatsoever!\x05";
const char str_083FB433[] = "It's so cute...\r\nWhat should I name it...?\x05";
const char str_083FB48B[] = "Ohh...This is very nice!\x05";
const char str_083FB4A5[] = "You mean it's a present\r\nfor me?! Thanks!\x05";
const char str_083FB4D0[] = "Hmm...\r\nLooks very valuable. Sure \r\nyou want to give it away?\x05";
const char str_083FB50F[] = "This perfume is top class.\x05";
const char str_083FB52B[] = "You mean it's a gift?\r\nHow generous of you!\x05";
const char str_083FB558[] = "What a nice feather. \r\nI bet I could sell it for \r\nlots...\x05";
const char str_083FB594[] = "You mean it's for \r\nproposing? Sorry...\x05";
const char str_083FB5BD[] = "Have you heard of the farm\x05";
const char str_083FB5DA[] = "+ over at\r\nForget-me-not Valley?\x05";
const char str_083FB5FC[] = "I hear they're making a \r\nhuge profit! I wonder if \r\nthey're doing something \x05\r\nillegal...\x05";
const char str_083FB658[] = "I hope to make it over to\r\nForget-me-not Valley soon.\x05";
const char str_083FB68F[] = "Forget-me-not Valley seems \r\nlike it's full of \r\nopportunity.\r\nI'll be going there soon.\x05";
const char str_083FB6E9[] = "I think I'll be going to \r\nForget-me-not Valley again.\x05";
const char str_083FB721[] = "What's wrong?\x05";
const char str_083FB730[] = "I've got the best selection\r\nof rare goods!\x05";
const char str_083FB75D[] = "I've collected rare items\r\nfrom all over the world. \x05";
const char str_083FB793[] = "I can't help but want to \r\ncollect rare items! Do you \r\nthink that's a \r\ncharacter fault?\x05";
const char str_083FB7EE[] = "Of all my travels, \r\nForget-me-not Valley may be\r\nmy favorite place. \x05";
const char str_083FB835[] = "It's so peaceful there...\x05";
const char str_083FB850[] = "You should see what \r\nForget-me-not Valley is like\r\nwith your own eyes!\x05";
const char str_083FB899[] = "I bet you'd like it.\x05";
const char str_083FB8B0[] = "RIFF=";
const char str_083FB8B8[] = "SCR CODE4\t";
const char str_083FC1F7[] = " JUMP";
const char str_083FCBF4[] = "STR ";
const char str_083FCC78[] = "Hello, there! You must be \r\n";
const char str_083FCC99[] = "My name's Harris, and I'm\r\nthe constable of this town.\x05";
const char str_083FCCD1[] = "It's very safe and peaceful\r\nhere, so you've nothing to\r\nworry about!\x05";
const char str_083FCD18[] = "Thank you so much!\x05";
const char str_083FCD2C[] = "It is an honor to receive\r\nbirthday presents from the\r\npeople I protect.\x05";
const char str_083FCD76[] = "Thank you. You are \r\nreally too kind!\x05";
const char str_083FCD9D[] = "Thank you \r\nfor your kindness!\x05";
const char str_083FCDBD[] = "Thank you very much.\x05";
const char str_083FCDD3[] = "Umm...Thank you..I guess...\x05";
const char str_083FCDF0[] = "And you looked like such a\r\nrespectable citizen!\x05";
const char str_083FCE22[] = "I love cute things...\r\nWhat should I name him?\x05";
const char str_083FCE52[] = "Sorry...Even I am scared\r\nof that!...\x05";
const char str_083FCE79[] = "Wow, that's very nice!\r\nWhat? You mean it's a gift\r\nfor me?!\x05";
const char str_083FCEB7[] = "You're not trying to bribe\r\nme, are you?\x05";
const char str_083FCEE1[] = "Thank you so much!\r\nWhat an unexpected treat!\x05";
const char str_083FCF10[] = "Kai and all the other young\r\nfolks are so adventurous.\x05";
const char str_083FCF48[] = "It makes me think about\r\nAja...\x05";
const char str_083FCF69[] = "I bet you're like I am: \r\ntoo busy to spend lots of \r\ntime cooking. Well, here's \x05\r\na really convenient recipe \r\nfor Fried Rice. \x05";
const char str_083FCFEC[] = "First, put some oil in a \r\nFrying Pan, then add \r\nEgg and Rice Ball. \x05";
const char str_083FD033[] = "You can add other \r\ningredients to taste, but \r\nbe sure to dice them with\r\nyour Knife first. \x05";
const char str_083FD092[] = "Seasoning with Sugar, Salt,\r\nand Soy Sauce makes it\r\ntaste even better!\x05";
const char str_083FD0DB[] = "Are you going to get \x05";
const char str_083FD0F2[] = "married? I want to get \r\nmarried soon, too...\x05";
const char str_083FD121[] = "I'm almost done for the day!\r\nThere's nothing better than\r\nan uneventful day \x05\r\non the beat!\x05";
const char str_083FD17F[] = "You get home now, too, \r\n";
const char str_083FD199[] = "!. Wild dogs \r\ncome out at night. \x05";
const char str_083FD1BD[] = "It's raining today, but I \r\ndon't change my patrol \r\nfor the weather!\x05";
const char str_083FD204[] = "I hope you're not going \r\nmountain climbing on a day \r\nlike today! It's dangerous!\x05";
const char str_083FD258[] = "Has anything been troubling\r\nyou, ";
const char str_083FD27F[] = "This is such a \r\npeaceful town...\x05";
const char str_083FD2A2[] = "Is there any trouble?!\x05";
const char str_083FD2BA[] = "No, I guess not...Not in a \r\ntown like this!...\x05";
const char str_083FD2EB[] = "Another tough day \r\non the beat!\x05";
const char str_083FD30D[] = "Good morning!\r\nAnother day to protect \r\nMineral Town!\x05";
const char str_083FD344[] = "It makes me so happy to\r\nsee the townspeople at \r\npeace...I love my job!\x05";
const char str_083FD38E[] = "Are you taking the day off, \r\ntoo, ";
const char str_083FD3B6[] = "Everybody needs a break\r\nnow and then!\x05";
const char str_083FD3DE[] = "It's OK. Everybody knows I'm\r\nhere around this time. \x05";
const char str_083FD415[] = "I rest at Gotz's house\r\nwhen I'm on patrol. \x05";
const char str_083FD443[] = "And, on Saturdays, \r\nGotz comes to my house.\x05";
const char str_083FD471[] = "Is there trouble anywhere!?\r\nHa! Of course there isn't!\x05";
const char str_083FD4AA[] = "You'd better get home now,ret>";
const char str_083FD4C9[] = "!. Wild dogs \r\ncome out at night. \x05";
const char str_083FD4F0[] = "RIFF\r1";
const char str_083FD4F8[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_083FE394[] = "JUMP\x04\n";
const char str_083FEDA0[] = "STR U";
const char str_083FEEA8[] = "Are you ";
const char str_083FEEB5[] = "Yes, I've heard about you.\r\nFrom Thomas, of course. \r\nI'm Carter. I'm delighted \x05\r\nto finally meet you.\x05";
const char str_083FEF1E[] = "This is for me?\r\nHow embarrassing!...\r\nMay the Harvest Goddess \r\nbless you.\x05";
const char str_083FEF6B[] = "Thank you so much. \x05";
const char str_083FEF80[] = "I get no salary, so things \r\nlike this are appreciated.\x05";
const char str_083FEFB9[] = "Thank you. I'm \r\nin your debt. \x05";
const char str_083FEFDA[] = "May the Harvest Goddess \r\nbless you.\x05";
const char str_083FF000[] = "Umm...Thanks...\x05";
const char str_083FF011[] = "I'm not sure why you have\r\nchosen this as a present...\x05";
const char str_083FF049[] = "I will ask the Harvest \r\nGoddess for guidance.\x05";
const char str_083FF079[] = "It's so very cute!...\x05";
const char str_083FF090[] = "I really...hate...those....\x05";
const char str_083FF0AD[] = "I know they are creatures\r\nof the Harvest Goddess, \r\nbut I can't help it...\x05";
const char str_083FF0FA[] = "Thank you so much.\x05";
const char str_083FF10E[] = "Is it really OK to receive\r\nsuch a rare gift...?\x05";
const char str_083FF140[] = "Thank you very much.\x05";
const char str_083FF156[] = "I'm not sure what to do\r\nwith it, but I'll ponder \r\nthe matter with care...\x05";
const char str_083FF1A3[] = "I thought something smelled\r\nlovely! Perfume, is it? \r\nThanks so much!\x05";
const char str_083FF1EB[] = "Let me tell you the recipe of\r\nsomething I often make \r\nfor the kids. \x05";
const char str_083FF233[] = "It's easy, so you should\r\nbe able to remember it.\x05";
const char str_083FF266[] = "All you need to do is put \r\nStrawberries and Milk in \r\na Mixer! It's delicious!\x05";
const char str_083FF2B7[] = "Sometimes I also put in\r\nHoney, Sugar, and Salt. \x05";
const char str_083FF2EA[] = "I am glad for you.\x05";
const char str_083FF2FE[] = "I will pray for it to\r\ngo well.\x05";
const char str_083FF31F[] = "I happened to hear that the\r\ncouple who run \r\n";
const char str_083FF34E[] = "+ get along\r\nfamously. \x05";
const char str_083FF367[] = "At least, that's the rumor.\x05";
const char str_083FF384[] = "Ein Teilzeitjob auf dem\r\nWeingut h[o]rt sich nach\r\neiner Menge Spa[b] an.\x05";
const char str_083FF3CF[] = "Von Job erz[a]hlen.";
const char str_083FF3E3[] = "Nicht erz[a]hlen.";
const char str_083FF3F5[] = "I think Cliff needs that job\r\nmore than I do. \x05";
const char str_083FF425[] = "Why don't you tell him?\x05";
const char str_083FF43E[] = "This is indeed a Church, and\r\nI am its priest, but my \r\nfaith has changed greatly.\x05";
const char str_083FF492[] = "Now I no longer refuse those\r\nwhose greatest desire is\r\nto seek compassion.\x05";
const char str_083FF4DF[] = "If you want, come to \r\nconfessional to see. \x05";
const char str_083FF50D[] = "Do you think that the body \r\nis trapped forever in the \r\ngrave?\x05";
const char str_083FF54E[] = "No! We live on in memory,\r\nwhich is the heart of joy.\x05";
const char str_083FF585[] = "In the forest behind the \r\nChurch live the Harvest \r\nSprites.\x05";
const char str_083FF5C4[] = "If you make friends with\r\nthem, they will aid you. \x05";
const char str_083FF5F9[] = "Hello, ";
const char str_083FF606[] = "We have been blessed with a\r\nbeautiful day indeed. \x05";
const char str_083FF63B[] = "Watching May and Stu, it's \r\nobvious to me how the \r\npeople of this town have \x05\r\nturned out so well!\x05";
const char str_083FF6A1[] = "We seem to have run into a \r\nbit of foul weather, no?\x05";
const char str_083FF6D8[] = "Seems like most people, \r\nespecially the children, \r\nare staying home. \x05";
const char str_083FF721[] = "You get home, too, \r\nbefore you catch a cold!\x05";
const char str_083FF750[] = "Ah, great timing.\r\nWant to hear my sermon?\r\nIt can get long.\x05";
const char str_083FF78E[] = "Listen.";
const char str_083FF796[] = "Don't listen.";
const char str_083FF7A4[] = "In that case...\x05";
const char str_083FF7B6[] = "This is the story of a \r\nperfectly normal family.\x05";
const char str_083FF7E9[] = "The mother, father and their\r\nyoung son lived together \r\nhappily. However, one day \r\nthe mother took ill and \r\ndied suddenly. \x05";
const char str_083FF869[] = "The son looked at the dead\r\nbody of his mother, and,\r\nbeing too young to truly\r\nunderstand, asked his \r\nfather what happened.\x05";
const char str_083FF8E8[] = "The father knew not what to\r\nsay, but told his son that\r\nshe slept very deeply. \x05";
const char str_083FF93A[] = "The son asked his father to\r\nuse his allowance to buy a\r\nlarge alarm clock to wake \r\nher up...\x05";
const char str_083FF99B[] = "What do you think this\r\nstory tells us?\x05";
const char str_083FF9C4[] = "Perhaps the father learned\r\nthat avoiding the word \r\n'death' with his son failed\x05\r\nto solve his problem.\x05";
const char str_083FFA2F[] = "Now let me see...\x05";
const char str_083FFA42[] = "Now let me see....\x05";
const char str_083FFA56[] = "Once, there was a beautiful\r\ngirl. She had lips as red \r\nas cherries, and skin as\r\nwhite as snow. \x05";
const char str_083FFABA[] = "The girl's stepmother was a\r\nwitch, who had a mirror \r\nthat would answer any \r\nquestion.\x05";
const char str_083FFB15[] = "One day, the stepmother \r\nasked the mirror who the \r\nmost beautiful person in \r\nthe world was. \r\n\"You, of course\", said the \r\nmirror, without hesitation,\r\nand the witch was happy.\x05";
const char str_083FFBCB[] = "If the mirror had answered\r\nthat the little girl was \r\nthe most beautiful of all,\r\nsurely the witch would have\r\nkilled her out of jealousy.\x05";
const char str_083FFC59[] = "The mirror knew this, \r\nand so spared the girl's \r\nlife with a lie.\x05";
const char str_083FFC9F[] = "Was it immoral of the\r\nmirror to lie in this case?\r\nThink about it carefully.\x05";
const char str_083FFCEE[] = "This is a story of before \r\nI became a priest. \r\nI had no money, and lived \r\nin a tiny apartment. \x05";
const char str_083FFD52[] = "From my window, I could see\r\ninside the next apartment.\x05";
const char str_083FFD8B[] = "There lived a couple there,\r\nand every day the woman \r\nwould go out to work, \r\nleaving the husband behind.\x05";
const char str_083FFDF8[] = "Over time I noticed that the\r\nhusband never moved. \r\nHe sat in the same place \r\nevery day, sometimes \r\ntalking to his wife, or \r\nshaking his head. His body\r\nnever moved, though. \x05";
const char str_083FFEAC[] = "One day, I saw that a fire\r\nhad started in that \r\napartment. I expected the\r\nman to flee, but he still\r\nsat there, unmoving!\x05";
const char str_083FFF2A[] = "In a panic, I rushed over \r\nto the apartment to save\r\nhim. When I opened the\r\ndoor, the place was full \r\nof smoke, but the man gazed\r\nat me with a blank \r\nexpression. \x05";
const char str_083FFFD3[] = "I tried to move him, but\r\nhe was mysteriously heavy!\r\nWhen I looked down at the\r\nfloor, I saw that his arms \r\nand legs were growing out\r\nof the floor!!!\x05";
const char str_0840007D[] = "Sometimes I like to tell \r\nthese stories just to see\r\nif you're paying attention!\x05";
const char str_084000D1[] = "Cliff has left this town, \r\nbut his destiny rests on his\r\nshoulders alone...\x05";
const char str_0840011F[] = "I'm sure part of the reason \r\nhe left was that he didn't\r\nhave enough money.\x05";
const char str_0840016D[] = "I wish I could have helped \r\nhim out more... \x05";
const char str_0840019C[] = "Cliff is doing so much \r\nbetter since getting the\r\njob at the winery.\x05";
const char str_084001E3[] = "It's all thanks to you.\x05";
const char str_084001FC[] = "You were the one who saved\r\nCliff. \x05";
const char str_08400221[] = "Lately, I've been thinking \r\nthat the power of humans to\r\nsave other humans is \r\ntruly immense. \x05";
const char str_08400283[] = "Do you know that Cliff \r\ncomes to the Church nearly\r\nevery day to confess?\x05";
const char str_084002CF[] = "All of our sins are forgiven\r\nas soon as we desire to\r\nconfess for them!\x05";
const char str_08400319[] = "Sometimes I wonder about\r\nJeff.  He doesn't seem to\r\nhandle stress too well...!\x05";
const char str_0840036A[] = "It's silly to build up \r\nstress by spending time with\r\nthose we don't truly like.\x05\r\nThere is no need for it!\x05";
const char str_084003D8[] = "Whenever the weather is bad\r\non Wednesdays, the Doctor\r\nbrings me a bottle of wine\x05\r\nand we talk.\x05";
const char str_0840043B[] = "So...I actually hope it \r\nrains on Wednesdays now!\x05";
const char str_0840046F[] = "We don't talk about \r\nanything in particular, but\r\nI still enjoy it immensely.\x05";
const char str_084004BF[] = "Good evening to you.\x05";
const char str_084004D5[] = "I sleep in the Church\r\nbasement. \x05";
const char str_084004F8[] = "Ha ha. Just kidding.\x05";
const char str_0840050E[] = "Do you want to know why I\r\ndon't preach in town?\x05";
const char str_08400540[] = "The people here live as the \r\nHarvest Goddess wants them \r\ntoo anyway. \x05";
const char str_08400589[] = "There is nothing for me to \r\nteach!\x05";
const char str_084005AE[] = "But, this is where I live, \r\nso now I have to find \r\nanother path to follow. \x05";
const char str_08400600[] = "RIFF";
const char str_08400608[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_084010D3[] = " JUMP";
const char str_08401AB8[] = "STR ";
const char str_08401B50[] = "Hi...\r\nAre you new around here...?\x05";
const char str_08401B74[] = "Really? This is for me?\x05";
const char str_08401B8D[] = "...I've never received a \r\nbirthday present from \r\nanother guy before...\x05";
const char str_08401BD7[] = "Gee...Thanks.\r\nYou're the only guy who's\r\never nice to me, you know.\x05";
const char str_08401C1D[] = "Thank you.\x05";
const char str_08401C29[] = "Thanks!\x05";
const char str_08401C32[] = "...Sorry, but I really hate\r\nthese. Nothing personal.\x05";
const char str_08401C69[] = "You should go throw this\r\naway somewhere!\x05";
const char str_08401C94[] = "You're kinda weird...\x05";
const char str_08401CAB[] = "Ha ha ha...\r\nSuch a joker...!\x05";
const char str_08401CCA[] = "Who do you think you are?!\r\nYou trying to pick a fight?\x05";
const char str_08401D03[] = "Gosh, thanks! Girls\r\nlike this kind of thing.\x05";
const char str_08401D32[] = "And, they like it when \r\nguys give it to them\r\neven more...\x05";
const char str_08401D6F[] = "This is really nice!\r\nI think I'll give it to a\r\ngirl and see what happens.\x05";
const char str_08401DBC[] = "That's a nice one.\r\nYou mean it's for me?\r\nThanks!\x05";
const char str_08401DF0[] = "You want to learn how to\r\nmake popcorn?\x05";
const char str_08401E19[] = "If you want, I'll tell you.\r\nDon't forget, now!\x05";
const char str_08401E4A[] = "All you need is Corn and a \r\nFrying Pan, although it\r\ntastes better with Salt \r\nor Butter on top. \x05";
const char str_08401EAE[] = "So you're going through \r\nwith the big gamble, eh?\r\nGood luck, you'll need it!\x05";
const char str_08401EFE[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_08401F07[] = "How's Popuri doing?\r\nI'll go visit soon. \x05";
const char str_08401F32[] = "Hey, how's it going?\x05";
const char str_08401F48[] = "This Inn is better than any \r\nother Inn I've ever slept\r\nin! The food is great, and \x05\r\nit's real cheap. \x05";
const char str_08401FB2[] = "So, I stay here every year.\x05";
const char str_08401FCF[] = "Popuri's such a sweet \r\ngirl...\x05";
const char str_08401FF0[] = "If only she didn't \r\nhave a brother...!\x05";
const char str_08402019[] = "Popuri's brother is so \r\nannoying!\x05";
const char str_0840203D[] = "All Rick ever does is \r\ncomplain and insult me!\x05";
const char str_0840206E[] = "Hmm...\x05";
const char str_08402076[] = "Someday, I'm gonna give\r\nRick what he deserves!\x05";
const char str_084020A7[] = "It's hard to be so popular\r\nwith the girls, you know?\x05";
const char str_084020DE[] = "She really likes me, too...\r\nWhat should I do?\x05";
const char str_0840210E[] = "I wonder why Popuri gets\r\nso jealous all the time. \x05";
const char str_08402143[] = "Sometimes I think I had it\r\nbetter when we only saw \r\neach other once a year!\x05";
const char str_08402192[] = "I'm staying at the Inn by \r\nmyself, but it's not as \r\neasy as you'd expect. \x05";
const char str_084021E0[] = "Rick comes and gets drunk,\r\nthen causes trouble. \r\nCan you believe it?!\x05";
const char str_08402229[] = "Come on over to my place\r\nsome time. You're welcome\r\nthere, you know.\x05";
const char str_08402270[] = "It seems like time passes \r\nmore slowly here than where\r\nI live!\x05";
const char str_084022B2[] = "Sorry, but I'm resting\r\nnow. Come back later, OK?\x05";
const char str_084022E5[] = "I love this beach!\r\nNext time I want to spend\r\nall year here!\x05";
const char str_08402324[] = "Hey there, ";
const char str_08402330[] = "!.\r\nWelcome.\x05";
const char str_0840233E[] = "Other customers?\r\nThere aren't many, I guess.\x05";
const char str_0840236D[] = "Not that I care, much. \x05";
const char str_08402386[] = "Spend all the time here\r\nyou like. \x05";
const char str_084023AC[] = "RIFF";
const char str_084023B4[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_084030C0[] = "JUMP";
const char str_08403AE0[] = "STR I";
const char str_08403B9C[] = "I don't think I've seen you\r\naround here before. \x05";
const char str_08403BCF[] = "Oh, you're at the farm, \r\nare you? Welcome to the \r\nboonies.\x05";
const char str_08403C0D[] = "The name's Gray. \x05";
const char str_08403C20[] = "Wow! What a surprise!\x05";
const char str_08403C37[] = "What's a classy guy like you\r\ndoing in a place like this?\x05";
const char str_08403C72[] = "Thanks! I like having\r\nclassy friends like you.\x05";
const char str_08403CA3[] = "Thanks a lot!\r\nAnytime you want to give\r\nme something, I'm ready to\x05\r\nreceive!\x05";
const char str_08403CF3[] = "Thanks.\x05";
const char str_08403CFC[] = "I'll take this off your\r\nhands, but you don't need to\r\ngive it to me again, OK?\x05";
const char str_08403D4D[] = "What a jerk! \r\nDon't give that to me!\x05";
const char str_08403D74[] = "You're kind of funny, if you\r\nthink that's a big deal. \x05";
const char str_08403DAD[] = "G-get that away from\r\nme...Now!\x05";
const char str_08403DCE[] = "Did gramps make this?\x05";
const char str_08403DE5[] = "Thanks. It's not like I get\r\nto see his work or\r\nanything...\x05";
const char str_08403E23[] = "That's very nice! \r\nI think I'll send it to \r\nmy mom. \x05";
const char str_08403E5B[] = "This is a good present for a\r\ngirl, isn't it?\x05";
const char str_08403E8A[] = "You don't know me if you \r\nthink I'll like that!\r\nWell, maybe...\x05";
const char str_08403ECC[] = "Something you want to \r\ntell me?\x05";
const char str_08403EEE[] = "Tell about job.";
const char str_08403EFE[] = "Don't tell about job.";
const char str_08403F14[] = "Ha! If I got a job somewhere\r\nelse, gramps would \r\ntan my hide!\x05";
const char str_08403F55[] = "How is Mary doing?\x05";
const char str_08403F69[] = "Tell her hi for me. \x05";
const char str_08403F7F[] = "I hate it around here.\r\nThere's nothing to do.\r\nDon't you think so too?\x05";
const char str_08403FC8[] = "I just get so bored in this \r\ntown. I want to go back to\r\nthe city!\x05";
const char str_0840400D[] = "Hey, ";
const char str_08404013[] = "!, what \r\ndo you think of the girl\r\nwho works in the Library?\x05";
const char str_08404052[] = "I go to the Library a lot\r\nthese days. I like reading\r\nbooks all the sudden.\x05";
const char str_084040A0[] = "I had no idea books were\r\nso much fun!\x05";
const char str_084040C8[] = "Did you know Mary writes \r\nnovels! That's amazing. \x05";
const char str_084040FD[] = "I hope one day I can craft\r\nsomething, too.\x05";
const char str_0840412A[] = "Working hard, I see. \x05";
const char str_08404141[] = "Lately I've been getting \r\nalong better with gramps. \x05";
const char str_08404178[] = "I'm enjoying working as a \r\nblacksmith more and more.\x05";
const char str_084041AF[] = "Mary's different from the \r\nother girls. \x05";
const char str_084041DA[] = "I want her to like me!\x05";
const char str_084041F2[] = "All I can do is try my best\r\nto learn the blacksmith \r\ntrade, and read lots of \x05\r\nbooks. \x05";
const char str_0840424D[] = "Hopefully, she'll notice!\x05";
const char str_08404268[] = "I hear neat stories from\r\nMary's father alll the time. \x05";
const char str_084042A1[] = "I like books, too, but\r\nI'm never to give up \r\non being a blacksmith.\x05";
const char str_084042E8[] = "My grampa is so hard on \r\nme for every little thing!\r\nI can hardly stand it!\x05";
const char str_08404336[] = "I wonder how old my \r\ngrandfather is...\x05";
const char str_0840435F[] = "How can he still be so \r\nstrong!?...\x05";
const char str_08404385[] = "Hi there. \r\nDo you need something?\x05";
const char str_084043A9[] = "Shouldn't you be getting \r\nback to the farm around now?\x05";
const char str_084043E2[] = "Mary's parents are both\r\nso nice to me. \x05";
const char str_0840440C[] = "My grandfather doens't seem\r\nto have much energy, lately.\r\nHe doesn't even yell at me!\x05";
const char str_08404464[] = "I'm going to get that old \r\nman to praise me, no matter\r\nwhat!\x05";
const char str_084044A4[] = "No matter how hard I try,\r\nmy grandfather never praises\r\nanything I make or do!\x05";
const char str_084044F5[] = "I hear interesting stories \r\nfrom Mary's father \r\nall the time.\x05";
const char str_08404536[] = "Books have some really\r\ninteresting stories, \r\nyou know.\x05";
const char str_08404570[] = "Mary always suggests such\r\ngreat books for me to read.\x05";
const char str_084045A8[] = "Gramps always makes me go\r\nhiking on vacation days. He\r\nsays it's practice for \x05\r\nconcentrating.\x05";
const char str_0840460A[] = "...Concentrate....\r\n...Concentrate...\x05";
const char str_08404634[] = "RIFF$!";
const char str_0840463C[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_084051F0[] = "JUMP";
const char str_08405C84[] = "I've never seen your face\r\naround these parts before.\x05";
const char str_08405CBB[] = "You're new at the farm, \r\nyou say? That's tough for \r\none man, but you can do it\x05\r\nif you try. \x05";
const char str_08405D1C[] = "I'm Saibara, the blacksmith.\x05";
const char str_08405D3A[] = "Heh heh, what's this?\x05";
const char str_08405D51[] = "A man doesn't expect to get\r\nbirthday gifts at my age!\x05";
const char str_08405D89[] = "My thanks, though!\x05";
const char str_08405D9D[] = "You're kind to an old man, \r\nto give me such a gift.\x05";
const char str_08405DD3[] = "I only wish Gray would \r\nlearn from you.\x05";
const char str_08405DFD[] = "Thanks very much. \r\nYou're a generous man.\x05";
const char str_08405E29[] = "Much obliged.\x05";
const char str_08405E38[] = "Sorry, but I've never needed\r\nanything like this. \x05";
const char str_08405E6C[] = "Just what are you thinking!?\r\nYoung people these days \r\nhave the worst manners!\x05";
const char str_08405EBD[] = "This little guy is small,\r\nbut his will to live is \r\ngreat. We could all learn\x05\r\nfrom it!\x05";
const char str_08405F18[] = "Sorry, but I'm busy \r\nright now. Go show that to\r\nsomebody else. \x05";
const char str_08405F5B[] = "What's this? Was there \r\nsomething wrong with the \r\nworkmanship? \x05";
const char str_08405F9E[] = "I've never had anybody try\r\nto give something back...\x05";
const char str_08405FD5[] = "Now just what do you \r\nexpect me to do with this?\x05";
const char str_08406008[] = "Perfume? I don't see this \r\nmuch in my line of work!\x05";
const char str_0840603E[] = "Why give this to me?\x05";
const char str_08406054[] = "You should eat simple foods,\r\nyou know. You'll live \r\nlonger, like me.\x05";
const char str_0840609C[] = "If you agree, I'll tell you\r\na great recipe for Pickled\r\nTurnip. It's delicious!\x05";
const char str_084060EE[] = "All you need is Turnip,\r\nVinegar, and a Knife.\x05";
const char str_0840611E[] = "A youngin' like you might \r\nwant to flavor it with \r\nSugar, Salt, and Soy Sauce.\x05";
const char str_08406170[] = "A Blue Feather, eh?\r\nI hope that's not for me!!...\x05";
const char str_084061A4[] = "My father used to tell me \r\nrising with dawn was the \r\nkey to a long life. \x05";
const char str_084061F1[] = "The most important work on a\r\nfarm is done early in the \r\nmorning. Sleep in and you \x05\r\nfail, son.\x05";
const char str_08406254[] = "D'ya need something?\x05";
const char str_0840626A[] = "Don't loiter around here \r\nnow, young man!\x05";
const char str_08406296[] = "A farm requires steady \r\nwork now, don't forget!\x05";
const char str_084062C8[] = "All life is study, \r\nyou understand.\x05";
const char str_084062EE[] = "Good morning! We've been \r\nblessed with a fine day!\x05";
const char str_08406323[] = "Sorry, but I'm going \r\nout shopping now.\x05";
const char str_0840634D[] = "I'm about to go out now,\r\nbut why don't you come\r\nwith me?\x05";
const char str_08406389[] = "Those who work hard \r\nget to play hard!\x05";
const char str_084063B2[] = "Well, I should be getting\r\nback now. \x05";
const char str_084063D9[] = "I can see you're doing\r\nwell. Farm life suits you,\r\nbut don't get carried away.\x05";
const char str_0840642A[] = "You like crafted things, \r\ndon't you? Well, what do\r\ndo you want now?\x05";
const char str_08406471[] = "Sorry, ";
const char str_08406479[] = "!,\r\nbut I'm off to buy \r\ningredients for supper!\x05";
const char str_084064AB[] = "When my wife died,\r\nI didn't know how to do \r\nanything around the house.\x05";
const char str_084064F5[] = "Now, I can do it as well\r\nas anyone!\x05";
const char str_0840651B[] = "Have you ever tasted the \r\nwine from around here?\x05";
const char str_0840654E[] = "It's worth a try. \x05";
const char str_08406562[] = "I've tried rice wine, but \r\nI couldn't tell you which \r\none tasted better. \x05";
const char str_084065AF[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_084065B4[] = "!. \r\nA nice evening we have \r\ntonight, eh?\x05";
const char str_084065E0[] = "I'm getting old, and\r\nI want to teach Gray so \r\nmuch before I die...!\x05";
const char str_08406627[] = "Can you believe...\r\nHe won't even go mountain \r\nclimbing with me now \x05\r\nthat he's married!\x05";
const char str_08406683[] = "It's easier without Gray\r\naround anyway! It was like \r\nthat before...\x05";
const char str_084066CA[] = "You like mountain climbing, \r\ntoo, ";
const char str_084066F2[] = "I always close the store \r\nto go hiking on Thursdays.\x05";
const char str_08406729[] = "You should find a way to\r\nget some rest, too!\x05";
const char str_08406758[] = "RIFFw$";
const char str_08406760[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_0840753C[] = "JUMP";
const char str_08407F58[] = "STR o";
const char str_08408004[] = "Who are you again?\r\nOh, you're at the farm, eh?\x05";
const char str_08408035[] = "I'm Gotz, the woodcutter\r\naround these parts. \x05";
const char str_08408065[] = "If you ever want to expand\r\nyour house, just call me!\x05";
const char str_0840809C[] = "No one has given me a \r\nbirthday gift in...years...\x05";
const char str_084080D1[] = "Don't mind the tears...\r\nSniff...Thanks!\x05";
const char str_084080FB[] = "How did you get so nice?\x05";
const char str_08408115[] = "I'll remember this!\x05";
const char str_0840812A[] = "Thanks! I really appreciate\r\ngifts like this!...\x05";
const char str_0840815C[] = "Thanks much. \r\nI can use this. \x05";
const char str_0840817D[] = "What is this for?\r\nWhat do you expect me to \r\ndo with it?!...\x05";
const char str_084081BC[] = "What do you take me for, \r\nsome kind of a fool?!\x05";
const char str_084081EE[] = "Take this back where you \r\ngot it!\x05";
const char str_08408212[] = "Ha...I see things \r\nlike this everyday up on \r\nthe mountain. \x05";
const char str_08408251[] = "Are you trying to scare\r\nme, or what!?\r\nI don't like playing games!\x05";
const char str_08408296[] = "If my daughter were still\r\nalive, she'd be of an age\r\nto wear this...\x05";
const char str_084082DD[] = "Why don't you give it to \r\nKaren at the Supermarket?\x05";
const char str_08408313[] = "My wife used to have \r\nsomething like this...\x05";
const char str_08408342[] = "Why don't you give it to \r\nKaren at the Supermarket?\x05";
const char str_08408378[] = "What's happening? I feel \r\nkinda dizzy...\x05";
const char str_084083A3[] = "Do you like Savory Pancakes?\r\nAll you do is add the \r\ningredients together and \x05\r\nfry it up!\x05";
const char str_08408401[] = "All you need is...\r\nWhat was that again...?\x05";
const char str_0840842E[] = "Oh yeah! Flour, and...Eggs,\r\nand...Cabbage! That's it!\x05";
const char str_08408467[] = "Mix all that up real well,\r\nthen put it in a Frying Pan\r\nwith oil. 'Course, you \x05\r\ngotta cut the Cabbage up \r\nwith a Knife first. \x05";
const char str_084084EB[] = "You can put lots of other\r\nstuff in, too!\x05";
const char str_08408516[] = "If you're gonna get \r\nmarried, you have to look\r\nafter your family forever!\x05";
const char str_08408563[] = "I hear that the equipment\r\nthey got up there at \r\n";
const char str_08408596[] = "+ is all\x05\r\nfirst rate. You should go \r\ntake a look.\x05";
const char str_084085CB[] = "Long ago, a man named \r\nLouis lived at my house.\x05";
const char str_084085FD[] = "He studies bugs, and says \r\nthat Mineral Town is full \r\nof rare insects. \x05";
const char str_08408648[] = "One day, he went out to \r\ncatch butterflies and \r\nnever came back!\x05";
const char str_0840868C[] = "I'm resting now. \r\nDon't bother me. \r\nCome back later. \x05";
const char str_084086C5[] = "Don't bug me if you\r\naren't asking about a job.\x05";
const char str_084086F6[] = "What do you want, \x05";
const char str_0840870B[] = "!?\r\nDon't mind me, I'm rude to \r\neveryone. \x05";
const char str_08408738[] = "Living alone in the\r\nmountains, sometimes you \r\nsee some strange things...\x05";
const char str_08408784[] = "I could never explain, \r\nthough.\x05";
const char str_084087A6[] = "Be careful when climbing\r\nthe mountain yourself. \x05";
const char str_084087D9[] = "There are no bears or \r\nwolves, but you can't be too\r\ncautious. Know what I mean?\x05";
const char str_0840882C[] = "It seems you're \r\nkeeping busy. Keep at it!\x05";
const char str_08408859[] = "I'm looking for good Lumber\r\ntrees. Then I'll see about \r\nfinding something to eat.\x05";
const char str_084088AE[] = "Let me give some advice \r\nabout tree chopping. \x05";
const char str_084088DF[] = "Don't chop down more than\r\nyou need.\x05";
const char str_08408905[] = "We humans have to respect\r\nnature, you know.\x05";
const char str_08408933[] = "I'm going to see the Mayor.\r\nGotta keep good relations,\r\nyou know!\x05";
const char str_08408977[] = "Keep up the good work!\x05";
const char str_0840898F[] = "I like to come to town on\r\nSaturday. Buy eggs and milk,\r\nstuff like that. \x05";
const char str_084089DB[] = "If I stayed up in the \r\nmountain too long, people'd\r\nforget about me, and I'd\x05\r\nbe outa work!...\x05";
const char str_08408A3D[] = "Keeping up the good work,\r\n";
const char str_08408A5D[] = "You just keep on \r\nexpanding the farm!\x05";
const char str_08408A85[] = "Hi, ";
const char str_08408A8A[] = "!. \r\nYou like it here, too?\x05";
const char str_08408AA7[] = "Ever since I lost my family \r\nhere...\x05";
const char str_08408ACE[] = "I keep telling Basil not to\r\nbring his family hiking \r\nin bad weather!\x05";
const char str_08408B16[] = "You be careful too, now!\x05";
const char str_08408B30[] = "Oh, it's you, ";
const char str_08408B44[] = "If you don't get off the \r\nmountain soon, you'll be \r\ncaught out in the dark.\x05";
const char str_08408B93[] = "Hey there!\r\nHow's the work coming?\x05";
const char str_08408BB7[] = "Just you wait and see!\x05";
const char str_08408BD0[] = "RIFF,";
const char str_08408BD8[] = "SCR CODEX\t";
const char str_0840953C[] = "JUMP";
const char str_08409F3C[] = "STR ";
const char str_08409FD0[] = "Where did you come from?\r\nI've never seen you before.\x05";
const char str_0840A007[] = "Oh! You're at that farm,\r\nare you?\x05";
const char str_0840A02B[] = "My name is May.\r\nLet's be friends.\x05";
const char str_0840A04F[] = "Wow! Thanks! A present\r\nfrom my mommy \r\ncame in the mail today, too!\x05";
const char str_0840A095[] = "I was happy...\r\nBut I really wanted her \r\nto come visit...\x05";
const char str_0840A0D1[] = "Thanks, thanks!\r\nI can't wait to show it\r\nto Grampa!\x05";
const char str_0840A107[] = "This is the nicest\r\npresent ever! Thank you!\x05";
const char str_0840A135[] = "Thanks. I love presents!\x05";
const char str_0840A14F[] = "This is very pretty!\r\nKeep it a secret from\r\nGrampa...\x05";
const char str_0840A187[] = "I won't be mad if you \r\ndecide to give this to \r\nsomeone else. \x05";
const char str_0840A1C8[] = "It's so cuute!\r\nGoooood boooooy.\x05";
const char str_0840A208[] = "Can I really keep it?\r\nYou're not going to take\r\nit back, are you?\x05";
const char str_0840A24C[] = "I'll wear it forever!\x05";
const char str_0840A263[] = "This is the best present \r\never! I'll wear it when I \r\nget older, OK?\x05";
const char str_0840A2AA[] = "Wow! Perfume!\r\nI know what it is because \r\nmy mommy used to wear it\r\nall the time!\x05";
const char str_0840A2FE[] = "It's so pretty!\r\nWhat is it?\x05";
const char str_0840A31C[] = "A few days ago, I \r\ntalked with my mommy on the\r\nphone! It was nice to hear \x05\r\nher voice, but I hope she \r\ncan come home soon...\x05";
const char str_0840A39E[] = "Hi!\x05";
const char str_0840A3A3[] = "Grampa says he's too busy\r\nand too old, so he can't \r\nplay with me...\x05";
const char str_0840A3EA[] = "Grampa always gets quiet\r\nwhen I talk about Mommy...\x05";
const char str_0840A420[] = "I feel like crying whenever\r\nGrampa looks angry or sad.\x05";
const char str_0840A459[] = "Then he always cheers me \r\nup, though!\x05";
const char str_0840A481[] = "I hate bad weather because\r\nit keeps me from playing\r\noutside!\x05";
const char str_0840A4C1[] = "Once I caught a cold when \r\nI played outside in \r\nthe rain, so now my grampa\x05\r\nalways makes me stay in\r\non rainy days. Pooh!\x05";
const char str_0840A53F[] = "I hope it's sunny tomorrow!\x05";
const char str_0840A55C[] = "It's my bed time!\x05";
const char str_0840A56F[] = "Sometimes I like to go to \r\nsleep with the goats. They \r\nfeel all warm and furry, \x05\r\nand I have neat dreams.\x05";
const char str_0840A5DD[] = "You should try it \r\ntoo! \r\n...Good night!\x05";
const char str_0840A608[] = "Today is Grampa's \r\nHot Spring day.\x05";
const char str_0840A62D[] = "I hate the Hot Spring!\r\nIt's too hot!\x05";
const char str_0840A654[] = "Hi there!\x05";
const char str_0840A65F[] = "I heard there was a field\r\nof flowers above here.\x05";
const char str_0840A692[] = "Grampa says it's dangerous,\r\nthough, so I don't go. \x05";
const char str_0840A6C8[] = "Hello there!\r\nI like Carter, don't you?\x05";
const char str_0840A6F1[] = "He talks nice to me, and\r\ngives me treats!\x05";
const char str_0840A71D[] = "I like Stu...\r\nBut sometimes I hate him, \r\ntoo. I don't know why.\x05";
const char str_0840A760[] = "Won't you play with me?\x05";
const char str_0840A779[] = "You have to work?\r\nThat's too bad...\x05";
const char str_0840A79F[] = "All the adults say they're \r\nbusy all the time. \x05";
const char str_0840A7D1[] = "It's not fair!\r\nMaybe Carter will play...\x05";
const char str_0840A7FC[] = "RIFF";
const char str_0840A804[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_0840B3D0[] = "JUMP";
const char str_0840BDC4[] = "STR ";
const char str_0840BE6C[] = "What's this? A new face \r\nin town? How intriguing!\x05";
const char str_0840BEA0[] = "The name is Barley. \r\nHow do you do. \x05";
const char str_0840BEC7[] = "A birthday present for \r\nan old geezer like me?\x05";
const char str_0840BEF8[] = "My granddaughter May just \r\ngave me flowers, too!\x05";
const char str_0840BF2B[] = "I've loved these since I\r\nwas a young whipper-\r\nsnapper like yourself. \x05";
const char str_0840BF74[] = "You don't have to try to\r\ncurry favor with me, young\r\nman! Thanks, though...\x05";
const char str_0840BFC2[] = "Thanks. \r\nYou're a thoughtful kid.\x05";
const char str_0840BFE6[] = "Thanks, but I really don't \r\nneed things, like this, \r\nespecially at my age. \x05";
const char str_0840C035[] = "Just what's the idea of \r\ngiving me something like \r\nthis?\x05";
const char str_0840C071[] = "Thanks for showing this\r\nto me. I hope May grows up \r\nhealthy and happy like you.\x05";
const char str_0840C0C4[] = "Foxes can be dangerous, \r\nyou know. Better to set \r\nthat one free. \x05";
const char str_0840C109[] = "What a pretty bauble. \r\nI think I'll give it to May\r\nwhen she gets older.\x05";
const char str_0840C154[] = "I'll give this to May when \r\nshe gets older. Thanks!\x05";
const char str_0840C18A[] = "Ahh...What a beautiful smell!\x05";
const char str_0840C1A9[] = "Want to learn how to \r\nmake ice cream?\x05";
const char str_0840C1D1[] = "May makes me make it for\r\nher all the time.\x05";
const char str_0840C1FE[] = "All you need is Sugar, \r\nMilk, and Eggs, and of \r\nof course a Whisk and \x05\r\na Pot.\x05";
const char str_0840C251[] = "May loves it when I slice \r\nup Pineapple and Apple with\r\nmy knife and add it in \x05\r\nwith Honey. Myself, I like \r\nit with Wild Grapes. You \r\nshould give it a try.\x05";
const char str_0840C2F3[] = "A Blue Feather, huh?\r\nWho's the lucky girl?\r\nDon't lose your nerve, now!\x05";
const char str_0840C33D[] = "Ever heard of a place called\r\nForget-me-not Valley?\x05";
const char str_0840C372[] = "I hear ";
const char str_0840C37A[] = ",\r\nover there is great \r\nwith horses.\x05";
const char str_0840C3A1[] = "I like to visit the \r\nMayor's House on Mondays.\x05";
const char str_0840C3D2[] = "Today is my Hot Spring day.\r\nThank goodness it's sunny.\x05";
const char str_0840C40B[] = "I always feel much \r\nbetter after time in the \r\nHot Spring!\x05";
const char str_0840C448[] = "And I was going to the \r\nHot Spring today! It always\r\nrains at the worst times!\x05";
const char str_0840C499[] = "What are you doing here?\x05";
const char str_0840C4B3[] = "It's only me and May living\r\nhere, so it must be boring\r\nfor someone like you. \x05";
const char str_0840C504[] = "I check on the animals each \r\nand every morning. \x05";
const char str_0840C537[] = "If you slack off, you never\r\nknow what could happen!\x05";
const char str_0840C56D[] = "Dogs really are smart, \r\nyou know. The more you play\r\ncatch with a dog, the \x05\r\nbetter it'll get. \x05";
const char str_0840C5D0[] = "Did you remember to \r\nPut your Cows and Chickens \r\nin the Barn?\x05";
const char str_0840C611[] = "You'll catch cold if\r\nyou're not careful!\x05";
const char str_0840C63C[] = "Did you come to play?\x05";
const char str_0840C653[] = "Come any time you want, now!\x05";
const char str_0840C671[] = "Is the farm working out\r\nwell for you? It must be \r\nquite a job to restore that\x05\r\nplace, but good luck!\x05";
const char str_0840C6DA[] = "I bet you could do anything\r\nif you put your mind to it!\x05";
const char str_0840C714[] = "I think the Mayor does\r\na great job, don't you?\x05";
const char str_0840C745[] = "Thomas' father was the Mayor\r\ntoo, you know. I wonder\r\nwhat Harris will do. \x05";
const char str_0840C793[] = "I wonder how Saibara and \r\nEllen are faring. We all \r\nshould see each other more.\x05";
const char str_0840C7E6[] = "Make lots of friends here, \r\n";
const char str_0840C804[] = "!. \r\nYou won't regret it.\x05";
const char str_0840C81F[] = "Do you want to take a\r\ndip in the Hot Spring, too?\x05";
const char str_0840C853[] = "May says the waters are \r\ntoo hot, so she always \r\nwaits outside.\x05";
const char str_0840C896[] = "I just love the Hot Spring!\r\nIt's great to have it so \r\nclose to my house!\x05";
const char str_0840C8E2[] = "If I didn't have the Hot \r\nSpring to keep me going....\r\nI don't think I could keep \x05\r\nup any more!\x05";
const char str_0840C946[] = "Kids these days like to \r\nstay up late. May hates\r\ngoing to bed. \x05";
const char str_0840C989[] = "I've got to get to bed.\r\nGood night...\x05";
