const char str_0843F793[] = "@\r\nCan anyone catch her when\r\nshe uses her Shining Wing\r\nspell?\r\n";
const char str_0843F86B[] = "ECosmos\r\n";
const char str_0843F875[] = "@On Peony\r\n";
const char str_0843F881[] = "@Using Darkness Magic\r\n";
const char str_0843F8D1[] = "@\r\nCosmos, Daisy's twin sister,\r\nhas magic opposite but\r\nalmost as powerful in her\r\nDark Wing spell.\r\n";
const char str_0843F970[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfourth match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0843F9AF[] = "The results of the fourth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0843FA19[] = "@\r\nThis race belonged to Daisy\r\nand Cosmos. In the first lap\r\nthey suddenly combined their\r\nmagics into a Shining Dark";
const char str_0843FA91[] = "\r\nWing, and promptly pulled\r\nahead of the pack to take\r\nthe lead!\r\nThey then held off all\r\ncomers together, to take\r\nfirst and second place.\r\nSylvia came in third in\r\nthis race, with Daisy two\r\npoints behind her current\r\n1st Place ranking in the\r\noverall standings.\r\nLeatrice hit Amaryllis, thus\r\nwiping out again, following\r\nher collision with Sylvia in\r\nthe previous race.\r\n";
const char str_0843FC24[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0843FC92[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Daisy\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos\r\n3rd Place: Sylvia\x05";
const char str_0843FCDC[] = "The results of the fourth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0843FD46[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Daisy   +10\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos  +6\r\n3rd Place: Sylvia   +4\r\n4th Place: Miltonia  +3\r\n5th Place: Lupinus   +2\r\n6th Place: Moraea   +1\r\n7th Place: Lavender\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0843FE37[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Sylvia   24\r\n2nd (up): Daisy  22\r\n3rd (down): Lupinus  20\r\n3rd (down): Miltonia  16\r\n5th (unch.): Cosmos  16\r\n6th (unch.): Amaryllis  3\r\n6th (up, tie): Moraea  3\r\n";
const char str_0843FF35[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0843FF50[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0843FFB8[] = "EAmaryllis\r\n";
const char str_0843FFC5[] = "@On Sakuya\r\n";
const char str_0843FFD2[] = "@Using Flower Magic\r\n";
const char str_08440020[] = "@\r\nAll her magic does is create\r\nflowers, which really isn't\r\nthat useful in racing...\r\n";
const char str_0844010F[] = "ELiliac\r\n";
const char str_08440119[] = "@On Karin\r\n";
const char str_08440125[] = "@Trainee in Magic\r\n";
const char str_08440171[] = "@\r\nAs a trainee, Lilac has no\r\nmagic yet. Let's hope she\r\neventually makes good.\r\n";
const char str_084401FC[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfifth match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08440248[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_084402B0[] = "EMoraea\r\n";
const char str_084402BA[] = "@On Natsuki\r\n";
const char str_084402C8[] = "@Using Summoning Magic\r\n";
const char str_08440319[] = "@\r\nI've never seen her summon\r\nanything, though, so I don't\r\nrightly know just what this\r\nmeans.";
const char str_08440428[] = "ELupinus\r\n";
const char str_08440433[] = "@On Misuzu\r\n";
const char str_08440440[] = "@Using Illusion Magic\r\n";
const char str_08440490[] = "@\r\nAll she does is illusion, so\r\nif you figure that out,\r\nshe's totally powerless.\r\n";
const char str_0844051D[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfifth match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844055B[] = "The results of the fifth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_084405C4[] = "@\r\nPrior to the start of the\r\nrace, Lavender advised Daisy\r\nagainst entering, telling\r\nher that her divination\r\nforetold that they would\r\ncollide and be out of the\r\nrace. Naturally, Daisy paid\r\nno heed to this advice, and\r\nentered the race as\r\nscheduled. Then, in the\r\ntwelfth lap, Daisy and\r\nCosmos were using their\r\ncombined magic, when they\r\ncame upon Lavender, who was\r\nalready being lapped. Daisy\r\ntried to force her way past\r\nLavender, only to run into\r\nher instead. Given that the\r\ncollision happened while\r\nDaisy was using her magic,\r\nthere is greater concern for\r\nthe state of her mind than\r\nthat of her body.\r\n";
const char str_0844084B[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_084408B9[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Miltonia\r\n2nd Place: Sylvia\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus\x05";
const char str_08440907[] = "The results of the fifth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08440970[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Miltonia  +10\r\n2nd Place: Sylvia  +6\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus  +4\r\n4th Place: Cosmos  +3\r\n5th Place: Moraea  +2\r\n6th Place: Amaryllis  +1\r\n7th Place: Leatrice\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08440A61[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Sylvia   30\r\n2nd (up): Miltonia  26\r\n3rd (unch.): Lupinus  24\r\n4th (down): Daisy  22\r\n5th (unch.): Cosmos  19\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  5\r\n7th (down): Amaryllis  4\r\n";
const char str_08440B5D[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_08440B78[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08440BE0[] = "ESylvia\r\n";
const char str_08440BEA[] = "@On Futaba\r\n";
const char str_08440BF7[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_08440C45[] = "@\r\nHer magic is well-balanced\r\nbetween offense and defense,\r\nand she always races well.\r\n";
const char str_08440D35[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_08440D41[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_08440D4E[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_08440D9B[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_08440E3D[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsixth match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08440E89[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP";
const char str_08440EA6[] = "@\r\nare as follows:";
const char str_08440EFD[] = "ELeatrice\r\n";
const char str_08440F09[] = "@On Sana\r\n";
const char str_08440F14[] = "@Using Voodoo\r\n";
const char str_08440F5C[] = "@\r\nShe can always be seen\r\ngoing around before the race\r\nwith dolls and needles. She\r\ndoesn't do much at all\r\nduring the race proper.\r\n";
const char str_0844107A[] = "ELavender\r\n";
const char str_08441086[] = "@On Starlight\r\n";
const char str_08441096[] = "@Using Divination\r\n";
const char str_084410E2[] = "@\r\nShe always divines who will\r\nwin before a race starts.\r\nRumor has it her predictions\r\nare 100% accurate.\r\n";
const char str_08441188[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsixth match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_084411C6[] = "The results of the sixth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844122F[] = "@\r\nOwing to the serious\r\ninjuries they sustained when\r\nthey collided in the last\r\nrace, Daisy and Lavender\r\nwere scratched this time.\r\nWith Daisy out of the race,\r\nCosmos had a hard time of\r\nit, because she couldn't use\r\ntheir combination magic. The\r\nbattle for first place was\r\nthus between Lupinus,\r\nSylvia, and Miltonia, who\r\nhas been in good form as of\r\nlate. In the end, Lupinus\r\nused her mirror images to\r\nbreak away from the pack and\r\nwin the race. Her total\r\npoint standing is now equal\r\nto that of Sylvia.\r\n";
const char str_0844144E[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_084414BC[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Lupinus\r\n2nd Place: Miltonia\r\n3rd Place: Sylvia\x05";
const char str_0844150A[] = "The results of the sixth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08441573[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Lupinus  +10\r\n2nd Place: Miltonia  +6\r\n3rd Place: Sylvia  +4\r\n4th Place: Cosmos  +3\r\n5th Place: Amaryllis  +2\r\n6th Place: Moraea  +1\r\n7th Place: Leatrice\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08441664[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Sylvia   34\r\n2nd (up): Lupinus  34\r\n3rd (down): Miltonia  32\r\n4th (unch.): Daisy  22\r\n4th (up): Cosmos  22\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n6th (up): Amaryllis  6\r\n";
