const char str_0844422D[] = "The results of the final\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08444296[] = "@\r\nSadly, Miltonia had to be\r\nscratched, and thus, the\r\nchampionship came down to\r\nthe top three point holders.\r\nYotsuba, Sylvia's new\r\nmachine, finally showed us\r\nwhat it can do. This machine\r\nhas four modes that are\r\ncapable of handling any\r\nterrain, including a wind\r\nmode that not even the\r\ncombination magic used by\r\nDaisy and Cosmos could beat.\r\nThis victory put Sylvia back\r\non top in total points. Our\r\ncongratulations to her.\r\n";
const char str_08444465[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_084444D3[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Sylvia\r\n2nd Place: Daisy\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos\x05";
const char str_0844451D[] = "The results of the final\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08444586[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Sylvia  +10\r\n2nd Place: Daisy  +6\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos  +4\r\n4th Place: Lupinus  +3\r\n5th Place: Lavender  +2\r\n6th Place: Moraea  +1\r\n7th Place: Amaryllis\r\n8th Place: Leatrice\r\n9th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08444689[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (up): Sylvia  52\r\n2nd (up): Daisy  50\r\n3rd (down): Lupinus  49\r\n4th (down): Miltonia  47\r\n5th (unch.): Cosmos  40\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  9\r\n7th (unch.): Amaryllis  7\r\n8th (unch.): Lavender  5\r\n9th (unch.): Leatrice  1\r\n";
const char str_084447B5[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_084447D0[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08444838[] = "ESylvia\r\n";
const char str_08444842[] = "@On Yotsuba\r\n";
const char str_08444850[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844489E[] = "@\r\nSylvia's new machine,\r\nYotsuba, can apparently\r\nchange into any of four\r\ndifferent forms, in\r\naccordance with whichever\r\nmagic she is using at a\r\ngiven time. We'll just have\r\nto see what this is all\r\nabout.\r\n";
const char str_08444A08[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_08444A14[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_08444A21[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_08444A6E[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_08444B10[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfirst match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08444B5C[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08444BC4[] = "ELicorice\r\n";
const char str_08444BD0[] = "@On Makoto\r\n";
const char str_08444BDD[] = "@Using Spatial Magic\r\n";
const char str_08444C2C[] = "@\r\nLicorice's spatial\r\ninterchange magic, which\r\nenables her to change places\r\nwith anyone else, may well\r\nbe the most powerful magic\r\nof all.\r\n";
const char str_08444D53[] = "ELavender\r\n";
const char str_08444D5F[] = "@On Starlight\r\n";
const char str_08444D6F[] = "@Using Divination\r\n";
const char str_08444DBB[] = "@\r\nShe always divines who will\r\nwin before a race starts.\r\nRumor has it her predictions\r\nare 100% accurate.\r\n";
const char str_08444E61[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfirst match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08444E9F[] = "The results of the first\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08444F08[] = "@\r\nIn her first race ever,\r\nLicorice came in first. What\r\nhappened was that in the\r\nfinal lap, she sneakily used\r\nher spatial interchange\r\nmagic to switch places with\r\nSylvia, who had been in the\r\nlead up to that point. There\r\nare calls now, however, for\r\nthis type of magic to be";
const char str_08445022[] = "\r\nbanned as too dangerous for\r\nuse in certain spellcasting\r\nsituations. Further\r\ninformation will be reported\r\nas it becomes available.\r\nSylvia ended up dead last,\r\nby the way.\r\n";
const char str_084450EF[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844515D[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Daisy\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos\x05";
const char str_084451A9[] = "The results of the first\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08445212[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd: Daisy  +6\r\n3rd: Cosmos  +4\r\n4th: Lupinus  +3\r\n5th: Miltonia  +2\r\n6th: Moraea  +1\r\n7th: Amaryllis\r\n8th: Lavender\r\n9th: Lilac\r\n10th: Sylvia\r\n";
const char str_084452EF[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st: Licorice  10\r\n2nd: Daisy  6\r\n3rd: Cosmos  4\r\n4th: Lupinus  3\r\n5th: Miltonia  2\r\n6th: Moraea  1\r\n\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_08445383[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_084453EB[] = "EDaisy\r\n";
const char str_084453F4[] = "@On Peony\r\n";
const char str_08445400[] = "@Using Light Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844544D[] = "@\r\nCan anyone catch her when\r\nshe uses her Shining Wing\r\nspell?\r\n";
const char str_08445525[] = "ECosmos\r\n";
const char str_0844552F[] = "@On Peony\r\n";
const char str_0844553B[] = "@Using Darkness Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844558B[] = "@\r\nCosmos, Daisy's twin sister,\r\nhas magic opposite but\r\nalmost as powerful in her\r\nDark Wing spell.\r\n";
const char str_0844562A[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsecond match will be the\r\nday after tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08445677[] = "The results of the second\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_084456E1[] = "@\r\nLicorice, who had just won\r\nher first race, is on the\r\ninjured list. It seems that\r\nher spatial interchange\r\nmagic burns a fair amount of\r\nmagic power, and thus, can't\r\nbe used all that often. As\r\nfor Sylvia, she was still\r\napparently pretty burned by\r\nhaving ended up dead last in\r\nthe previous race, and just\r\ndidn't run a very good race\r\nat all this time around. In\r\nthe event, this race came\r\ndown to Daisy and Cosmos on\r\nthe one hand, and Lupinus on\r\nthe other. By skillfully\r\ninterposing her mirror\r\nimages between Daisy and\r\nCosmos, Lupinus was able to\r\nkeep them from using their\r\ncombination magic, and thus\r\nwin the race.\r\n";
const char str_08445978[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_084459E6[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Lupinus\r\n2nd Place: Daisy\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos\x05";
const char str_08445A31[] = "The results of the second\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08445A9B[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Lupinus  +10\r\n2nd Place: Daisy  +6\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos  +4\r\n4th Place: Miltonia  +3\r\n5th Place: Moraea  +2\r\n6th Place: Amaryllis  +1\r\n7th Place: Sylvia\r\n8th Place: Lavender\r\n9th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08445B9E[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (up): Lupinus  13\r\n2nd (unch.): Daisy  12\r\n3rd (down): Licorice  10\r\n4th (down): Cosmos  8\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  5\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  3\r\n7th (up): Amaryllis  1\r\n";
const char str_08445C96[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_08445CB1[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08445D19[] = "EMoraea\r\n";
const char str_08445D23[] = "@On Natsuki\r\n";
const char str_08445D31[] = "@Using Summoning Magic\r\n";
const char str_08445D82[] = "@\r\nI've never seen her summon\r\nanything, though, so I don't\r\nrightly know just what this\r\nmeans.";
const char str_08445E91[] = "ELupinus\r\n";
const char str_08445E9C[] = "@On Misuzu\r\n";
const char str_08445EA9[] = "@Using Illusion Magic\r\n";
const char str_08445EF9[] = "@\r\nAll she does is illusion, so\r\nif you figure that out,\r\nshe's totally powerless.\r\n";
const char str_08445F86[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nthird match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08445FD2[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844603A[] = "ESylvia\r\n";
const char str_08446044[] = "@On Yotsuba\r\n";
const char str_08446052[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_084460A0[] = "@\r\nSylvia's new machine,\r\nYotsuba, can apparently\r\nchange into any of four\r\ndifferent forms, in\r\naccordance with whichever\r\nmagic she is using at a\r\ngiven time. We'll just have\r\nto see what this is all\r\nabout.\r\n";
const char str_0844620A[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_08446216[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_08446223[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_08446270[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_08446312[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nthird match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08446350[] = "The results of the third\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_084463B9[] = "@\r\nAs with the previous race,\r\nLicorice sat out this one\r\ntoo. The difference is that\r\nshe didn't enter this one,\r\nshe says, because she didn't\r\nvery much feel like it,\r\nadding that she would be in\r\nthe next one, however. It\r\nthus appeared that this race\r\nwould be down to Daisy and\r\nCosmos versus Lupinus again,\r\njust like the previous one,\r\nexcept that Miltonia also\r\njoined in this time, to make\r\nit a three-sided contest.\r\nThe outcome was decided when\r\nDaisy and Cosmos used a\r\nmomentary advantage to cast\r\ntheir combination magic,\r\nthus taking first and second\r\nplace, followed by Miltonia\r\nand Lupinus, in that order.\r\n";
const char str_08446645[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_084466B3[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Daisy\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos\r\n3rd Place: Miltonia\x05";
const char str_084466FF[] = "The results of the third\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08446768[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Daisy  +10\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos  +6\r\n3rd Place: Miltonia  +4\r\n4th Place: Lupinus  +3\r\n5th Place: Amaryllis  +2\r\n6th Place: Moraea  +1\r\n7th Place: Lavender\r\n8th Place: Sylvia\r\n9th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0844686B[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (up): Daisy  22\r\n2nd (down): Lupinus  16\r\n3rd (up): Cosmos  14\r\n4th (down): Licorice  10\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  9\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  4\r\n7th (up): Amaryllis  3\r\n";
const char str_08446961[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0844697C[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_084469E4[] = "ELicorice\r\n";
const char str_084469F0[] = "@On Makoto\r\n";
const char str_084469FD[] = "@Using Spatial Magic\r\n";
const char str_08446A4C[] = "@\r\nLicorice's spatial\r\ninterchange magic, which\r\nenables her to change places\r\nwith anyone else, may well\r\nbe the most powerful magic\r\nof all.\r\n";
const char str_08446B73[] = "ELavender\r\n";
const char str_08446B7F[] = "@On Starlight\r\n";
const char str_08446B8F[] = "@Using Divination\r\n";
const char str_08446BDB[] = "@\r\nShe always divines who will\r\nwin before a race starts.\r\nRumor has it her predictions\r\nare 100% accurate.\r\n";
const char str_08446C81[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfourth match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08446CCE[] = "The results of the fourth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08446D38[] = "@\r\nLicorice, who had been\r\non the injured list ever\r\nsince winning her very first\r\nrace ever, got back on the\r\ntrack for the first time\r\ntoday. Sylvia wasted no time\r\nin complaining to Licorice\r\nabout the magic that\r\nLicorice used in that first\r\nrace, however. People around\r\nthem stopped the conflict at\r\nthe time, but words don't\r\nappear to have been enough\r\nfor Sylvia, whose anger came\r\nout in a bad way during the\r\nrace, when she collided with\r\nLupinus, taking them both\r\nout of the running. Licorice\r\nwent on to win the race,\r\nwithout using her spatial\r\ninterchange magic.\r\n";
const char str_08446F97[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_08447005[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Daisy\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos\x05";
const char str_08447051[] = "The results of the fourth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_084470BB[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Daisy  +6\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos  +4\r\n4th Place: Miltonia  +3\r\n5th Place: Moraea  +2\r\n6th Place: Lavender  +1\r\n7th Place: Amaryllis\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_084471AC[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Daisy  28\r\n2nd (up): Licorice  20\r\n3rd (unch.): Cosmos  18\r\n4th (down): Lupinus  16\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  12\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n7th (unch.): Amaryllis  3\r\n8th (up)  Lavender  1\r\n";
const char str_084472C1[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_084472DC[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08447344[] = "EAmaryllis\r\n";
const char str_08447351[] = "@On Sakuya\r\n";
const char str_0844735E[] = "@Using Flower Magic\r\n";
const char str_084473AC[] = "@\r\nAll her magic does is create\r\nflowers, which really isn't\r\nthat useful in racing...\r\n";
const char str_0844749B[] = "ELiliac\r\n";
const char str_084474A5[] = "@On Karin\r\n";
const char str_084474B1[] = "@Trainee in Magic\r\n";
const char str_084474FD[] = "@\r\nAs a trainee, Lilac has no\r\nmagic yet. Let's hope she\r\neventually makes good.\r\n";
const char str_08447588[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfifth match will be the\r\nday after tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_084475D4[] = "The results of the fifth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844763D[] = "@\r\nThis time around, Lavender's\r\ndivination foretold that she\r\nand Daisy were going to\r\ncollide. Naturally, Daisy\r\nwasn't going to take news\r\nlike that lying down. She\r\ndid her level best to stay\r\naway from Lavender during\r\nthe race, only to suddenly\r\nfind herself being lapped.\r\nAnd wouldn't you know it?\r\nJust then, Lavender's\r\nmachine breaks down,\r\ndecelerates, and slides over\r\nto hit Daisy, who at this\r\npoint is behind her at an\r\nangle, taking them both out\r\nof the race. It appears\r\nthere really is no escape\r\nfrom Lavender's divinations,\r\nafter all. As a result of\r\nher crash, Daisy was passed\r\nup in the overall standings\r\nby Licorice.\r\n";
const char str_084478DE[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844794C[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus\x05";
const char str_0844799A[] = "The results of the fifth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08447A03[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos  +6\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus  +4\r\n4th Place: Sylvia  +3\r\n5th Place: Miltonia  +2\r\n6th Place: Amaryllis  +1\r\n7th Place: Moraea\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08447AF4[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (up): Licorice  30\r\n2nd (down): Daisy  28\r\n3rd (unch.): Cosmos  24\r\n4th (unch.): Lupinus  20\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  14\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n7th (unch.): Amaryllis  4\r\n8th (up): Sylvia  3\r\n9th (down): Lavender  1\r\n";
