const char str_08447CAD[] = "@On Yotsuba\r\n";
const char str_08447CBB[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_08447D09[] = "@\r\nSylvia's new machine,\r\nYotsuba, can change into any\r\nof four different forms, in\r\naccordance with whichever\r\nmagic she is using at a\r\ngiven time. It's a good one.\r\n";
const char str_08447E47[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_08447E53[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_08447E60[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_08447EAD[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_08447F4F[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsixth match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08447F9B[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08448003[] = "ELicorice\r\n";
const char str_0844800F[] = "@On Makoto\r\n";
const char str_0844801C[] = "@Using Spatial Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844806B[] = "@\r\nLicorice's spatial\r\ninterchange magic, which\r\nenables her to change places\r\nwith anyone else, may well\r\nbe the most powerful magic\r\nof all.\r\n";
const char str_08448192[] = "ELavender\r\n";
const char str_0844819E[] = "@On Starlight\r\n";
const char str_084481AE[] = "@Using Divination\r\n";
const char str_084481FA[] = "@\r\nShe always divines who will\r\nwin before a race starts.\r\nRumor has it her predictions\r\nare 100% accurate.\r\n";
const char str_084482A0[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsixth match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_084482DE[] = "The results of the sixth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08448347[] = "@\r\nThis time around, it was\r\nDaisy's turn to get nailed\r\nby Licorice's spatial\r\ninterchange magic. She ended\r\nup right smack behind\r\nAmaryllis and Moraea, and,\r\nunable to effectively dodge\r\neither of them, instead\r\nplowed into them both, thus\r\ntaking all three of them out\r\nof the race. Daisy thus fell\r\nto third place in the\r\noverall standings, being\r\npassed up in the process by\r\nher sister, Cosmos. The";
const char str_084484DE[] = "\r\nquestion now is, having used\r\nher spatial interchange\r\nmagic, will Licorice sit out\r\nthe next race, as happened\r\nlast time?\r\n";
const char str_08448578[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_084485E6[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus\x05";
const char str_08448634[] = "The results of the sixth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844869D[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos  +6\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus  +4\r\n4th Place: Sylvia  +3\r\n5th Place: Miltonia  +2\r\n6th Place: Lavender  +1\r\n7th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0844877A[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Licorice  40\r\n2nd (up): Cosmos  30\r\n3rd (down): Daisy  28\r\n4th (unch.): Lupinus  24\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  16\r\n6th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n6th (up): Sylvia  6\r\n8th (down): Amaryllis  4\r\n9th (unch.): Lavender  2\r\n";
const char str_084488A6[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_084488C1[] = "The results of the seventh\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844892C[] = "@\r\nTo no one's surprise,\r\nLicorice did indeed sit out\r\nthis race Instead, the\r\nwinner of this race turned\r\nout to be Lupinus, on her\r\nbrand new machine, Maho. By\r\nskillfully blocking Daisy\r\nand Cosmos from using their\r\nmagic, she kept the field\r\nrunning at her own pace,\r\nfrom start to finish, taking\r\nthe win without a struggle.\r\nAs a result, Lupinus, Daisy,\r\nand Cosmos are now in a\r\nthree-way tie for second\r\nplace in the overall\r\nstandings.\r\n";
const char str_08448B05[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_08448B73[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Lupinus\r\n2nd Place: Daisy\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos\x05";
const char str_08448BBE[] = "The results of the seventh\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08448C29[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Lupinus  +10\r\n2nd Place: Daisy  +6\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos  +4\r\n4th Place: Sylvia  +3\r\n5th Place: Lavender  +2\r\n6th Place: Amaryllis  +1\r\n7th Place: Moraea\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08448D17[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Licorice  40\r\n2nd (unch.): Cosmos  34\r\n2nd (up): Daisy  34\r\n2nd (up): Lupinus  34\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  16\r\n6th (unch.): Sylvia  9\r\n7th (down): Moraea  6\r\n8th (unch.): Amaryllis  5\r\n9th (unch.): Lavender  4\r\n";
const char str_08448E44[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_08448E5F[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08448EC7[] = "EMoraea\r\n";
const char str_08448ED1[] = "@On Natsuki\r\n";
const char str_08448EDF[] = "@Using Summoning Magic\r\n";
const char str_08448F30[] = "@\r\nI've never seen her summon\r\nanything, though, so I don't\r\nrightly know just what this\r\nmeans.";
const char str_0844903F[] = "ELupinus\r\n";
const char str_0844904A[] = "@On Maho\r\n";
const char str_08449055[] = "@Using Illusion Magic\r\n";
const char str_084490A5[] = "@\r\nLupinus's new machine, Maho,\r\nsure seems more powerful\r\nthan its predecessor, though\r\nyou can't necessarily tell\r\nfor sure from just a single\r\nglance.\r\n";
const char str_08449179[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\neighth match will be the\r\nday after tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_084491C6[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844922E[] = "ESylvia\r\n";
const char str_08449238[] = "@On Yotsuba\r\n";
const char str_08449246[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_08449294[] = "@\r\nSylvia's new machine,\r\nYotsuba, can change into any\r\nof four different forms, in\r\naccordance with whichever\r\nmagic she is using at a\r\ngiven time. It's a good one.\r\n";
const char str_084493D2[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_084493DE[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_084493EB[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_08449438[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_084494DA[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\neighth match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08449519[] = "The results of the eighth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08449583[] = "@\r\nLicorice made a rapid return\r\nto the field. The big\r\ninterest in this race was\r\nhow she would fare against\r\nLupinus, with her new\r\nmachine. As it turned out,\r\nhowever, not even this new\r\nand improved Lupinus could\r\nstop Licorice. In the middle\r\nof the race, Licorice found\r\nherself caught between\r\nLavender and Amaryllis, who\r\nhad been lapped, and it\r\nlooked as though she was in\r\ntrouble for a while. She\r\nescaped through teleporting\r\nahead in the last turn,\r\nhowever, to take the win,\r\nhandily. With two races left\r\nto go, Licorice may just\r\nhave a lock on the\r\nchampionship title already.\r\n";
const char str_084497F2[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_08449860[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Lupinus\r\n3rd Place: Daisy\x05";
const char str_084498AD[] = "The results of the eighth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08449917[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Lupinus  +6\r\n3rd Place: Daisy  +6\r\n4th Place: Cosmos  +3\r\n5th Place: Sylvia  +2\r\n6th Place: Miltonia  +1\r\n7th Place: Moraea\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_08449A04[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Licorice  50\r\n2nd (unch.): Lupinus  40\r\n3rd (down): Daisy  38\r\n4th (down): Cosmos  37\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  17\r\n6th (unch.): Sylvia  11\r\n7th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n8th (unch.): Amaryllis  5\r\n9th (unch.): Lavender  4\r\n";
const char str_08449B37[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_08449B52[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_08449BBA[] = "ELicorice\r\n";
const char str_08449BC6[] = "@On Makoto\r\n";
const char str_08449BD3[] = "@Using Spatial Magic\r\n";
const char str_08449C22[] = "@\r\nLicorice's spatial\r\ninterchange magic, which\r\nenables her to change places\r\nwith anyone else, may well\r\nbe the most powerful magic\r\nof all.\r\n";
const char str_08449D49[] = "ELavender\r\n";
const char str_08449D55[] = "@On Starlight\r\n";
const char str_08449D65[] = "@Using Divination\r\n";
const char str_08449DB1[] = "@\r\nShe always divines who will\r\nwin before a race starts.\r\nRumor has it her predictions\r\nare 100% accurate.\r\n";
const char str_08449E57[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nninth match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_08449EA3[] = "The results of the ninth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_08449F0C[] = "@\r\nIt may or may not come as a\r\nsurprise, but Licorice won\r\nthis race too, and by a\r\nmargin of 52 seconds over\r\nsecond place finisher\r\nMiltonia. This victory means\r\nthat Licorice has already\r\nwon the championship,\r\nregardless of the outcome of\r\nthe final race. That doesn't\r\nmean the competition is all\r\nover, though. We hope that\r\nall the competitors will\r\ngive their all in the next\r\nrace, even though the\r\nchampionship has already\r\nbeen decided, and they're\r\nnot likely to feel all that\r\nmotivated, as a result...\r\n";
const char str_0844A12D[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844A19B[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Miltonia\r\n3rd Place: Daisy\x05";
const char str_0844A1E9[] = "The results of the ninth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844A252[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Miltonia  +6\r\n3rd Place: Daisy  +4\r\n4th Place: Cosmos  +3\r\n5th Place: Sylvia  +2\r\n6th Place: Lupinus  +1\r\n7th Place: Lavender\r\n8th Place: Moraea\r\n9th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0844A354[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Licorice  60\r\n2nd (up): Daisy  42\r\n3rd (down): Lupinus  41\r\n4th (unch.): Cosmos  40\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  23\r\n6th (unch.): Sylvia  13\r\n7th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n8th (unch.): Amaryllis  5\r\n9th (unch.): Lavender  4\r\n";
const char str_0844A485[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0844A4A0[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844A508[] = "EAmaryllis\r\n";
const char str_0844A515[] = "@On Sakuya\r\n";
const char str_0844A522[] = "@Using Flower Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844A570[] = "@\r\nAll her magic does is create\r\nflowers, which really isn't\r\nthat useful in racing...\r\n";
const char str_0844A65F[] = "ELiliac\r\n";
const char str_0844A669[] = "@On Karin\r\n";
const char str_0844A675[] = "@Trainee in Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844A6C1[] = "@\r\nAs a trainee, Lilac has no\r\nmagic yet. Let's hope she\r\neventually makes good.\r\n";
const char str_0844A74C[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfinal match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844A798[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844A800[] = "EMoraea\r\n";
const char str_0844A80A[] = "@On Natsuki\r\n";
const char str_0844A818[] = "@Using Summoning Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844A869[] = "@\r\nI've never seen her summon\r\nanything, though, so I don't\r\nrightly know just what this\r\nmeans.";
const char str_0844A978[] = "ELupinus\r\n";
const char str_0844A983[] = "@On Maho\r\n";
const char str_0844A98E[] = "@Using Illusion Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844A9DE[] = "@\r\nLupinus's new machine, Maho,\r\nsure seems more powerful\r\nthan its predecessor, though\r\nyou can't necessarily tell\r\nfor sure from just a single\r\nglance.\r\n";
const char str_0844AAB2[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfinal match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844AAF0[] = "The results of the final\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844AB59[] = "@\r\nThis last race was pretty\r\nlackluster, probably owing\r\nto the fact that Licorice\r\nalready had the championship\r\nall sewn up for this season.\r\nOnly Licorice and Sylvia\r\nmade a real race of it, in\r\nfact. And even though she\r\nwas no match for Licorice,\r\nSylvia still managed to take\r\nsecond place with a two\r\nminute edge over third-place\r\nfinisher Lupinus.\r\n";
const char str_0844ACDA[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844AD48[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Sylvia\r\n3rd Place: Lupinus\x05";
const char str_0844AD96[] = "The results of the final\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844ADFF[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Sylvia  +6\r\n3rd Place Lupinus  +4\r\n4th Place: Daisy  +3\r\n5th Place: Cosmos  +2\r\n6th Place: Miltonia  +1\r\n7th Place: Lavender\r\n8th Place: Liliac\r\n";
const char str_0844AEEE[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Licorice  70\r\n2nd (unch.): Daisy  45\r\n2nd (up): Lupinus  45\r\n4th (unch.): Cosmos  42\r\n5th (unch.): Miltonia  24\r\n6th (unch.): Sylvia  19\r\n7th (unch.): Moraea  6\r\n8th (unch.): Amaryllis  5\r\n9th (unch.): Lavender  4\r\n";
const char str_0844B020[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0844B03B[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844B0A3[] = "ESylvia\r\n";
const char str_0844B0AD[] = "@On Mayo\r\n";
const char str_0844B0B8[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844B106[] = "@\r\nSylvia's new machine, Mayo,\r\nis an upgraded model of her\r\nYotsuba machine. It, too,\r\ncan take on any of four\r\ndifferent forms, in\r\naccordance with whichever \r\nmagic she is using at a\r\ngiven time. It's another\r\ngood one.\r\n";
const char str_0844B27D[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_0844B289[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_0844B296[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844B2E3[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_0844B385[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nfirst match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844B3D1[] = "The results of the first\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844B43A[] = "@\r\nIt's only the first race of\r\nthe season, but things are\r\noff to a riotous start. If\r\nyou can imagine, Eucomyth,\r\nrunning in her first race\r\never, found herself in a\r\nshowdown against Daisy and\r\nCosmos, the Children of\r\nLight and Darkness\r\nthemselves, who were using\r\nnew models of their Peony\r\nmachines. Licorice, who won\r\nthe previous championship by\r\nan overwhelming margin, was\r\nhandicapped this time around\r\nby a malfunctioning machine.\r\nShe attempted to recover\r\nmidway through the race by\r\nmeans of her spatial\r\ninterchange magic. Eucomyth,\r\nhowever, avoided it, amazing\r\nas that sounds, and coasted\r\nto a win. Licorice ended up\r\ncoming in sixth.\r\n";
const char str_0844B6E6[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844B754[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Eucomyth\r\n2nd Place: Daisy\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos\x05";
const char str_0844B7A0[] = "The results of the first\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844B809[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Eucomyth  +10\r\n2nd Place: Daisy  +6\r\n3rd Place: Cosmos  +4\r\n4th Place: Lupinus  +3\r\n5th Place: Sylvia  +2\r\n6th Place: Licorice  +1\r\n7th Place: Miltonia\r\n8th Place: Lavender\r\n9th Place: Moraea\r\n10th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0844B921[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st: Eucomyth  10\r\n2nd: Daisy  6\r\n3rd: Cosmos  4\r\n4th: Lupinus  3\r\n5th: Sylvia  2\r\n6th: Licorice  1\r\n";
const char str_0844B9D4[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0844B9EF[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844BA57[] = "EDaisy\r\n";
const char str_0844BA60[] = "@On Peony\r\n";
const char str_0844BA6C[] = "@Using Light Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844BAB9[] = "@\r\nCan anyone catch her when\r\nshe uses her Shining Wing\r\nspell?\r\n";
const char str_0844BB91[] = "ECosmos\r\n";
const char str_0844BB9B[] = "@On Peony\r\n";
const char str_0844BBA7[] = "@Using Darkness Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844BBF7[] = "@\r\nCosmos, Daisy's twin sister,\r\nhas magic opposite but\r\nalmost as powerful in her\r\nDark Wing spell.\r\n";
const char str_0844BC96[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsecond match will be the day\r\nafter tomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844BCE3[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844BD4B[] = "EEucomyth\r\n";
const char str_0844BD57[] = "@On Kyoko\r\n";
const char str_0844BD63[] = "@Using Temporal Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844BDB3[] = "@\r\nShe may be new to the game,\r\nbut she's got powerful\r\nmagic. How do you stop\r\nsomeone who can stop time\r\nitself?\r\n";
const char str_0844BEBE[] = "ELiliac\r\n";
const char str_0844BEC8[] = "@On Karin\r\n";
const char str_0844BED4[] = "@Trainee in Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844BF20[] = "@\r\nAs a trainee, Lilac has no\r\nmagic yet. Let's hope she\r\neventually makes good.\r\n";
const char str_0844BFAB[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nsecond match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844BFEA[] = "The results of the second\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844C054[] = "@\r\nLicorice, who struggled in\r\nthe last race with machine\r\ntroubles, was in top form\r\nthis time around. In the\r\nfinal lap, however, Eucomyth\r\napparently used her ultimate\r\nmagic, personal time, and\r\ntook first place while all\r\nthe rest of us were frozen\r\nin time. That time stop\r\naffected everyone, myself\r\nincluded, which means that\r\neven I don't rightly know\r\njust what happened. The\r\npoint is, Eucomyth suddenly\r\npopped in front of Licorice,\r\nand was thus first across\r\nthe line.\r\n";
const char str_0844C253[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844C2C1[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Eucomyth\r\n2nd Place: Licorice\r\n3rd Place: Daisy\x05";
const char str_0844C30F[] = "The results of the second\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844C379[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Eucomyth  +10\r\n2nd Place: Licorice  +6\r\n3rd Place: Daisy  +4\r\n4th Place: Cosmos  +3\r\n5th Place: Lupinus  +2\r\n6th Place: Miltonia  +1\r\n7th Place: Lavender\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0844C46A[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Eucomyth  20\r\n2nd (unch.): Daisy  10\r\n3rd (unch.): Cosmos  7\r\n3rd (up): Licorice  7\r\n5th (down): Lupinus  5\r\n6th (down): Sylvia  2\r\n7th (up): Miltonia  1\r\n";
const char str_0844C560[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0844C57B[] = "Racers in the F-3.14 MGP\r\nare as follows:\r\n";
const char str_0844C5E3[] = "ESylvia\r\n";
const char str_0844C5ED[] = "@On Mayo\r\n";
const char str_0844C5F8[] = "@Using Spirit Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844C646[] = "@\r\nSylvia's new machine, Mayo,\r\nis an upgraded model of her\r\nYotsuba machine. It, too,\r\ncan take on any of four\r\ndifferent forms, in\r\naccordance with whichever \r\nmagic she is using at a\r\ngiven time. It's another\r\ngood one.\r\n";
const char str_0844C7BD[] = "EMiltonia\r\n";
const char str_0844C7C9[] = "@On Sprite\r\n";
const char str_0844C7D6[] = "@Using White Magic\r\n";
const char str_0844C823[] = "@\r\nShe uses restorative magic,\r\nso she prefers to race\r\npretty hard, and then heal\r\nherself afterwards.\r\n";
const char str_0844C8C5[] = "@\r\nThat's all for today. The\r\nthird match will be\r\ntomorrow.\x05";
const char str_0844C903[] = "The results of the third\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844C96C[] = "@\r\nEucomyth must still have\r\nbeen feeling the\r\naftereffects of using her\r\nultimate temporal magic in\r\nthe last race. Whatever the\r\nreason, she was unable to\r\ndodge the Blue Dragon that\r\nMoraea summoned this time,\r\nand it blew her off the\r\ntrack. Moraea was herself\r\ncaught up in the collateral\r\neffects, however, which\r\nwiped her out as well, thus\r\nleaving the field clear for\r\nLicorice. Lupinus fought\r\nback with all she had, but\r\nto no avail, as Licorice\r\nsailed to her first victory\r\nof the season.\r\n";
const char str_0844CB7E[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844CBEC[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice\r\n2nd Place: Lupinus\r\n3rd Place: Daisy\x05";
const char str_0844CC39[] = "The results of the third\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844CCA2[] = "@\r\nYesterday's Race Results:\r\n1st Place: Licorice  +10\r\n2nd Place: Lupinus  +6\r\n3rd Place: Daisy  +4\r\n4th Place: Cosmos  +3\r\n5th Place: Miltonia  +2\r\n6th Place: Sylvia  +1\r\n7th Place: Lavender\r\n8th Place: Lilac\r\n";
const char str_0844CD91[] = "@\r\nPoint Standings:\r\n1st (unch.): Eucomyth  20\r\n2nd (up): Licorice  17\r\n3rd (down): Daisy  14\r\n4th (up): Lupinus  11\r\n5th (down): Cosmos  10\r\n6th (unch.): Sylvia  3\r\n6th (up): Miltonia  3\r\n";
const char str_0844CE87[] = "@\r\nAnd there you have it.\x05";
const char str_0844CEA2[] = "The results of the fourth\r\nF-3.14 MGP Race are:\r\n";
const char str_0844CF0C[] = "@\r\nEven before this race\r\nstarted, there already was a\r\nmajor upset in the works.\r\nLavender's divination\r\nforetold that she would\r\ncollide with Eucomyth in the\r\nrace, taking them both out.\r\nEucomyth paid attention to\r\nthe warning, and stayed out\r\nof the race, as did\r\nLavender, possibly out of\r\nrespect for Eucomyth's\r\ndecision. Licorice was also\r\nout of today's race. The\r\nword is she had an upset\r\nstomach.\r\n";
const char str_0844D0C1[] = "@\r\nFor now, we have the top\r\nthree racers. We'll post the\r\nfull results tomorrow.\r\n";
const char str_0844D12F[] = "@\r\nRace Results:\r\n1st Place: Daisy\r\n2nd Place: Cosmos\r\n3rd Place: Miltonia\x05";
