const char str_0845416A[] = "@\r\nEpisode 1: A Summer's Day\r\n";
const char str_084541C1[] = "@\r\nThanks to the work of \r\nMechabot Ultror, the\r\nmysterious space creature\r\nPhlogiston has been\r\ndefeated, and peace has\r\nreturned to planet Earth.\r\n \r\nHowever, this peace proves\r\nsomewhat short-lived...\"\r\n";
const char str_084542C8[] = "@\r\nThings start one day when\r\nthe four members of the\r\nMechabot Ultror team --\r\nRed, Blue, Yellow and\r\nGreen -- have come to the\r\npool to hang out and swim.\r\n\"Aaagh!\"\r\n";
const char str_084543A9[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_084543F9[] = "@\r\nYellow lets out a sudden\r\nscream.  Red rushes to her\r\naid, only to see... a sight\r\nthat will be revealed next\r\nweek!\r\n \r\nNext Time:\r\nEpisode 2: A New Menace\r\n";
const char str_084544B5[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_084544CB[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_08454513[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08454576[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08454618[] = "@\r\nEpisode 2: A New Menace\r\n";
const char str_0845466D[] = "@\r\n\"Aaagh!\"\r\nYellow lets out a sudden\r\nscream.  The others turn\r\nround and see her \r\nfloundering and thrashing \r\nabout in the water.\r\n \r\nWhat's the matter?\" yells \r\nRed as he rushes over to see\r\nwhat is happening.\r\n";
const char str_0845475F[] = "@\r\nAs he stares into the water,\r\nhe makes out what looks like\r\na sort of white mist around\r\nYellow's ankles.\r\n";
const char str_08454806[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08454856[] = "@\r\nTrying to help Yellow, Red\r\ntouches the white mist,\r\nand gets an unpleasant\r\nsurprise...\r\n";
const char str_084548EC[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 3: White Terror\r\n";
const char str_08454930[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08454946[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_0845498E[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_084549F1[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08454A93[] = "@\r\nEpisode 3: White Terror\r\n";
const char str_08454AE8[] = "@\r\n\"What IS this?\" screeches\r\nYellow, feeling her her\r\nfeet apparently being\r\npulled by the white\r\nmist-like substance.\r\n";
const char str_08454B7C[] = "@\r\nDespite himself, Red\r\nfreezes for a moment, but\r\nthen, seeing Yellow's\r\nstruggles, he hurries to her\r\nside. But as soon as he\r\ntouches the white mist, he\r\nfinds himself springing\r\ntoward the side of the pool\r\nwith a yelp of alarm.\r\n";
const char str_08454CA0[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08454CF0[] = "@\r\nRed's body is enveloped in\r\na strange light, and his\r\ntrue strength is released!\r\n";
const char str_08454D7E[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 4: Transformation\r\n";
const char str_08454DC4[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08454DDA[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_08454E22[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08454E85[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08454F27[] = "@\r\nEpisode 4: Transformation\r\n";
const char str_08454F7E[] = "@\r\nAs soon as he touches the\r\nwhite mist, Red finds \r\nhimself flung back to the\r\nside of the pool.\r\nHe examines his right \r\nhand -- the one he used\r\nto touch the white mist --\r\nand lets out a gasp. It's\r\ncovered with cuts and\r\nscratches.\r\n\"OK\", he yells, \"if we\r\ncan't fight this with our\r\nbare hands, it's time to\r\nput on the Ultror suits.\r\nUltror Transform!!!\r\nA burst of sparkling light\r\nenvelops Red's whole body.\r\nWhen he emerges, he's\r\nencased in a full suit of\r\nbrilliant red armor.\r\n";
const char str_08455184[] = "@\r\n\"Red Ultror ready to go!\"\r\nhe yells.\r\n";
const char str_084551E6[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08455236[] = "@\r\nNow that Red has transformed\r\ninto Red Ultror, will he be\r\nable to rescue Yellow?\"\r\n";
const char str_084552C6[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 5: Beyond\r\nCapability\r\n";
const char str_08455310[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08455326[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_0845536E[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_084553D1[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08455473[] = "@\r\nEpisode 5: Beyond \r\nCapability\r\n";
const char str_084554CF[] = "@\r\n\"Red Ultror ready to go!\"\r\nyells the just-transformed\r\nRed, hurling himself at\r\nthe white mist once again.\r\nFizzzzzzzzzzz..........\r\n\"Ooof!\"\r\nThe mist is mildly painful\r\nto the touch, but this time\r\nit doesn't look as if it's\r\ngoing to fling him to the \r\nside of the pool like last\r\ntime.\r\n\"OK, let's get this off..\"\r\nWith a few grunts of\r\nexertion, Ultror Red tugs\r\nthe white mist this way and\r\nthat, trying to free \r\nYellow's ankles.  Slowly but\r\nsurely, the mist starts to\r\npeel away and Yellow is \r\nalmost free...\r\n";
const char str_08455712[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08455762[] = "@\r\nAfter a long struggle,\r\nRed has manages to rescue\r\nYellow, but their troubles\r\naren't over yet...\r\n";
const char str_0845581F[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 6: Rescue\r\n";
const char str_0845585D[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08455873[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_084558BB[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_0845591E[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084559C0[] = "@\r\nEpisode 6: Rescue\r\n";
const char str_08455A0F[] = "@\r\nLittle by little, slowly but\r\nsurely, the white mist\r\nstarts to come away from \r\nYellow's legs.  Ultror Red\r\ntugs even harder, grunting\r\nwith the strain.\r\nAt last, the mist comes\r\nloose, and Yellow is free!\r\nUltror Red carries her to\r\nthe side of the pool.\r\n\"Yellow! Are you OK?\"\r\nBlue and Green also crowd\r\nround and gaze at her with\r\nconcern...\r\n";
const char str_08455BA7[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08455BF7[] = "@\r\nNow that Yellow has been\r\nrescued, the Ultror Team\r\nbreathe a sigh of relief.\r\nHowever...\r\n";
const char str_08455C8E[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 7: Rescued\r\n";
const char str_08455CCD[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08455CE3[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_08455D2B[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08455D8E[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08455E30[] = "@\r\nEpisode 7: Rescued\r\n";
const char str_08455E80[] = "@\r\n\"Yellow! Are you OK?\"\r\n\"I swallowed some water\",\r\nshe splutters.\r\nShe looks shaken, but\r\nsince she can talk, she must\r\nbe more or less all right.\r\n\"Hey, Red\", asks Blue.\r\n\"Why did you need to put \r\nyour Ultror \"suit on just \r\nto save Yellow from \r\ndrowning?\"\r\n\"I was wondering the same\r\nthing\", adds Green.\r\n\"Well...I saw that white \r\nmist stuff around Yellow's \r\nfeet.. and then as soon as I\r\ntouched it, my hand was all\r\ncut up...\"\r\n";
const char str_0845606F[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_084560BF[] = "@\r\nWhy did the white mist\r\nattack Yellow? Find out in\r\nthe next episode.\r\n";
const char str_08456142[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 8: Second Strike\r\n";
const char str_08456187[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
