const char str_08456764[] = "@\r\nEpisode 9: A Little Help\r\nFrom My Friends\r\n";
const char str_084567CB[] = "@\r\nThe girls' shrieks become\r\nincreasingly desperate.\r\n\"OK, guys, we're going to\r\nrescue those girls!\"\r\ncommands Red.  The others\r\nall nod.\r\n\"Yellow, you stay here and\r\nrest!\"\r\n\"No way! I'm fine, and I'm\r\na member of the Ultror\r\nTeam too!\"\r\n\"...OK then.  Everybody,\r\nhere we go, transform!\r\n\"Go, go go! Ultror \r\nTransform!\" they yell in\r\nunison.  There is a sudden\r\nflash, and all three are\r\nenveloped in bright light.\r\n";
const char str_084569A8[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_084569F8[] = "@\r\nNow that they've donned\r\ntheir Ultror suits, will the\r\nfour be able to save the\r\ndrowning girls?\"\r\n";
const char str_08456A97[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 10: Light Warriors\r\n";
const char str_08456ADE[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08456AF4[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_08456B3C[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08456B9F[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08456C41[] = "@\r\nEpisode 10: Light Warriors\r\n";
const char str_08456C99[] = "@\r\nA sudden flash, and the four\r\nare enveloped in bright\r\nlight.  Out of the light\r\nemerge Blue, Yellow and\r\nGreen, each in battle\r\ndress of the appropriate\r\ncolor.\r\n\"OK, let's do it!\", yells\r\nRed, and the four\r\nUltror-suited friends jump\r\ninto the pool and rush to\r\nthe aid of the drowning\r\ngirls.\t\t\t\t\t\t";
const char str_08456E02[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08456E52[] = "@\r\nIn the pool, there is \r\nplenty of white mist waiting\r\nfor them....\r\n";
const char str_08456ED2[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 11: Another White\r\nShock\r\n";
const char str_08456F1F[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08456F35[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_08456F7D[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08456FE0[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08457082[] = "@\r\nEpisode 11: More White\r\nTerror\r\n";
const char str_084570DE[] = "@\r\nWhen the four leap into the\r\npool and rush towards the\r\nstruggling girls, they\r\nsee the dreaded white mist\r\naround the girls' feet.\r\n\"Gnnh!  Ooooooof!\"\r\nPanting, they tug at the\r\nmist until it comes away\r\nfrom the victims' feet.\r\nThen they carry each girl\r\nto the side of the pool.\r\nThe rescue has only taken\r\na few seconds.\r\n";
const char str_08457260[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_084572B0[] = "@\r\nThanks to the four Ultrors,\r\nthe girls have been\r\nsaved from drowning.\r\nHowever...\r\n";
const char str_08457340[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 12: Disaster\r\n";
const char str_08457381[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08457397[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_084573DF[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08457442[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084574E4[] = "@\r\nEpisode 12: Disaster\r\n";
const char str_08457536[] = "@\r\n\"There...did we save them\r\nall?\"\r\n\"Yes, that's everyone.\r\nThey're all unconscious,\r\nthough.\"\r\n\"But... what IS that white\r\nmist thing?\"\r\n\"Well, what does it matter\r\nwhat it is?  We saved\r\neveryone who was drowning,\r\nand whatever it is, I\r\nthink we got rid it.\"\r\nBut even as Yellow is\r\nspeaking";
const char str_0845765E[] = "Ca strange\r\ngurgling noise fills the\r\nair.  The water in the pool\r\nstarts spinning like a\r\nwhirlpool, and then, in\r\ndefiance of the law of\r\ngravity, rises skywards...\r\n";
const char str_0845773F[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_0845778F[] = "@\r\nHaving tornadoed up into\r\nthe sky, the pool water\r\nchanges into white mist...\r\n";
const char str_0845781A[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 13: The Sky\r\nOvershadowed\r\n";
const char str_08457868[] = "@\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_0845787E[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_084578C6[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08457929[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084579CB[] = "@\r\nEpisode 13: The Sky\r\nOvershadowed\r\n";
const char str_08457A2A[] = "@\r\nGurgling and hissing, the\r\nwater from the pool\r\napparently evaporates to\r\nform a white mist.\r\n\"You think the white mist\r\ntook over all the water\r\nfrom the pool?\"\r\n\"Or maybe the white mist\r\nhad turned itself into\r\npool water in the first\r\nplace?\"\r\n\"Well, whichever it was,\r\nhadn't we better defeat\r\nit somehow?\"\r\n\"Absolutely!\"\r\nDuring this conversation,\r\nthe white mist has\r\nexpanded steadily, until\r\nit hangs over the entire\r\npool.\r\n";
const char str_08457C17[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_08457C67[] = "@\r\nConfronting a powerful\r\nenemy, the four friends\r\ndecide to call up the\r\nUltror Robots.\r\n";
const char str_08457CFB[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 14: \"Ultror Robots!\r\nCome To Our Aid!\"\"\r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_08457D4F[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_08457D97[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08457DFA[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_08457E9C[] = "@\r\nEpisode 14:\"Ultror Robots!\r\nCome To Our Aid!\"\"\r\n";
const char str_08457F08[] = "@\r\nGurgling weirdly, the white\r\nmist now extends over the\r\nwhole of the pool.\r\n\"If we're going to take on\r\nsomething that size, we'd\r\nbetter call up the Ultror\r\nRobots.\"\r\n\"Agreed.  OK, everybody,\r\nlet's summon them!\"\r\n\"Ultror Robots! Come to our\r\nAid\", yell the four in\r\nunison.\r\n";
const char str_08458059[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_084580A9[] = "@\r\nWhen the four are installed\r\nin their robots, the real\r\nbattle begins...\r\n";
const char str_0845812F[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 15: Ultror Robots\r\nIn Action\r\n \r\nDon't miss it!\x05";
const char str_0845817B[] = "@HARVEST MOON\r\n";
const char str_084581C3[] = "@\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR\r\nSUMMERTIME (REPRISE)\r\n";
const char str_08458226[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084582C8[] = "@\r\nEpisode 15: Ultror Robots\r\nIn Action\r\n";
const char str_0845832A[] = "@\r\n\"Ultror Robots! Come To Our\r\nAid!\r\n(The Ultror Robot Launch\r\ntheme tune plays)\r\n";
const char str_08458398[] = "@\r\nWhoosh!\r\nThe Red, Blue, Yellow and\r\nGreen robots swoop down from\r\nthe sky.\r\nFlamp!\r\nThey land on the ground.\r\nIn a trice, each of the\r\nfour friends mounts their\r\nown robot.\r\n\"Let's go!\"\r\n";
const char str_0845848F[] = "@\r\nTo be continued...\r\n";
const char str_084584DF[] = "@\r\nThe battle begins. \r\nHowever, the Ultror Robot\r\nattack does not prove at all\r\neffective...\r\n";
const char str_08458577[] = "@\r\nNext Time: \r\nEpisode 16: The Start Of A\r\nFight To The Death\r\n";
