const char str_084ABE7F[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084ABF21[] = "@\r\nEpisode 16: Courage\r\n \r\n\"THAT IS SOMETHING I CANNOT\r\nREVEAL\", replies the alien.\r\nThe four friends can think\r\nof no rejoinder.\r\n\"I ALSO HAD ANOTHER\r\nREQUIREMENT\", it continues.\r\nI NEEDED BEINGS WITH THE\r\nCOURAGE TO OPPOSE EVIL.\r\nYOU DID NOT KNOW WHAT I\r\nWAS, YET YOU APPROACHED\r\nME WITHOUT FEAR. PERHAPS\r\nYOU WILL THINK ME RECKLESS,\r\nBUT I AM WILLING TO TAKE A\r\nCHANCE AND TRUST YOU. WHAT\r\nIS YOUR DECISION? WILL YOU\r\nUSE THIS INVINCIBLE\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR TO SAVE\r\nTHE PLANET YOU LIVE ON?\"\r\n\"So basically you're\r\ngiving us a weapon, but\r\nwe have to do all the\r\nfighting ourselves?\"\r\n\"... WELL, YES, THAT IS\r\nCORRECT.\"\r\n \r\nTo be continued...  \r\n";
const char str_084AC1E0[] = "@\r\nTrailer:  \r\nThe four must give their\r\nanswer, and it has to be\r\nunanimous.  It's decision\r\ntime!\r\n";
const char str_084AC27E[] = "@\r\nNext time: \r\nMECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084AC2F0[] = "@\r\nEpisode 17: Yes\r\n";
const char str_084AC31F[] = "@\r\nThe legend begins here...\x05";
const char str_084AC33D[] = "MECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084AC39F[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084AC441[] = "@\r\nEpisode 17: Yes\r\n";
const char str_084AC470[] = "@\r\n\"... WELL, YES, THAT IS\r\nCORRECT.  SO, WHAT IS\r\nYOUR DECISION?\"\r\nThe four exchange glances,\r\nthen huddle together to\r\nconfer.\r\n\"What shall we do? I think\r\nwe should go for it.\"\r\n\"I'm OK with that.\"\r\n\"Me too...\"\r\n\"Count me in as well,\r\nnaturally!\"\r\nAll four are ready and\r\nwilling to take up the\r\nchallenge, so Red acts as\r\nspokesman, addressing the\r\nalien.\r\n\"Yes. We'll do it.\"\r\n\"VERY WELL.  IN THAT CASE,\r\nTHE MECHABOTS WILL BE YOURS.\r\nAND THESE, TOO...\"\r\nSo saying, the alien hands\r\neach child what appears to\r\nbe a wristwatch.\r\n \r\nTo be continued...  \r\n";
const char str_084AC6D8[] = "@\r\nTrailer:  \r\nThe alien's strange words\r\nhave left the four friends\r\nreeling.  Does everyone\r\nunderstand the deal that\r\nhas just been done?\"\r\n";
const char str_084AC7A0[] = "@\r\nNext time: \r\nMECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084AC812[] = "@\r\nEpisode 18: Transformation\r\n";
const char str_084AC84C[] = "@\r\nThe legend begins here...\x05";
const char str_084AC86A[] = "MECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084AC8CC[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084AC96E[] = "@\r\nEpisode 18: Transformation\r\n";
const char str_084AC9A8[] = "@\r\nThe mysterious shining alien\r\nhands each of the four what\r\nappears to be a wristwatch.\r\n\"What's this?\"\r\n\"YOU ATTACH IT TO YOUR\r\nWRIST AND ASSUME THE\r\nCORRECT POSE, THEN SHOUT\r\nSHOUT 'ULTROR TRANSFORM!'.\r\nYOUR ULTROR SUIT WILL THEN\r\nAPPEAR, COVERING YOUR WHOLE\r\nBODY. YOU NEED THE SUIT TO\r\nSHIELD YOU AGAINST THE\r\nFREQUENT IMPACTS OCURRING\r\nWHILE YOU OPERATE YOUR\r\nMECHABOT. NEVER MOUNT YOUR\r\nMECHABOT WITHOUT PUTTING\r\nYOUR SUIT ON FIRST. DO\r\nYOU UNDERSTAND?\"\r\n\"Well, yes, we understood\r\nthose instructions, but that\r\nstuff about assuming the\r\ncorrect pose was kind of \r\nweird. Why do we have to \r\na pose?\"\r\nassume \"...ER, WELL, IT IS\r\nMOST IMPORTANT TO CREATE THE\r\nCORRECT ATMOSPHERE..\"\r\n \r\nTo be continued...  \r\n";
const char str_084ACCAD[] = "@\r\nTrailer:  \r\nAre the four friends\r\nreally ready to face the\r\nmenace described by the \r\nalien?                      \r\n";
const char str_084ACD3F[] = "@\r\nNext time: \r\nMECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084ACDB1[] = "@\r\nEpisode 19: The Brink of \r\nDoom?\r\n";
const char str_084ACDF1[] = "@\r\nThe legend begins here...\x05";
const char str_084ACE0F[] = "MECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084ACE71[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084ACF13[] = "@\r\nEpisode 19: The Brink of\r\nDoom?\r\n";
const char str_084ACF52[] = "@\r\n\"...ER, WELL, IT IS MOST\r\nIMPORTANT TO CREATE THE\r\nCORRECT ATMOSPHERE..\"\r\nThe four friends are at a\r\nloss for words.\r\n\"WHAT IS WRONG? YOU FIND IT\r\nDIFFICULT TO DEVISE A \r\nSUITABLE POSE?\r\nMAYBE THIS?  OR WHAT OF\r\nTHIS? OR THIS?\"No, no it's fine.  We'll\r\ncome up with something by\r\nourselves....\"\r\n\"VERY WELL. THEN I WILL\r\nGIVE YOU THE MECHABOT\r\nULTRORS AND THE SUITS.\r\nAFTER THAT, YOU MUST\r\nCOMBINE YOUR POWERS TO\r\nDEFEAT PHLOGISTON. THAT\r\nSEEMS TO BE ALL..\r\n\"What exactly is this\r\nspace creature Phlogiston,\r\nagain?\"\r\n\"AS I TOLD YOU BEFORE,\r\nPHLOGISTON IS A GOD OF\r\nDESTRUCTION BY FIRE. \r\nEVERYTHING IT TOUCHES IS\r\nBURNED AWAY.\"\r\n\"I've never heard of a\r\ngod of destruction by \r\nfire.\"\r\nTHERE IS NO TIME TO EXPLAIN\r\nIN DETAIL. PHLOGISTON WILL\r\nSOON ARRIVE ON THIS \r\nPLANET.\"\r\nTo be continued...  \r\n";
const char str_084AD2AB[] = "@\r\nTrailer:  \r\nWhat will happen when\r\nPhlogiston arrives?\r\nWill planet Earth survive?\r\n";
const char str_084AD33B[] = "@\r\nNext time: \r\nMECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084AD3AD[] = "@\r\nEpisode 20: They're Back\r\n";
const char str_084AD3E5[] = "@\r\nThe legend begins here...\x05";
const char str_084AD403[] = "MECHABOT GENESIS\r\nMECHABOT ULTROR: ZERO\r\n";
const char str_084AD465[] = "@\r\nReminder: When you're\r\nwatching TV, keep the room\r\nwell lit, and don't sit too\r\nclose to the screen.\r\n";
const char str_084AD507[] = "@\r\nEpisode 20: They're Back\r\n";
const char str_084AD53F[] = "@\r\nTHERE IS NO TIME TO EXPLAIN\r\nIN DETAIL. PHLOGISTON WILL\r\nSOON ARRIVE ON THIS PLANET.\r\nWELL, I MUST LEAVE YOU...\"\r\n[The flashback ends, and\r\nthe scene returns to the\r\npresent.]\r\n\"When we first got the\r\nUltrors, we thought\r\nPhlogiston would show up at\r\nany second, right?\"\r\n\"That's right, we did.\"\r\n\"But there was no sign of\r\nit at all.\"\r\n\"It didn't actually get \r\nhere until four whole months\r\nlater, on the first day of\r\nschool.\"\r\n\"Right.  You'd think the\r\nalien would have mentioned\r\nthe time lag, huh?\"\r\nThe doorbell chimes.\r\n\"Oh, that'll be Mom and the\r\nothers.  I guess our break\r\nkind of overran.  We'd\r\nbetter get on with those\r\nfinishing touches...\"\r\n\"OK\" chorus the other 3.\r\n \r\nThe End.  \x05";
const char str_084AD800[] = "RIFF[b";
const char str_084AD808[] = "SCR CODEd";
const char str_084AF778[] = "JUMP";
const char str_084B0230[] = "STR #8";
const char str_084B0504[] = "Mineral Town Friends!\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\nToday we'll introduce \r\nsomeone new.\r\n";
const char str_084B0548[] = "His name is Rick.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 27th of \r\nSummer.\r\n\r\nHe lives at the Poultry\r\nFarm.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B05BA[] = "his sister Popuri, \r\n";
const char str_084B05D0[] = "his mother Lillia,\r\n";
const char str_084B05E5[] = "and his dad Rod.\r\n";
const char str_084B05F8[] = "He loves his sister very \r\nmuch, and is quite \r\nprotective of her. \r\nHe also has a fierce temper.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0662[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nPopuri.\x05";
const char str_084B0686[] = "Mineral Town Friends!\r\n\r\n\r\nToday we'll introduce \r\nsomeone new.\r\n";
const char str_084B06C8[] = "This is Popuri.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\nHer birthday is the 10th of \r\nSummer.\r\n\t\t\r\nShe lives at the Poultry \r\nFarm. \r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B0742[] = "Her name is Popuri.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 3rd of \r\nSummer.\r\n\r\nShe lives at the Poultry \r\nFarm. \r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B07B8[] = "her brother Rick, \r\n";
const char str_084B07CD[] = "her mother Lillia,\r\n";
const char str_084B07E2[] = "and her dad Rod.\r\n";
const char str_084B07F5[] = "She is still childish, and\r\ncan be moody too.\r\nHer dream is to go live in\r\na big city, and she hates \r\nit when Rick babies her.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B087D[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nLillia.\x05";
const char str_084B08A1[] = "Her name is Lillia.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 27th of \r\nFall.\r\n\r\nShe runs the Poultry Farm.\r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B090F[] = "her daughter Popuri,\r\n";
const char str_084B0926[] = "her son Rick, \r\n";
const char str_084B0937[] = "and her husband Rod. \r\n";
const char str_084B094F[] = "When Lillia took sick long  \r\nago, Rod went off to find\r\nmedicine to heal her.\r\nShe's cheerful and \r\neasygoing.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B09C7[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nCliff.\x05";
const char str_084B09EA[] = "His name is Cliff.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the \r\n6th of Summer.\r\n\r\nHe likes to hang out at the\r\nChurch so much you'd think\r\nhe lives there.\r\n\r\nHe left his family before \r\narriving in Mineral Town.\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0AAE[] = "At first he spent all his \r\ntime in confessional, but \r\nnow he's beginning to make\r\nmore friends. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0B17[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nZack.\x05";
const char str_084B0B39[] = "His name is Zack.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 29th\r\nof Summer.\r\n\r\nHe owns a house in Mineral \r\nBeach. \r\n\r\nThere's someone else \r\nstaying there too...\r\n";
const char str_084B0BCC[] = "The wandering salesman\r\nWon stays there as well.\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0C01[] = "He comes and picks up \r\nthings from your Shipment\r\nbox everyday (except \r\nholidays). He also delivers\r\nwhat you buy on the TV \r\nShopping Network.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0C99[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nthe Doctor.\x05";
const char str_084B0CC1[] = "This is the Doctor.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 17th\r\nof Fall. \r\n\r\nHe runs the Mineral Clinic.\r\n\r\nAt the Clinic, \r\n";
const char str_084B0D30[] = "Elli works as a \r\nnurse-in-training.\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B0D5A[] = "He seems cool and aloof,\r\nbut is passionate about his\r\npatients. He's tempted to \r\ngo study medicine in the \r\ncity, but doesn't want to\r\nleave them behind.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0DFC[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nStaid.\x05";
const char str_084B0E1F[] = "His name is Staid.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 15th\r\nof Spring.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B0EA7[] = "Nappy";
const char str_084B0EC3[] = "Bold";
const char str_084B0EDC[] = "Chef";
const char str_084B0EF5[] = "Aqua";
const char str_084B0F0E[] = "Hoggy";
const char str_084B0F28[] = "Timid";
const char str_084B0F42[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nStaid likes work the most \r\nout of all of them.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B0FA3[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nNappy.\x05";
const char str_084B0FC6[] = "His name is Nappy.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 22nd\r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B104E[] = "Staid \r\n";
const char str_084B1057[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nNappy is the most happy and\r\ncheerful of the bunch.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B10BC[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nBold.\x05";
const char str_084B10DE[] = "His name is Bold.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 4th\r\nof Spring.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B1164[] = "Staid";
const char str_084B1178[] = "Nappy";
const char str_084B1192[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nBold is the most self-\r\nconfident of them all.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B11F2[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nChef.\x05";
const char str_084B1214[] = "His name is Chef.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 14th\r\nof Fall.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B1299[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nChef is the most \r\nconscientious of them all.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B12F8[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nAqua.\x05";
const char str_084B131A[] = "His name is Aqua.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 26th\r\nof Spring.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B13A1[] = "Nappy \r\n";
const char str_084B13AA[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nOf all of them, Aqua is the\r\nmost stylish and fashion-\r\nconscious.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B141E[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nHoggy.\x05";
const char str_084B1441[] = "His name is Hoggy.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 10th\r\nof Fall.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B14C7[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nHoggy enjoys eating more \r\nthan any of his brothers.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B152D[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nTimid.\x05";
const char str_084B1550[] = "His name is Timid.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 16th\r\nof Summer.\r\n\r\nHe's a Harvest Sprite who \r\nlives behind the Church.\r\n\r\nWith him live: \r\n";
const char str_084B15D8[] = "The 7 brothers (?) live here\r\ntogether.\r\n\r\nTimid is the most, well, \r\ntimid out of all of them.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B163E[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nthe Harvest Goddess.\x05";
const char str_084B166F[] = "This is the Harvest \r\nGoddess. \r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 9th of \r\nSpring. \r\n\r\nShe lives (?) in the spring\r\non Mother's Hill. \r\n\r\nShe'll appear if you throw \r\nan offering into her spring.\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B172C[] = "This is the Harvest \r\nGoddess. \r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 8th of \r\nSpring. \r\n\r\nShe lives (?) in the spring\r\non Mother's Hill. \r\n\r\nShe'll appear if you throw \r\nan offering into her spring.\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B17E9[] = "She's in charge of \r\ncommunications, and hates\r\nhaving to appear whenever\r\nsomeone throws an offering\r\ninto her spring. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B1868[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nthe Gourmet.\x05";
const char str_084B1891[] = "This is the Gourmet.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is...unknown.\r\n\r\nHe's the judge of the \r\nCooking Festival. \r\n";
const char str_084B18F4[] = "More than anything \r\nelse, he loves to eat. He \r\nknows everything about food.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B1948[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nEllen.\x05";
const char str_084B196B[] = "This is Ellen.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 13th of\r\nWinter.\r\n\r\nShe lives in a house on the\r\nnorth side of Mineral Town.\r\n\r\nHer family is:    \r\n";
const char str_084B19F6[] = "her granddaughter Elli\r\n";
const char str_084B1A0F[] = "and her grandson Stu. \r\n";
const char str_084B1A28[] = "She can't walk very well\r\nbecause of sickness.\r\nShe used to be a midwife.\r\nShe worries about Elli. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B1A92[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nElli.\x05";
const char str_084B1AB4[] = "This is Elli.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 20th of \r\nSpring.\r\n\r\nShe wants to become a Nurse,\r\nand works at the Clinic.\r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B1B3A[] = "This is Elli.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 16th of \r\nSpring.\r\n\r\nShe wants to become a Nurse,\r\nand works at the Clinic.\r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B1BC0[] = "her grandmother Ellen and\r\n";
const char str_084B1BDC[] = "her younger brother Stu. \r\n";
const char str_084B1BF8[] = "Elli believes in hard work,\r\nmaybe because she's had to \r\nraise her brother after her\r\nparents died. She can be \r\nvery strict.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B1C7D[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nStu.\x05";
const char str_084B1C9E[] = "This is Stu.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 5th of \r\nFall.\r\n\r\nHe lives in a house on the\r\nnorth side of Mineral Town.\r\n\r\nHis family is:    \r\n";
const char str_084B1D24[] = "his sister Elli and \r\n";
const char str_084B1D3B[] = "his grandmother Ellen.\x05";
const char str_084B1D53[] = "Stu loves to play jokes\r\non people, but he's also a \r\ncry-baby. Still, the \r\ntownspeople all like him.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B1DC0[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nJeff.\x05";
const char str_084B1DE2[] = "This is Jeff.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 29th\r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nHe runs the Supermarket.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B1E49[] = "his wife Sasha and \r\n";
const char str_084B1E5F[] = "his daughter Karen. \r\n";
const char str_084B1E76[] = "He can never stand up to \r\npeople, so he always lets\r\neveryone buy on credit.\r\nSo, he suffers from ulcers.\r\nHe's been picked on by Duke\r\nfrom childhood.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B1F15[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nKaren.\x05";
const char str_084B1F38[] = "This is Karen.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 23rd\r\nof Fall. \r\n\r\nHer father runs the\r\nSupermarket.\r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B1FA8[] = "This is Karen.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 15th\r\nof Fall. \r\n\r\nHer father runs the\r\nSupermarket.\r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B2018[] = "her father Jeff and \r\n";
const char str_084B202F[] = "her mother Sasha.  \r\n";
const char str_084B2045[] = "She takes after her mother,\r\nso she likes to help folks.\r\nShe likes to drink and \r\ndance, but can't cook \r\nat all. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B20BF[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nSasha.\x05";
const char str_084B20E2[] = "This is Sasha. \r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 30th\r\nof Spring. \r\n\r\nShe runs the Supermarket.\r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B214D[] = "her husband Jeff and \r\n";
const char str_084B2165[] = "her daughter Karen.\r\n";
const char str_084B217B[] = "Unlike her husband, she\r\nis confident and assertive.\r\nShe loves her husband, but\r\nhas to look after him.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B21EA[] = "This is Doug. \r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 11th\r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nHe runs a bar, restaurant\r\nand inn called \"Doug's \r\nInn.\"\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B2271[] = "He always worries about\r\nAnn, whom he raised alone.\r\nHe still can't forget Ann's\r\nmom, who died. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B22D9[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nAnn.\x05";
const char str_084B22FA[] = "This is Ann.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 22nd of\r\nSummer.\r\n\r\nShe always helps out her\r\ndad at Doug's Inn. \r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B2375[] = "This is Ann.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 17th of\r\nSummer.\r\n\r\nShe always helps out her\r\ndad at Doug's Inn. \r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B23F0[] = "her dad Doug. \r\n";
const char str_084B2401[] = "She has no confidence \r\nin herself at all when it \r\ncomes to love.\r\nMaybe because she's a \r\ntom-boy. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B246D[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nthe Kappa.\x05";
const char str_084B2494[] = "This is the Kappa. \r\n\r\nHis (?) birthday is...\r\nunknown.\r\n\r\nHe lives in the lake on \r\nMother's Hill.\r\n\r\nHe likes Cucumbers a lot.\r\nHe also gets upset when he\r\ngets caught up in the hooks\r\nwhen people fish in the \r\nlake. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B2576[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nBasil.\x05";
const char str_084B2599[] = "This is Basil.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 11th\r\nof Summer. \r\n\r\nHe's a scientist, and books\r\nwritten by him are at\r\nMary's Library.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B262D[] = "his wife Anna and \r\n";
const char str_084B2642[] = "his daughter Mary.\r\n";
const char str_084B2657[] = "He came to Mineral Town\r\nwith his family to study \r\nthe flora there. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B26A3[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nMary.\x05";
const char str_084B26C5[] = "This is Mary.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 25th of\r\nWinter.\r\n\r\nShe works at the Library.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is:   \r\n";
const char str_084B2731[] = "This is Mary.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 20th of\r\nWinter.\r\n\r\nShe works at the Library.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is:   \r\n";
const char str_084B279D[] = "her dad Basil and \r\n";
const char str_084B27B2[] = "her mother Anna.  \r\n";
const char str_084B27C7[] = "She loves books, and even\r\nwrites novels herself. \r\nShe's not very interested\r\nin romance at all. \r\n\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B2831[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nAnna.\x05";
const char str_084B2853[] = "This is Anna.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 23rd of\r\nFall. \r\n\r\nShe lives next to the \r\nLibrary. \r\n\r\nHer family is:  \r\n";
const char str_084B28C3[] = "her husband Basil and \r\n";
const char str_084B28DC[] = "her daughter Mary. \r\n";
const char str_084B28F2[] = "She is enjoying the country\r\nliving but a little bored\r\nbecause Basil is always\r\nbusy studying.\r\nGood at baking.";
const char str_084B29A7[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nWon.\x05";
const char str_084B29C8[] = "This is Won.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 19th\r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nHe's a wandering salesman \r\nwho just appeared in\r\nMineral Town. For some \r\nreason, he \r\n";
const char str_084B2A59[] = "lives at Zack's house,\r\nwhere he also runs his\r\nshop.  \r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B2A96[] = "He comes to the farm once \r\nin a while to sell his \r\nwares.\r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B2AD8[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nThomas.\x05";
const char str_084B2AFC[] = "This is Thomas.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 25th\r\nof Summer.\r\n\r\nHe is a Mayor, and lives in\r\na house on the north side.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B2B84[] = "his son Harris.  \r\n";
const char str_084B2B98[] = "A photographer named \r\nKano used to live with him,\r\nbut no more.\r\n\r\n\r\nHe believes in serving the\r\ntownspeople as well as he\r\ncan. He takes Ellen Apple\r\nPie every Sunday. He wants \r\neverybody in his town to \r\nbe friendly to each other.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B2C8C[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nHarris.\x05";
const char str_084B2CB0[] = "This is Harris. \r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 4th of\r\nSummer. \r\n\r\nHe is a policeman, and \r\nlives on the north side.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B2D33[] = "his father Thomas.\r\n";
const char str_084B2D48[] = "He's in charge of keeping\r\nthe peace in town.\r\nHe's in love with Aja, who\r\nlives in the city. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B2DAD[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nDuke.\x05";
const char str_084B2DCF[] = "This is Duke\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 15th\r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nHe runs Aja Winery. \r\n\r\nHis family is:  \r\n";
const char str_084B2E32[] = "his wife Manna and  \r\n";
const char str_084B2E49[] = "his daughter Aja. \r\n";
const char str_084B2E5E[] = "He liked drinking to begin\r\nwith, but ever since Aja \r\nleft he's been drinking \r\ntoo much. He's a bully to \r\neveryone (except Manna, \r\nof course).\r\n\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B2EF8[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nManna.\x05";
const char str_084B2F1B[] = "This is Manna.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 11th of \r\nFall. \r\n\r\nShe runs Aja Winery.\r\n\r\nHer family is:  \r\n";
const char str_084B2F80[] = "her husband Duke \r\n";
const char str_084B2F94[] = "and her daughter Aja. \r\n";
const char str_084B2FAD[] = "She loves to talk and \r\ngossip about others.\r\nShe always hopes that Aja\r\nwill come back home. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B3012[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nCarter.\x05";
const char str_084B3036[] = "This is Carter. \r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 20th of\r\nFall. \r\n\r\nHe is a priest who lives \r\nat the Church. \r\n";
const char str_084B309E[] = "He came to Mineral Town to\r\nspread the gospel, but seems\r\nnot to preach very much \r\nlately. He can lift curses \r\nfrom Tools, but wants to \r\nhelp people in other ways,\r\ntoo. \r\n\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B3153[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nKai.\x05";
const char str_084B3174[] = "This is Kai. \r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 22nd of\r\nSummer. \r\n\r\nHe runs Kai's Beach House\r\nduring the Summer. \r\n";
const char str_084B31DF[] = "He comes from the city to \r\nspend Summers in Mineral\r\nBeach. He's popular with \r\nwomen and children, but men\r\ndon't like his attitude\r\nmuch. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B3273[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nGray.\x05";
const char str_084B3295[] = "This is Gray. \r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 6th \r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nHe is a blacksmith's apprentice.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B3305[] = "his uncle Saibara. \r\n";
const char str_084B331B[] = "He came to Mineral Town to\r\napprentice with his uncle.\r\nHe hated it at first, but \r\nthen began to like it.\r\nHe's very prideful, but \r\nwith a good heart. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B33BB[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nSaibara.\x05";
const char str_084B33E0[] = "This is Saibara.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 11th of\r\nSpring.\r\n\r\nHe's a blacksmith.\r\n\r\nHis family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B3444[] = "his grandson Gray. \r\n";
const char str_084B345A[] = "He's a stubborn old man,\r\nbut he takes great pride in\r\nhis work. He's training his\r\nnephew Gray.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B34C4[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nGotz.\x05";
const char str_084B34E6[] = "This is Gotz.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 2nd of\r\nFall. \r\n\r\nHe's a woodcutter who lives\r\nalone in the woods.\r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B3553[] = "Both his daughter and\r\nwife died on the mountain\r\nyears ago. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B3597[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nMay.\x05";
const char str_084B35B8[] = "This is May.\r\n\r\nHer birthday is the 26th \r\nof Winter.\r\n\r\nShe lives in Yodel Farm. \r\n\r\nHer family is: \r\n";
const char str_084B3620[] = "her grandfather Barley\r\n";
const char str_084B3639[] = "and her mother Joanna. \r\n \r\n";
const char str_084B3656[] = "May is a very sweet little\r\ngirl, whom everybody loves.\r\nShe hopes everyday for her\r\nmom to come back. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B36C4[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nBarley.\x05";
const char str_084B36E8[] = "This is Barley.\r\n\r\nHis birthday is the 17th \r\nof Spring.\r\n\r\nHe runs Yodel Farm.\r\n\r\nHis family is:  \r\n";
const char str_084B374E[] = "his granddaughter May and \r\n";
const char str_084B376B[] = "his daughter Joanna. \r\n";
const char str_084B3783[] = "His daughter Joanna left to\r\nthe city, then returned \r\nwith her daughter, May.\r\nHowever, she then left May\r\nwith Barley before leaving \r\nagain. Barley loves May \r\nvery much, so he worries \r\nabout her. \r\n\r\n\r\n";
const char str_084B3853[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nsomeone who never appears.\x05";
const char str_084B388A[] = "Today we'll introduce \r\nsomeone new.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is Kano.\r\nHis birthday is the 2nd of \r\nWinter. \r\n\r\nHe takes photographs of \r\nMineral Town to show people\r\nliving in harmony with \r\nNature. \r\n\r\n\r\nThis is Louis.\r\nHis birthday is the 2nd of \r\nSpring. \r\n\r\nHe studies insects, and \r\ncame to Mineral Town to\r\nwrite about Bees.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is Greg.\r\nHis birthday is the 29th\r\nof Spring.\r\nHe loves fishing, and \r\nFishing Rods in particular. \r\n";
const char str_084B3A39[] = "Next time we'll introduce\r\nRick.\x05";
const char str_084B3A5C[] = "RIFF";
const char str_084B3A64[] = "SCR CODE";
const char str_084B4383[] = " JUMP\\\x04";
const char str_084B47E8[] = "STR ";
const char str_084B49E4[] = "1st day of Spring\r\nToday from evening at Rose\r\nSquare: \r\nNew Year Festival\x05";
const char str_084B4A30[] = "2nd day of Spring\r\nEvents This Season\r\n18th: Spring \r\n22nd: Cooking Festival\x05";
