const char str_084BBC74[] = "New Year Snbowball Fight\r\n\r\n\r\n\"This is a snowball fight \r\n between the two teams.\r\n\r\n Oh! Mr. Z lands a big one \r\n on Mr. X...\r\n\r\n There goes Ms. X, \r\n aiming right for Mr. \r\n Y's nose!\r\n\r\n Mr. X is back for revenge!\r\n Hey...was there a rock \r\n inside that one!?\r\n\r\n Let's play fair now, \r\n everybody!...\r\n\r\n\r\n Until next year, then...\x05";
