const char str_084C0AF1[] = "@\r\nMiss Annie\r\nI knew it as soon as I heard\r\nvoice! And that mask can't\r\nhide that hair. No one else\r\nin school is both so short\r\nand dyes her hair orange. It\r\nhad to be you, Kimberly.\r\n";
